"looking muscles.  This one is still a juvenile; it'll take a while before it"
" can be ridden."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/monsters/mammal.json
msgid "horse"
msgid_plural "horses"
msgstr[0] ""
msgstr[1] ""
msgstr[2] ""

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'horse'}
#: data/json/monsters/mammal.json
msgid ""
"A hooved grazing mammal with a mane of hair, a sweeping tail, and powerful-"
"looking muscles."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/monsters/mammal.json
msgid "lemming"
msgid_plural "lemmings"
msgstr[0] ""
msgstr[1] ""
msgstr[2] ""

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'lemming'}
#: data/json/monsters/mammal.json
msgid ""
"The Northern bog lemming, a small, predominantly vegetarian rodent that "
"spends its life in the murk of swamps and other wetlands.  Contrary to "
"popular belief, these creatures are not particularly hapless or suicidal, "
"but they can eat themselves into scarcity within a few generations."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/monsters/mammal.json
msgid "mink"
msgid_plural "minks"
msgstr[0] ""
msgstr[1] ""
msgstr[2] ""

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'mink'}
#: data/json/monsters/mammal.json
msgid ""
"The American mink, a partially aquatic weasel, once factory-farmed for its "
"fur.  It is a capable fisher, but the presence of otters in these parts "
"makes it rely more on food from the land."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/monsters/mammal.json
msgid "moose"
msgid_plural "moose"
msgstr[0] ""
msgstr[1] ""
msgstr[2] ""

#. ~ Description for {'str_sp': 'moose'}
#: data/json/monsters/mammal.json
msgid ""
"The Eastern moose, the largest living species of deer.  While they aren't "
"aggressive unless angered, the mating season can make the bulls quite ill-"
"tempered."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/monsters/mammal.json
msgid "muskrat"
msgid_plural "muskrats"
msgstr[0] ""
msgstr[1] ""
msgstr[2] ""

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'muskrat'}
#: data/json/monsters/mammal.json
msgid ""
"A large omnivorous rodent with a thick furry pelt, found in wetlands across "
"the northern hemisphere.  It marks its territory with a musky odor for which"
" it is named."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/monsters/mammal.json
msgid "gigantic naked mole-rat"
msgid_plural "gigantic naked mole-rats"
msgstr[0] ""
msgstr[1] ""
msgstr[2] ""

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'gigantic naked mole-rat'}
#: data/json/monsters/mammal.json
msgid ""
"A huge, rumbling mutated mass of wrinkly, nearly translucent skin that has "
"been toughened by constant tunneling.  Its hide is riddled with giant scabs,"
" as a pair of incisors the size of an industrial excavator's buckets gnash "
"constantly and several car-length whiskers twitch in the air.  It regularly "
"makes high-pitched chirps as it roams around."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/monsters/mammal.json
msgid "opossum"
msgid_plural "opossums"
msgstr[0] ""
msgstr[1] ""
msgstr[2] ""

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'opossum'}
#: data/json/monsters/mammal.json
msgid ""
"The Virginia opossum, a small omnivorous marsupial native to North America."
"  About the size of a cat, it is hardy and adaptive, and a fairly common "
"sight in urban areas."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/monsters/mammal.json
msgid "otter"
msgid_plural "otters"
msgstr[0] ""
msgstr[1] ""
msgstr[2] ""

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'otter'}
#: data/json/monsters/mammal.json
msgid ""
"The North American river otter is a shy water dwelling relative of the "
"weasel, living in large families along the banks of streams.  It is an "
"excellent fisher and a resourceful survivor, using the abandoned dens of "
"beavers and other animals to raise its own young."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/monsters/mammal.json
msgid "piglet"
msgid_plural "piglets"
msgstr[0] ""
msgstr[1] ""
msgstr[2] ""

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'piglet'}
#: data/json/monsters/mammal.json
msgid ""
"A domesticated omnivore descended from the wild boar, intelligent and "
"inquisitive.  Left to its own devices, it has gone feral.  Unlike the fully "
"grown version it can be tamed."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/monsters/mammal.json
msgid "pig"
msgid_plural "pigs"
msgstr[0] ""
msgstr[1] ""
msgstr[2] ""

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'pig'}
#: data/json/monsters/mammal.json
msgid ""
"A domesticated omnivore descended from the wild boar, intelligent and "
"inquisitive.  Left to its own devices, it has gone feral."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/monsters/mammal.json
msgid "rabbit"
msgid_plural "rabbits"
msgstr[0] ""
msgstr[1] ""
msgstr[2] ""

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'rabbit'}
#: data/json/monsters/mammal.json
msgid ""
"A small mammal with a cute wiggling nose, cotton tail, and made of delicious"
" flesh."
msgstr ""
"Un piccolo mammifero con un naso carino e tremolante, una coda di cotone e "
"fatto di carne deliziosa."

#: data/json/monsters/mammal.json
msgid "raccoon"
msgid_plural "raccoons"
msgstr[0] ""
msgstr[1] ""
msgstr[2] ""

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'raccoon'}
#: data/json/monsters/mammal.json
msgid ""
"A small mammal native to North America, distinctive for its dexterous paws "
"and facial markings.  It is resourceful and agile enough to open sealed "
"containers with its paws."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/monsters/mammal.json
msgid "rat king"
msgid_plural "rat kings"
msgstr[0] ""
msgstr[1] ""
msgstr[2] ""

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'rat king'}
#: data/json/monsters/mammal.json
msgid ""
"A towering swarm of mutated rats, their tails knotted together in a filthy "
"mass.  A fetid stench flows from its filthy presence."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/monsters/mammal.json
msgid "sewer rat"
msgid_plural "sewer rats"
msgstr[0] ""
msgstr[1] ""
msgstr[2] ""

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'sewer rat'}
#: data/json/monsters/mammal.json
msgid ""
"A worm-tailed rodent with long whiskers and beady eyes.  The way it squeaks "
"makes it sound… hungry."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/monsters/mammal.json
msgid "lamb"
msgid_plural "lambs"
msgstr[0] ""
msgstr[1] ""
msgstr[2] ""

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'lamb'}
#: data/json/monsters/mammal.json
msgid ""
"A timid, hooved grazing mammal, and one of the first animals ever "
"domesticated.  Its body is covered in a thick layer of wool, and the males "
"have long, spiraling horns."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/monsters/mammal.json
msgid "sheep"
msgid_plural "sheep"
msgstr[0] ""
msgstr[1] ""
msgstr[2] ""

#. ~ Description for {'str_sp': 'sheep'}
#: data/json/monsters/mammal.json
msgid ""
"A timid, hooved grazing mammal, and one of the first animals ever "
"domesticated.  Its body is covered in a thick layer of wool, and the males "
"have long, spiralling horns."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/monsters/mammal.json
msgid "squirrel"
msgid_plural "squirrels"
msgstr[0] ""
msgstr[1] ""
msgstr[2] ""

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'squirrel'}
#: data/json/monsters/mammal.json
msgid ""
"A small granivorous rodent with a long bushy tail, often seen darting amid "
"the branches of trees.  A skittish varmint with an expression of unwavering "
"austerity, it is the mortal enemy of cat and dog alike."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'squirrel'}
#: data/json/monsters/mammal.json
msgid ""
"A tiny opportunistic rodent with a long bushy tail.  The pine squirrel is "
"clever and cute, and hunted by nearly everything in the woods with a taste "
"for meat."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/monsters/mammal.json
msgid "weasel"
msgid_plural "weasels"
msgstr[0] ""
msgstr[1] ""
msgstr[2] ""

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'weasel'}
#: data/json/monsters/mammal.json
msgid ""
"The long-tailed weasel, a small but ubiquitous predator whose range extends "
"across the continent.  It forms its den in small burrows, preferring to "
"occupy the nesting holes of its prey."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/monsters/mammal.json
msgid "wolf"
msgid_plural "wolves"
msgstr[0] ""
msgstr[1] ""
msgstr[2] ""

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'wolf', 'str_pl': 'wolves'}
#: data/json/monsters/mammal.json
msgid ""
"A cunning pack predator, once extinct in the New England area, the wolf was "
"successfully reintroduced and their numbers reached record highs in the "
"decade before the Cataclysm.  Lucky you."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/monsters/marloss.json
msgid "marloss zealot"
msgid_plural "marloss zealots"
msgstr[0] ""
msgstr[1] ""
msgstr[2] ""

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'marloss zealot'}
#: data/json/monsters/marloss.json
msgid ""
"Her eyes lie vacant and spittle foams in her mouth, as she recites from the "
"hymns in rapturous ecstasy."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'marloss zealot'}
#: data/json/monsters/marloss.json
msgid ""
"His eyes lie vacant and spittle foams in his mouth, as he recites from the "
"hymns in rapturous ecstasy."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/monsters/mechsuits.json
msgid "X-03: 'Spectre' Recon Mech"
msgid_plural "X-03: 'Spectre' Recon Mechs"
msgstr[0] ""
msgstr[1] ""
msgstr[2] ""

#. ~ Description for {'str': "X-03: 'Spectre' Recon Mech"}
#: data/json/monsters/mechsuits.json
msgid ""
"The Boeing-Daewoo RMES (Recon Mechanical Exoskeleton Suit), a recent "
"acquisition by the US military, it was designed to be used in a scout-recon-"
"sniper role, due to its mobility and integrated laser sniper rifle and suite"
" of optics for target designation and battlefield awareness.  It was not "
"deployed before the Cataclysm hit, though there were a few prototypes in the"
" field.  You may be able to hack it to accept you as its pilot.  Like all "
"mech-suits it can act as a UPS from its large battery."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/monsters/mechsuits.json
msgid "X-02: 'Grunt' Combat Mech"
msgid_plural "X-02: 'Grunt' Combat Mechs"
msgstr[0] ""
msgstr[1] ""
msgstr[2] ""

#. ~ Description for {'str': "X-02: 'Grunt' Combat Mech"}
#: data/json/monsters/mechsuits.json
msgid ""
"The Boeing-Daewoo CMES (Combat Mechanical Exoskeleton Suit), a recent "
"acquisition by the US military, it was designed to be used in a fire support"
" role, due to its fearsome integrated gatling laser.  It was not deployed "
"before the Cataclysm hit, though there were a few prototypes in the field.  "
"You may be able to hack it to accept you as its pilot.  Like all mech-suits "
"it can act as a UPS from its large battery."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/monsters/mechsuits.json
msgid "X-01: 'Jack' Lifting Mech"
msgid_plural "X-01: 'Jack' Lifting Mechs"
msgstr[0] ""
msgstr[1] ""
msgstr[2] ""

#. ~ Description for {'str': "X-01: 'Jack' Lifting Mech"}
#: data/json/monsters/mechsuits.json
msgid ""
"The Boeing-Daewoo LMES (Lifting Mechanical Exoskeleton Suit), a recent "
"acquisition by the US military, it was designed to be piloted by an operator"
" to load and unload heavy material, and for limited combat support roles, it"
" was not deployed before the Cataclysm hit, though there were a few "
"prototypes in the field.  It lacks any integral weaponry, but the user can "
"fire from the open cockpit, even using the frame to support heavier "
"firearms.  You may be able to hack it to accept you as its pilot.  Like all "
"mech-suits it can act as a UPS from its large battery."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/monsters/mi-go.json
msgid "mi-go"
msgid_plural "mi-gos"
msgstr[0] ""
msgstr[1] ""
msgstr[2] ""

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'mi-go'}
#: data/json/monsters/mi-go.json
msgid ""
"This is an alien creature of uncertain origin.  Its shapeless pink body "
"bears numerous sets of paired appendages of unknown function, and a pair of "
"ribbed, membranous wings which seem to be quite useless.  Its odd, vaguely "
"pyramid-shaped head bristles with numerous wavering antennae, and simply "
"gazing upon the unnatural beast fills you with primordial dread."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/monsters/mi-go.json
msgid "mi-go slaver"
msgid_plural "mi-go slavers"
msgstr[0] ""
msgstr[1] ""
msgstr[2] ""

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'mi-go slaver'}
#: data/json/monsters/mi-go.json
msgid ""
"This is an alien creature of uncertain origin.  Its shapeless pink body "
"bears numerous sets of paired appendages of unknown function, and a pair of "
"ribbed, membranous wings which seem to be quite useless.  Its odd, vaguely "
"pyramid-shaped head bristles with numerous wavering antennae, and simply "
"gazing upon the unnatural beast fills you with primordial dread.  It is "
"carrying an oblong object that hums with an odd keening sound."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/monsters/mi-go.json
msgid "mi-go surgeon"
msgid_plural "mi-go surgeons"
msgstr[0] ""
msgstr[1] ""
msgstr[2] ""

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'mi-go surgeon'}
#: data/json/monsters/mi-go.json
msgid ""
"This mi-go has a slender body with snaking carapace along it, and even more "
"paired clawed appendages.  Its claws are smaller and more delicate looking, "
"but that does not make them less unnerving."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/monsters/mi-go.json
msgid "mi-go guard"
msgid_plural "mi-go guards"
msgstr[0] ""
msgstr[1] ""
msgstr[2] ""

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'mi-go guard'}
#: data/json/monsters/mi-go.json
msgid ""
"This, like the more common mi-go, is an alien creature; this one is more "
"heavily armored.  Its trunk is a shapeless mass of strange flesh encased in "
"an iridescent carapace, from which sprout several appendages terminating in "
"what appear to be devices of some sort.  Its pyramidal head is encrusted in "
"barnacle-like armor, aside from the bristling antennae that serve as its - "
"you must assume sensory devices and mouth."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/monsters/mi-go.json
msgid "mi-go myrmidon"
msgid_plural "mi-go myrmidons"
msgstr[0] ""
msgstr[1] ""
msgstr[2] ""

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'mi-go myrmidon'}
#: data/json/monsters/mi-go.json
msgid ""
"This creature resembles the smaller mi-go like a grizzly bear resembles a "
"human.  Its enormous, thick body is covered in an iridescent segmented "
"carapace, like a scarab crossed with an isopod.  It boasts several pairs of "
"deadly looking claws and other appendages, and it moves with a strange, slow"
" grace, like an otherworldly dancer.  It actually appears to be carrying "
"weaponry."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/monsters/mi-go.json
msgid "mi-go scout"
msgid_plural "mi-go scouts"
msgstr[0] ""
msgstr[1] ""
msgstr[2] ""

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'mi-go scout'}
#: data/json/monsters/mi-go.json
msgid ""
"This slender mi-go is a little smaller than most others of its kind.  It has"
" a weird oblong thing attached to the center of its body with some sort of a"
" diaphragm or a membrane on the end.  The thing seems like an integral part "
"of the mi-go, and all its appendages are supporting it to prevent swaying."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/monsters/mi-go.json
msgid "The mi-go scout fires its weapon!"
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'debug monster'}
#: data/json/monsters/misc.json
msgid ""
"This monster exists only for testing purposes.  It's used in the DPS "
"calculations for Best."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/monsters/misc.json
msgid "menacing debug monster"
msgid_plural "menacing debug monsters"
msgstr[0] ""
msgstr[1] ""
msgstr[2] ""

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'menacing debug monster'}
#: data/json/monsters/misc.json
msgid ""
"This monster exists only for testing purposes.  It's threatening enough to "
"warrant bullets from NPCs"
msgstr ""

#: data/json/monsters/misc.json
msgid "agile debug monster"
msgid_plural "agile debug monsters"
msgstr[0] ""
msgstr[1] ""
msgstr[2] ""

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'agile debug monster'}
#: data/json/monsters/misc.json
msgid ""
"This monster exists only for testing purposes.  It's used in the DPS "
"calculations for Agile."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/monsters/misc.json
msgid "armored debug monster"
msgid_plural "armored debug monsters"
msgstr[0] ""
msgstr[1] ""
msgstr[2] ""

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'armored debug monster'}
#: data/json/monsters/misc.json
msgid ""
"This monster exists only for testing purposes.  It's used in the DPS "
"calculations for Armored."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/monsters/misc.json
msgid "mixed debug monster"
msgid_plural "mixed debug monsters"
msgstr[0] ""
msgstr[1] ""
msgstr[2] ""

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'mixed debug monster'}
#: data/json/monsters/misc.json
msgid ""
"This monster exists only for testing purposes.  It's used in the DPS "
"calculations for Mixed."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/monsters/misc.json
msgid "ancient red dragon"
msgid_plural "ancient red dragons"
msgstr[0] ""
msgstr[1] ""
msgstr[2] ""

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'ancient red dragon'}
#: data/json/monsters/misc.json
msgid ""
"A towering, hulking dragon, with tremendous, curving horns and shining red "
"scales, its glowing maw peeled back in a hateful grimace as its eyes bore "
"into yours."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/monsters/misc.json
msgid "generator"
msgid_plural "generators"
msgstr[0] ""
msgstr[1] ""
msgstr[2] ""

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'generator'}
#: data/json/monsters/misc.json
msgid ""
"Your precious generator, noisily humming away.  Defend it at all costs!"
msgstr ""

#: data/json/monsters/misc.json
msgid "your mother"
msgid_plural "your mothers"
msgstr[0] ""
msgstr[1] ""
msgstr[2] ""

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'your mother'}
#: data/json/monsters/misc.json
msgid "Mom?"
msgstr ""

#: data/json/monsters/misc.json
msgid "evil multi-cooker"
msgid_plural "evil multi-cookers"
msgstr[0] ""
msgstr[1] ""
msgstr[2] ""

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'evil multi-cooker'}
#: data/json/monsters/misc.json
msgid "The multi-cooker's got a mind of its own!  Look out!"
msgstr ""

#: data/json/monsters/misc.json data/mods/MagicalNights/monsters.json
msgid "hologram"
msgid_plural "holograms"
msgstr[0] ""
msgstr[1] ""
msgstr[2] ""

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'hologram'}
#. ~ Description for hologram
#: data/json/monsters/misc.json data/mods/MagicalNights/monsters.json
msgid "An image made from light, nearly identical to the real deal."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/monsters/mutant_animal.json
msgid "iridescent cat"
msgid_plural "iridescent cats"
msgstr[0] ""
msgstr[1] ""
msgstr[2] ""

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'iridescent cat'}
#: data/json/monsters/mutant_animal.json
msgid ""
"As it moves, this cat's colors shift unnaturally in the light.  You can't "
"make out the breed, but its fur pattern seems to change with every step."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/monsters/mutant_animal.json
msgid "iridescent kitten"
msgid_plural "iridescent kittens"
msgstr[0] ""
msgstr[1] ""
msgstr[2] ""

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'iridescent kitten'}
#: data/json/monsters/mutant_animal.json
msgid ""
"In the light, this adorably tiny bundle of unkempt fluff is an ever-changing"
" flurry of brilliant colors."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/monsters/mutant_animal.json
msgid "void kitten"
msgid_plural "void kittens"
msgstr[0] ""
msgstr[1] ""
msgstr[2] ""

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'void kitten'}
#: data/json/monsters/mutant_animal.json
msgid ""
"This black ball of fur seems to absorb the light from its surroundings while"
" looking criminally cute."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/monsters/mutant_animal.json
msgid "void cat"
msgid_plural "void cats"
msgstr[0] ""
msgstr[1] ""
msgstr[2] ""

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'void cat'}
#: data/json/monsters/mutant_animal.json
msgid ""
"Seeing how unnaturally dark this black cat's fur is, you are certain this is"
" no ordinary cat.  Its fur seems to absorb light from the surroundings."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/monsters/mutant_animal.json
msgid "scaled bear"
msgid_plural "scaled bears"
msgstr[0] ""
msgstr[1] ""
msgstr[2] ""

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'scaled bear'}
#: data/json/monsters/mutant_animal.json
msgid ""
"This bear is covered in large, black, scales.  It seems to have slight "
"problems turning around, but its sinuous movement is no slower than that of "
"normal bears."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/monsters/mutant_animal.json
msgid "Cerbearus"
msgid_plural "Cerbearuss"
msgstr[0] ""
msgstr[1] ""
msgstr[2] ""

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'Cerbearus'}
#: data/json/monsters/mutant_animal.json
msgid ""
"Sometime between the Cataclysm and now, this black bear has gained two extra"
" heads.  This doesn't seem to have improved its disposition."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/monsters/mutant_animal.json
msgid "dambreaker"
msgid_plural "dambreakers"
msgstr[0] ""
msgstr[1] ""
msgstr[2] ""

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'dambreaker'}
#: data/json/monsters/mutant_animal.json
msgid ""
"This mutated beaver's size is almost double what it should be, and its back "
"is covered with tough-looking bristles."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/monsters/mutant_animal.json
msgid "feaver"
msgid_plural "feavers"
msgstr[0] ""
msgstr[1] ""
msgstr[2] ""

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'feaver'}
#: data/json/monsters/mutant_animal.json
msgid ""
"This mutant beaver's body is covered with brightly-colored feathers in a "
"particularly eyecatching pattern.  It must have been very lucky not to have "
"been caught by a predator before now."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/monsters/mutant_animal.json
msgid "grinning coyote"
msgid_plural "grinning coyotes"
msgstr[0] ""
msgstr[1] ""
msgstr[2] ""

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'grinning coyote'}
#: data/json/monsters/mutant_animal.json
msgid ""
"Were it not for the misshapen snout and visible teeth, this would look like "
"an ordinary Northeastern coyote.  Closer inspection of its mouth reveals row"
" after row of serrated, shark-like teeth."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/monsters/mutant_animal.json
msgid "slavering coyote"
msgid_plural "slavering coyotes"
msgstr[0] ""
msgstr[1] ""
msgstr[2] ""

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'slavering coyote'}
#: data/json/monsters/mutant_animal.json
msgid ""
"Unnatural bulges line the neck of this obviously-mutated coyote; green-"
"tinted foam flecks from its lips, and there's a crazed look in its eyes."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/monsters/mutant_animal.json
msgid "dire wolf"
msgid_plural "dire wolfs"
msgstr[0] ""
msgstr[1] ""
msgstr[2] ""

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'dire wolf'}
#: data/json/monsters/mutant_animal.json
msgid ""
"This wolf has grown to terrifying proportions, rivaling a small car.  Its "
"teeth give steak knives a run for their money, and it definitely doesn't "
"look friendly."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/monsters/mutant_animal.json
msgid "spideer"
msgid_plural "spideers"
msgstr[0] ""
msgstr[1] ""
msgstr[2] ""

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'spideer'}
#: data/json/monsters/mutant_animal.json
msgid ""
"This once-ordinary deer has grown a disturbingly agile array of extra limbs,"
" plus three extra eyes.  Its antlers wriggle subtly in the wind."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/monsters/mutant_animal.json
msgid "spideer fawn"
msgid_plural "spideer fawns"
msgstr[0] ""
msgstr[1] ""
msgstr[2] ""

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'spideer fawn'}
#: data/json/monsters/mutant_animal.json
msgid ""
"This obviously mutated adolescent deer moves unsteadily on its eight legs, "
"nervously scanning the area with all five eyes."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/monsters/mutant_animal.json
msgid "mongrel"
msgid_plural "mongrels"
msgstr[0] ""
msgstr[1] ""
msgstr[2] ""

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'mongrel'}
#: data/json/monsters/mutant_animal.json
msgid ""
"This dog of unidentifiable breed looks like it has seen better days.  Its "
"wiry hair is patchy, revealing scales underneath, but it still happily wags "
"its tails anyways."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/monsters/mutant_human.json
msgid "C.H.U.D."
msgid_plural "C.H.U.D.s"
msgstr[0] ""
msgstr[1] ""
msgstr[2] ""

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'C.H.U.D.'}
#: data/json/monsters/mutant_human.json
msgid ""
"The C.H.U.D. or Cannibalistic Humanoid Underground Dweller.  A human being "
"turned pale and mad from years of underground isolation."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/monsters/mutant_human.json
msgid "experimental mutant"
msgid_plural "experimental mutants"
msgstr[0] ""
msgstr[1] ""
msgstr[2] ""

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'experimental mutant'}
#: data/json/monsters/mutant_human.json
msgid ""
"A deformed amalgamation of man and animal.  Grotesque humanoid covered in "
"fur and a torn jumpsuit.  The sinister fangs, claws and the look of insanity"
" in his pale yellow eyes are a testament to that he lost all of his "
"humanity."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/monsters/mutant_human.json
msgid "evolved mutant"
msgid_plural "evolved mutants"
msgstr[0] ""
msgstr[1] ""
msgstr[2] ""

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'evolved mutant'}
#: data/json/monsters/mutant_human.json
msgid ""
"A towering beast that is neither human nor animal anymore.  A malformed, "
"huge creature covered in thick fur and the torn bottom part of a jumpsuit.  "
"The sinister fangs, claws and the look of insanity in his pale yellow eyes "
"are a testament to that he lost all of his humanity."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/monsters/mutant_human.json
msgid "cyclopean"
msgid_plural "cyclopeans"
msgstr[0] ""
msgstr[1] ""
msgstr[2] ""

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'cyclopean'}
#: data/json/monsters/mutant_human.json
msgid ""
"A relatively humanoid mutant with purple hair and a grapefruit-sized "
"bloodshot eye."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/monsters/nether.json
msgid "albino penguin"
msgid_plural "albino penguins"
msgstr[0] ""
msgstr[1] ""
msgstr[2] ""

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'albino penguin'}
#: data/json/monsters/nether.json
msgid ""
"Eight-feet-tall ghastly white penguins.  Placid unless otherwise provoked."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/monsters/nether.json
msgid "amigara horror"
msgid_plural "amigara horrors"
msgstr[0] ""
msgstr[1] ""
msgstr[2] ""

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'amigara horror'}
#: data/json/monsters/nether.json
msgid ""
"A hellish, vaguely humanoid horror, two stories tall.  Its face is "
"grotesquely stretched out, its limbs deformed to unrecognizable outgrowths."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/monsters/nether.json
msgid "blank body"
msgid_plural "blank bodies"
msgstr[0] ""
msgstr[1] ""
msgstr[2] ""

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'blank body', 'str_pl': 'blank bodies'}
#: data/json/monsters/nether.json
msgid ""
"This is some form of unnatural changeling creature; its appearance is a "
"bland mockery of the human form.  Featureless and pale, its repugnant "
"countenance is all the more unsettling due to its lack of eyes and "
"distinguishing features except for a perfectly round mouth.  Naked and "
"trembling, it almost seems pitiful."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/monsters/nether.json
msgid "blood sacrifice"
msgid_plural "blood sacrifices"
msgstr[0] ""
msgstr[1] ""
msgstr[2] ""

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'blood sacrifice'}
#: data/json/monsters/nether.json
msgid ""
"A defiled human body, once living.  Tortured to death long ago, it remains "
"chained to the altar, the putrescent flays of its peeled skin quivering like"
" so much flotsam upon a murky pond."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/monsters/nether.json
msgid "breather"
msgid_plural "breathers"
msgstr[0] ""
msgstr[1] ""
msgstr[2] ""

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'breather'}
#: data/json/monsters/nether.json
msgid ""
"This is some sort of unearthly pink flesh sac; moist and ridged with veins, "
"it is otherwise without discernible exterior features.  Seemingly immobile "
"and defenseless, it sits in place, swelling and collapsing upon itself as it"
" breathes."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'breather'}
#: data/json/monsters/nether.json
msgid "A weird mass of immobile pink goo.  It seems to breathe."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/monsters/nether.json
msgid "wraith"
msgid_plural "wraiths"
msgstr[0] ""
msgstr[1] ""
msgstr[2] ""

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'wraith'}
#: data/json/monsters/nether.json
msgid ""
"A gigantic shadow, chaotically changing in shape and volume.  Two piercing "
"orbs of light dominate what can only be described as its head."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/monsters/nether.json
msgid "dementia"
msgid_plural "dementias"
msgstr[0] ""
msgstr[1] ""
msgstr[2] ""

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'dementia'}
#: data/json/monsters/nether.json
msgid ""
"A crazed individual, the bloody scars on the side of its shaved head suggest"
" some sort of partial lobotomy"
msgstr ""

#: data/json/monsters/nether.json
msgid "dog"
msgid_plural "dogs"
msgstr[0] ""
msgstr[1] ""
msgstr[2] ""

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'dog'}
#: data/json/monsters/nether.json
msgid ""
"A domesticated mongrel of the canine persuasion.  In the absence of human "
"society, it has turned feral.  You feel a sudden urge to destroy it."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/monsters/nether.json
msgid "flaming eye"
msgid_plural "flaming eyes"
msgstr[0] ""
msgstr[1] ""
msgstr[2] ""

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'flaming eye'}
#: data/json/monsters/nether.json
msgid ""
"An enormous disembodied eyeball the size of a person, flying through the air"
" through some unknown agency.  Wreathed in unnatural flickering blue flame, "
"it possesses a blazing yellow iris with a slitted pupil like that of a cat "
"and trails a set of flailing black tendrils as it slowly drifts about.  A "
"baleful gaze seems to emanate from it."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/monsters/nether.json
msgid "flesh angel"
msgid_plural "flesh angels"
msgstr[0] ""
msgstr[1] ""
msgstr[2] ""

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'flesh angel'}
#: data/json/monsters/nether.json
msgid ""
"A tall and slender man lacking skin and any normalcy of countenance.  Wings "
"of muscle curl forth from its back and a third eye dominates the forehead."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/monsters/nether.json
msgid "flying polyp"
msgid_plural "flying polyps"
msgstr[0] ""
msgstr[1] ""
msgstr[2] ""

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'flying polyp'}
#: data/json/monsters/nether.json
msgid ""
"A half polypous, utterly alien creature.  It's only partly material and has "
"the ability to fly, despite the absence of wings.  The air swirling around "
"it gives the impression of breathing or whistling, in a tone too high for "
"most humans to hear."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/monsters/nether.json
msgid "gozu"
msgid_plural "gozus"
msgstr[0] ""
msgstr[1] ""
msgstr[2] ""

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'gozu'}
#: data/json/monsters/nether.json
msgid ""
"This is some sort of unnatural cross between a bull and a man.  Quite "
"different from the minotaur of legend, it possesses a shaggy white bull’s "
"head on an otherwise unremarkable human body.  Clad in tattered remnants of "
"clothing, it grunts and snuffles, frothing at the mouth like a rabid animal."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/monsters/nether.json
msgid "gracken"
msgid_plural "grackens"
msgstr[0] ""
msgstr[1] ""
msgstr[2] ""

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'gracken'}
#: data/json/monsters/nether.json
msgid ""
"This is some form of eldritch monstrosity; an uncouth black being with "
"smooth, oily, skin and unpleasant horns that curve inward toward each other."
"  Tall and thin, the shadows cling unnaturally to its vaguely defined "
"humanoid form as it shuffles along, its hands twitching and spasming so "
"rapidly as to appear a little more than a black blur of claws."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/monsters/nether.json
msgid "tentacle dog"
msgid_plural "tentacle dogs"
msgstr[0] ""
msgstr[1] ""
msgstr[2] ""

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'tentacle dog'}
#: data/json/monsters/nether.json
msgid ""
"A dog's body with a mass of ropey, black tentacles reaching out from its "
"head."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/monsters/nether.json
msgid "homunculus"
msgid_plural "homunculi"
msgstr[0] ""
msgstr[1] ""
msgstr[2] ""

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'homunculus', 'str_pl': 'homunculi'}
#: data/json/monsters/nether.json
msgid ""
"A pale hairless man with an impressive athletic physique.  Its lidless eyes "
"are totally black, and seeping with blood."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/monsters/nether.json
msgid "hound of tindalos"
msgid_plural "hounds of tindalos"
msgstr[0] ""
msgstr[1] ""
msgstr[2] ""

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'hound of tindalos', 'str_pl': 'hounds of
#. tindalos'}
#: data/json/monsters/nether.json
msgid ""
"A grotesque hound-like beast, its frame is angular and emaciated and its "
"head is like that of an abyssal fish.  When it moves, twisted limbs "
"duplicate, merge, disappear, and reform in dissonance, as if a hundred "
"copies of itself were somehow forced to inhabit the same space.  Extraneous "
"to our reality, it moves between the corners of the world, hunting those "
"that would dare stepping beyond time and space."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/monsters/nether.json
msgid "human snail"
msgid_plural "human snails"
msgstr[0] ""
msgstr[1] ""
msgstr[2] ""

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'human snail'}
#: data/json/monsters/nether.json
msgid ""
"An enormous fleshy snail, with an oddly human face.  Eyestalks protrude from"
" where the eyes should be."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/monsters/nether.json
msgid "hunting horror"
msgid_plural "hunting horrors"
msgstr[0] ""
msgstr[1] ""
msgstr[2] ""

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'hunting horror'}
#: data/json/monsters/nether.json
msgid ""
"This is some sort of great viperine creature, possessed of a curiously "
"distorted head and massive clawed appendages.  It partially supports itself "
"with the aid of black rubbery wings of monstrous dimensions."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/monsters/nether.json
msgid "kreck"
msgid_plural "krecks"
msgstr[0] ""
msgstr[1] ""
msgstr[2] ""

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'kreck'}
#: data/json/monsters/nether.json
msgid ""
"This is some form of otherworldly hound.  Lean and hungry looking, its "
"twisted red flesh is stretched tightly across its misshapen, angular frame."
"  Loping grotesquely along, its unusually long neck stretches forward, its "
"skull-like head near the ground as it sniffs out its prey."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/monsters/nether.json
msgid "lepidopterid"
msgid_plural "lepidopterids"
msgstr[0] ""
msgstr[1] ""
msgstr[2] ""

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'lepidopterid'}
#: data/json/monsters/nether.json
msgid ""
"A humanoid figure flitting about on what appears to be multiple pairs of "
"insectoid wings.  Its outline is obscured by a pitch-black haze surrounding "
"it, a faint glimmer of glowing eyes evident."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Attack message of monster "{'str': 'lepidopterid'}"'s spell "None"
#. ~ Attack message of monster "{'str': 'zombie xenotech'}"'s spell "None"
#: data/json/monsters/nether.json data/json/monsters/zed_lab.json
#, c-format
msgid "Creeping darkness radiates from %s!"
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'shadow'}
#: data/json/monsters/nether.json
msgid ""
"This is an animate shadow.  Looking like nothing more than an errant patch "
"of normal shadow, it draws your attention by the way it moves subtly and "
"whispers softly in the back of your mind.  Strange intrusive thoughts "
"accompany its quiet murmurs."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/monsters/nether.json
msgid "shadow snake"
msgid_plural "shadow snakes"
msgstr[0] ""
msgstr[1] ""
msgstr[2] ""

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'shadow snake'}
#: data/json/monsters/nether.json
msgid ""
"This is an animate shadow in the form of a long and sinuous snake.  "
"Translucent and dark, it glides silently across the floor, wriggling and "
"flexing as it moves."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/monsters/nether.json
msgid "shoggoth"
msgid_plural "shoggoths"
msgstr[0] ""
msgstr[1] ""
msgstr[2] ""

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'shoggoth'}
#: data/json/monsters/nether.json
msgid ""
"A gargantuan protoplasmic blob, constantly reshaping, forming new pseudopods"
" seemingly at will.  All over its body are eyes that form and disappear.  It"
" looks at you with malice."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/monsters/nether.json
msgid "thing"
msgid_plural "things"
msgstr[0] ""
msgstr[1] ""
msgstr[2] ""

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'thing'}
#: data/json/monsters/nether.json
msgid ""
"An amorphous black creature, detaching and sprouting tentacles without any "
"apparent pause."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/monsters/nether.json
msgid "twisted body"
msgid_plural "twisted bodies"
msgstr[0] ""
msgstr[1] ""
msgstr[2] ""

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'twisted body', 'str_pl': 'twisted bodies'}
#: data/json/monsters/nether.json
msgid ""
"A human body, but with its limbs, neck, and hair impossibly twisted.  It "
"clambers around swiftly, making awful screeching sounds."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/monsters/nether.json
msgid "yugg"
msgid_plural "yuggs"
msgstr[0] ""
msgstr[1] ""
msgstr[2] ""

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'yugg'}
#: data/json/monsters/nether.json
msgid ""
"This is a huge, slimy worm-like creature.  Its pale, flattened head drips an"
" oily mucus as it breaches the ground, searching for prey.  Its pinkish "
"mouth opens and closes, revealing long fangs glistening with ropey strands "
"of saliva, which leave smoldering stains wherever they drip."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/monsters/nether.json
msgid "vortex"
msgid_plural "vortexes"
msgstr[0] ""
msgstr[1] ""
msgstr[2] ""

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'vortex', 'str_pl': 'vortexes'}
#: data/json/monsters/nether.json
msgid ""
"A twisting spot in the air, with some kind of morphing mass at its center."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/monsters/power_leech.json
msgid "leech blossom"
msgid_plural "leech blossoms"
msgstr[0] ""
msgstr[1] ""
msgstr[2] ""

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'leech blossom'}
#: data/json/monsters/power_leech.json
msgid ""
"A resplendent alien fern, crowned with flowers colored deep indigo.  It "
"appears to be the centerpiece of this otherworldly bloom."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/monsters/power_leech.json
msgid "Lightning arcs from the leech blossom!"
msgstr ""

#: data/json/monsters/power_leech.json
msgid "leech stalk"
msgid_plural "leech stalks"
msgstr[0] ""
msgstr[1] ""
msgstr[2] ""

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'leech stalk'}
#: data/json/monsters/power_leech.json
msgid ""
"A resplendent and voluminous alien fern.  A faint buzzing sound emanates "
"from it, and the shadow cast by its canopy continuously glows with electric "
"charge."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/monsters/power_leech.json
msgid "Lightning arcs from the leech stalk!"
msgstr ""

#: data/json/monsters/power_leech.json
msgid "signal tree"
msgid_plural "signal trees"
msgstr[0] ""
msgstr[1] ""
msgstr[2] ""

#. ~ Description for signal tree
#: data/json/monsters/power_leech.json
msgid ""
"A trunk stretches out into the air, its topmost branches glowing with yellow"
" light.  A low drum periodically shakes the vicinity."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Attack message of monster "signal tree"'s spell "None"
#: data/json/monsters/power_leech.json
msgid "The signal tree's branches flicker and let off a dazzling pulse!"
msgstr ""

#: data/json/monsters/power_leech.json
msgid "leech pod cluster"
msgid_plural "leech pod clusters"
msgstr[0] ""
msgstr[1] ""
msgstr[2] ""

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'leech pod cluster'}
#: data/json/monsters/power_leech.json
msgid ""
"The translucent egg pods of an alien plant, firmly attached by luminous "
"rhizomes.  You can barely distinguish a root drone floating within a cloudy "
"substance."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/monsters/power_leech.json
msgid "Lightning arcs from the pod cluster!"
msgstr ""

#: data/json/monsters/power_leech.json
msgid "root runner"
msgid_plural "root runners"
msgstr[0] ""
msgstr[1] ""
msgstr[2] ""

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'root runner'}
#: data/json/monsters/power_leech.json
msgid ""
"This clump of woody vegetation hastily clambers around in a lizard-like "
"fashion.  Three translucent scale-leaves stand tall on the backside of the "
"creature, and the thin ridges within them periodically glow through some "
"unknown mean.  It's seemingly a symbiote of the nearby alien ferns, and "
"looks ready to defend them with its life."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/monsters/power_leech.json
msgid "Sparks fly from the root runner!"
msgstr ""

#: data/json/monsters/power_leech.json
msgid "root drone"
msgid_plural "root drones"
msgstr[0] ""
msgstr[1] ""
msgstr[2] ""

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'root drone'}
#: data/json/monsters/power_leech.json
msgid ""
"A small bulb with a beak-like protuberance, skittishly roaming about under "
"three tendril rhizomes.  Dripping and glistening, it resembles a creature "
"newly born rather than a sapling grown from seeds."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/monsters/power_leech.json
msgid "Lightning arcs from the root pod!"
msgstr ""

#: data/json/monsters/reptile_amphibian.json
msgid "giant frog"
msgid_plural "giant frogs"
msgstr[0] ""
msgstr[1] ""
msgstr[2] ""

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'giant frog'}
#: data/json/monsters/reptile_amphibian.json
msgid ""
"A mutated bullfrog taller than you are.  It stares with amber eyes as it "
"considers the easiest way to swallow you whole."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/monsters/reptile_amphibian.json
msgid "sewer gator"
msgid_plural "sewer gators"
msgstr[0] ""
msgstr[1] ""
msgstr[2] ""

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'sewer gator'}
#: data/json/monsters/reptile_amphibian.json
msgid ""
"Old urban legends talked about pet alligators getting flushed down the "
"toilet and growing to adulthood in sewers.  More recently, gators have been "
"seen migrating farther north as climate change drives them to adapt or die."
"  Wherever it came from, this large specimen doesn't look like it sees "
"humans as anything other than a meal."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/monsters/reptile_amphibian.json
msgid "rattlesnake"
msgid_plural "rattlesnakes"
msgstr[0] ""
msgstr[1] ""
msgstr[2] ""

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'rattlesnake'}
#: data/json/monsters/reptile_amphibian.json
msgid ""
"The timber rattlesnake is the most venomous viper native to New England.  "
"Climatic changes have extended its range far into the north."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/monsters/reptile_amphibian.json
msgid "giant rattlesnake"
msgid_plural "giant rattlesnakes"
msgstr[0] ""
msgstr[1] ""
msgstr[2] ""

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'giant rattlesnake'}
#: data/json/monsters/reptile_amphibian.json
msgid ""
"A mutated timber rattlesnake, about three times as large as the norm.  While"
" it isn't big enough to regard humans as potential prey, it is more "
"aggressive and dangerous compared to a normal rattler."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/monsters/reptile_amphibian.json
msgid "sewer snake"
msgid_plural "sewer snakes"
msgstr[0] ""
msgstr[1] ""
msgstr[2] ""

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'sewer snake'}
#: data/json/monsters/reptile_amphibian.json
msgid ""
"An aggressive mutant variety of the worm snake, turned pale yellow from its "
"underground life.  It swarms beneath the ground and is named for its habit "
"of infesting sewer lines, but sometimes these creatures escape the storm "
"drains and get washed downstream into other waterways."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'blob'}
#: data/json/monsters/slimes.json
msgid ""
"A black blob of viscous goo, oozing across the ground like a glob of living "
"oil."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/monsters/slimes.json
msgid "brain blob"
msgid_plural "brain blobs"
msgstr[0] ""
msgstr[1] ""
msgstr[2] ""

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'brain blob'}
#: data/json/monsters/slimes.json
msgid ""
"A gigantic black blob of viscous goo, oozing across the ground like a glob "
"of living oil.  Other blobs seem to swarm around it."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/monsters/slimes.json
msgid "big blob"
msgid_plural "big blobs"
msgstr[0] ""
msgstr[1] ""
msgstr[2] ""

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'big blob'}
#: data/json/monsters/slimes.json
msgid ""
"A large black blob of viscous goo, oozing across the ground like a glob of "
"living oil."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/monsters/slimes.json
msgid "black carpet"
msgid_plural "black carpets"
msgstr[0] ""
msgstr[1] ""
msgstr[2] ""

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'black carpet'}
#: data/json/monsters/slimes.json
msgid ""
"A large black blob of viscous goo, spread thin like a rug across the ground,"
" as if its once massive form has been stretched and flattened to cover more "
"space. The surface shimmers with an oily sheen, and it pulses faintly, its "
"edges eternally creeping ever so slowly."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/monsters/slimes.json
msgid "small blob"
msgid_plural "small blobs"
msgstr[0] ""
msgstr[1] ""
msgstr[2] ""

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'small blob'}
#: data/json/monsters/slimes.json
msgid ""
"A small black blob of viscous goo, oozing across the ground like a glob of "
"living oil."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/monsters/slimes.json
msgid "amoebic mold"
msgid_plural "amoebic molds"
msgstr[0] ""
msgstr[1] ""
msgstr[2] ""

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'amoebic mold'}
#: data/json/monsters/slimes.json
msgid ""
"A formless slime mold the size of a cow.  Crusty bits of cytoplasm fall away"
" as it oozes across the ground."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/monsters/slimes.json
msgid "slimespring"
msgid_plural "slimesprings"
msgstr[0] ""
msgstr[1] ""
msgstr[2] ""

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'slimespring'}
#: data/json/monsters/slimes.json
msgid "A familiar-looking blob of goo.  It sprouts the occasional eyestalk."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/monsters/slugs.json
msgid "sludge crawler"
msgid_plural "sludge crawlers"
msgstr[0] ""
msgstr[1] ""
msgstr[2] ""

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'sludge crawler'}
#: data/json/monsters/slugs.json
msgid ""
"A sluglike creature, eight feet long and the width of a refrigerator.  Its "
"black body glistens as it oozes its way along the ground.  Eye stalks "
"occasionally push their way out of the oily mass and look around."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/monsters/slugs.json
msgid "giant slug"
msgid_plural "giant slugs"
msgstr[0] ""
msgstr[1] ""
msgstr[2] ""

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'giant slug'}
#: data/json/monsters/slugs.json
msgid ""
"A mutated leopard slug, as wide as a golf cart.  Venom dripping from its "
"fanged maw, it slithers ahead slowly, leaving a trail of glistening slime."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/monsters/triffid.json
msgid "biollante sprig"
msgid_plural "biollante sprigs"
msgstr[0] ""
msgstr[1] ""
msgstr[2] ""

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'biollante sprig'}
#: data/json/monsters/triffid.json
msgid "A short fat stalk with broad leaves and tiny flower buds."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/monsters/triffid.json
msgid "biollante sprout"
msgid_plural "biollante sprouts"
msgstr[0] ""
msgstr[1] ""
msgstr[2] ""

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'biollante sprout'}
#: data/json/monsters/triffid.json
msgid ""
"A thick stalk that rises five feet from the ground and has heavy broad "
"leaves at its base.  Purple flower buds adorn the top."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/monsters/triffid.json
msgid "biollante"
msgid_plural "biollantes"
msgstr[0] ""
msgstr[1] ""
msgstr[2] ""

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'biollante'}
#: data/json/monsters/triffid.json
msgid ""
"A drooped, quivering plant with a thick stalk adorned by a purple flower.  "
"Its petals are closed, and pulsate ominously."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/monsters/triffid.json
msgid "creeper hub"
msgid_plural "creeper hubs"
msgstr[0] ""
msgstr[1] ""
msgstr[2] ""

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'creeper hub'}
#: data/json/monsters/triffid.json
msgid ""
"A thick stalk, rooted to the ground.  It rapidly sprouts thorny vines in all"
" directions."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/monsters/triffid.json
msgid "creeper vine"
msgid_plural "creeper vines"
msgstr[0] ""
msgstr[1] ""
msgstr[2] ""

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'creeper vine'}
#: data/json/monsters/triffid.json
msgid "A thorny vine, twisting wildly as it grows with incredible speed."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/monsters/triffid.json
msgid "triffid sprig"
msgid_plural "triffid sprigs"
msgstr[0] ""
msgstr[1] ""
msgstr[2] ""

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'triffid sprig'}
#: data/json/monsters/triffid.json
msgid ""
"A teeny-tiny triffid that has recently germinated.  Like a house cat, you "
"know it wants to eat you but it just can't figure out how."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/monsters/triffid.json
msgid "triffid sprout"
msgid_plural "triffid sprouts"
msgstr[0] ""
msgstr[1] ""
msgstr[2] ""

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'triffid sprout'}
#: data/json/monsters/triffid.json
msgid ""
"A small triffid, only a few feet tall.  It has not yet developed bark, but "
"its sting is still sharp and deadly."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/monsters/triffid.json
msgid "triffid"
msgid_plural "triffids"
msgstr[0] ""
msgstr[1] ""
msgstr[2] ""

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'triffid'}
#: data/json/monsters/triffid.json
msgid ""
"A creeping animate plant, growing as tall as a moose.  It has a single bark-"
"covered stalk supporting a flowery head with a paralyzing sting concealed "
"within."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/monsters/triffid.json
msgid "triffid queen"
msgid_plural "triffid queens"
msgstr[0] ""
msgstr[1] ""
msgstr[2] ""

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'triffid queen'}
#: data/json/monsters/triffid.json
msgid ""
"A ponderous and particularly arborescent triffid.  It has enormous red "
"petals surrounded by a haze of spores, and two thick barbed vines stick out "
"from the stems like wary harpoons."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/monsters/triffid.json
msgid "vine beast"
msgid_plural "vine beasts"
msgstr[0] ""
msgstr[1] ""
msgstr[2] ""

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'vine beast'}
#: data/json/monsters/triffid.json
msgid ""
"An animated mass of roots and vines, creeping along the ground with alarming"
" speed.  The tangle is thick enough that the center from which they grow is "
"concealed."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/monsters/triffid.json
msgid "fungal fighter"
msgid_plural "fungal fighters"
msgstr[0] ""
msgstr[1] ""
msgstr[2] ""

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'fungal fighter'}
#: data/json/monsters/triffid.json
msgid ""
"A stout woody plant that can dig through the ground and flick spines from "
"its branches.  The thorns carry a fungicidal compound with paralytic "
"effects."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/monsters/triffid.json
msgid "triffid flower"
msgid_plural "triffid flowers"
msgstr[0] ""
msgstr[1] ""
msgstr[2] ""

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'triffid flower'}
#: data/json/monsters/triffid.json
msgid ""
"A giant plant with a thick stalk adorned by a purple flower.  Its petals are"
" open with ominous shine in center."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/monsters/triffid.json
#: data/json/overmap/overmap_terrain/overmap_terrain_triffid.json
#: data/mods/alt_map_key/overmap_terrain.json
msgid "triffid heart"
msgid_plural "triffid hearts"
msgstr[0] ""
msgstr[1] ""
msgstr[2] ""

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'triffid heart'}
#: data/json/monsters/triffid.json
msgid ""
"A knot of tubular roots, flowing with sap and beating like a heart.  Strands"
" of vascular tissue reach out to the surrounding root walls."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/monsters/turrets.json
msgid "milspec searchlight"
msgid_plural "milspec searchlights"
msgstr[0] ""
msgstr[1] ""
msgstr[2] ""

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'milspec searchlight'}
#: data/json/monsters/turrets.json
msgid ""
"Three high-powered searchlights with automated search AI and mounting, "
"continually seeking targets."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/monsters/turrets.json
msgid "laser turret"
msgid_plural "laser turrets"
msgstr[0] ""
msgstr[1] ""
msgstr[2] ""

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'laser turret'}
#: data/json/monsters/turrets.json
msgid ""
"The TX-5LR Cerberus is an upgrade to its predecessors.  It features a state "
"of the art revolving laser cannon system with three barrels that charge from"
" solar cells embedded in its hull."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/monsters/turrets.json
msgid "riot control platform"
msgid_plural "riot control platforms"
msgstr[0] ""
msgstr[1] ""
msgstr[2] ""

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'riot control platform'}
#: data/json/monsters/turrets.json
msgid ""
"These TALON-derived riot control platforms were widely publicized a few "
"years before the cataclysm as a new semi-autonomous device that could fire "
"less-lethal rounds with far more accuracy than a human, ensuring safer hits "
"against a target's limbs.  They were quickly adopted by prisons and inner "
"city police forces, where they demonstrated that 'less lethal' is not the "
"same as 'non-lethal'.  In the days before the cataclysm, massive stockrooms "
"of the things were put into circulation.  On the bright side, although it "
"shoots autonomously, it requires a human operator to relocate, so it's not "
"so mobile anymore."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/monsters/turrets.json
msgid "light turret"
msgid_plural "light turrets"
msgstr[0] ""
msgstr[1] ""
msgstr[2] ""

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'light turret'}
#: data/json/monsters/turrets.json
msgid ""
"The General Atomics TX-1 Guardian, an popular automated turret equipped with"
" a 9mm carbine.  Initially it was designed mainly for corporate property "
"protection and police needs, however due to its popularity, it ended up "
"being used even for military needs.  Its high-quality targeting system "
"allows it to engage targets even at medium range."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/monsters/turrets.json
msgid "medium milspec turret"
msgid_plural "medium milspec turrets"
msgstr[0] ""
msgstr[1] ""
msgstr[2] ""

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'medium milspec turret'}
#: data/json/monsters/turrets.json
msgid ""
"The General Atomics TX-5 Sentinel, an automated milspec turret equipped with"
" a 5.56mm gun.  A direct upgrade of original TX-1 Guardian for military use."
"  Designed to efficiently take down enemy personnel protected by body armor "
"at medium range."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/monsters/turrets.json
msgid "longrange milspec turret"
msgid_plural "longrange milspec turrets"
msgstr[0] ""
msgstr[1] ""
msgstr[2] ""

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'longrange milspec turret'}
#: data/json/monsters/turrets.json
msgid ""
"The General Atomics TX-7 Sniper, an automated milspec turret equipped with a"
" 7.62x51mm gun.  Designed as a counter-sniper turret to cover the "
"vulnerability of TX-5 Sentinel to sniper fire.  Its advanced target "
"recognition system and 7.62x51mm gun allows it to engage targets protected "
"by modern body armor at very long range."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/monsters/turrets.json
msgid "anti-materiel milspec turret"
msgid_plural "anti-materiel milspec turrets"
msgstr[0] ""
msgstr[1] ""
msgstr[2] ""

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'anti-materiel milspec turret'}
#: data/json/monsters/turrets.json
msgid ""
"The General Atomics TX-10 Heavy, an automated milspec turret equipped with a"
" M2HB machine gun.  Designed for light vehicles or enemies behind cover, it "
"utilizes the powerful and ubiquitous .50 BMG.  Its advanced target "
"recognition system and M2HB makes a deadly combination for anything short of"
" an armored vehicle."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/monsters/turrets.json
msgid "grenade launcher milspec turret"
msgid_plural "grenade launcher milspec turrets"
msgstr[0] ""
msgstr[1] ""
msgstr[2] ""

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'grenade launcher milspec turret'}
#: data/json/monsters/turrets.json
msgid ""
"The General Atomics TX-12 Thumper, an automated milspec turret equipped with"
" a MK19 grenade machine gun.  Designed for medium or light vehicles, it "
"utilizes high velocity 40x53mm grenades.  Such a powerful device moves the "
"bar from anything on four legs to anything on four wheels, but the minimum "
"range and the inability to return fire as a safety measure necessitates "
"cover fire from other turret systems."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/monsters/utility_bot.json
msgid "eyebot"
msgid_plural "eyebots"
msgstr[0] ""
msgstr[1] ""
msgstr[2] ""

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'eyebot'}
#: data/json/monsters/utility_bot.json
msgid ""
"A quadcopter drone largely comprised of a high-resolution camera lens and a "
"speaker, this robot hovers above the ground, documenting the carnage and "
"mayhem around it.  While it is no longer able to report to a central "
"authority, it's likely that some of its automated alert systems are still "
"functional, given that the thing seems to have an operational charging "
"station somewhere."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/monsters/utility_bot.json
msgid "grocery bot"
msgid_plural "grocery bots"
msgstr[0] ""
msgstr[1] ""
msgstr[2] ""

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'grocery bot'}
#: data/json/monsters/utility_bot.json
msgid ""
"A popular product from Uncanny, this friendly android can carry your bag or "
"push your Grocery Cart for you.  You know it's friendly because its human "
"face is constantly smiling at you.  According to the ads it uses a state-"
"machine of a complexity never seen before, Uncanny even hired professional "
"actors to record its lines.  Examine to befriend."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/monsters/utility_bot.json
msgid "busted grocery bot"
msgid_plural "busted grocery bots"
msgstr[0] ""
msgstr[1] ""
msgstr[2] ""

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'busted grocery bot'}
#: data/json/monsters/utility_bot.json
msgid ""
"A busted grocery bot, it can still carry your bag but its arms are too "
"damaged to push a Grocery Cart.  Despite its current state it's still "
"smiling at you.  Examine to befriend."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/monsters/utility_bot.json
msgid "cleaner bot"
msgid_plural "cleaner bots"
msgstr[0] ""
msgstr[1] ""
msgstr[2] ""

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'cleaner bot'}
#: data/json/monsters/utility_bot.json
msgid ""
"The Ford Sanitron, a utility robot designed for cleaning up waste material "
"in hazardous conditions."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/monsters/utility_bot.json
msgid "hauler bot"
msgid_plural "hauler bots"
msgstr[0] ""
msgstr[1] ""
msgstr[2] ""

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'hauler bot'}
#: data/json/monsters/utility_bot.json
msgid ""
"A mule-sized, quadrupedal robot designed for commercial and military use.  "
"Capable of carrying up to 180 kilograms (400 pounds), autonomously stumbling"
" about and surveying the terrain with its various cameras.  Not very useful "
"after the apocalypse, unless it has been reprogrammed to receive commands "
"from a new user."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/monsters/utility_bot.json
msgid "miner bot"
msgid_plural "miner bots"
msgstr[0] ""
msgstr[1] ""
msgstr[2] ""

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'miner bot'}
#: data/json/monsters/utility_bot.json
msgid ""
"A snake-like, segmented robot built to tunnel into the ground and detonate "
"landmines."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/monsters/utility_bot.json
msgid "nurse bot"
msgid_plural "nurse bots"
msgstr[0] ""
msgstr[1] ""
msgstr[2] ""

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'nurse bot'}
#: data/json/monsters/utility_bot.json
msgid ""
"The first product from Uncanny, a towering four-armed humanoid with a gentle"
" face.  The details of its visage are striking, but the stiffness of it "
"makes you really uncomfortable.  The end of the world did not stop it from "
"looking for patient to assist."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/monsters/zed-animal.json
msgid "jawed terror"
msgid_plural "jawed terrors"
msgstr[0] ""
msgstr[1] ""
msgstr[2] ""

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'jawed terror'}
#: data/json/monsters/zed-animal.json
msgid ""
"A once aggressive and hungry bull shark, this jawed terror is now even more "
"aggressive, possibly thanks to its lack of a functioning brain."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/monsters/zed-animal.json
msgid "zombie dog"
msgid_plural "zombie dogs"
msgstr[0] ""
msgstr[1] ""
msgstr[2] ""

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'zombie dog'}
#: data/json/monsters/zed-animal.json
msgid ""
"The deformed, animated corpse of a canine, a sinewy beast which can easily "
"outpace its two-legged friends."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/monsters/zed-animal.json
msgid "skeletal dog"
msgid_plural "skeletal dogs"
msgstr[0] ""
msgstr[1] ""
msgstr[2] ""

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'skeletal dog'}
#: data/json/monsters/zed-animal.json
msgid ""
"This once-canine has shed all of its skin, revealing a carapace of fused "
"bones and ribs.  Devoid entirely of flesh, this walking suit of bone seems "
"to be controlled by a net of veins and sinews which pulse with glistening "
"black goo."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/monsters/zed-animal.json
msgid "Z-9"
msgid_plural "Z-9s"
msgstr[0] ""
msgstr[1] ""
msgstr[2] ""

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'Z-9'}
#: data/json/monsters/zed-animal.json
msgid ""
"A zombified version of one of the German shepherd dogs used in law "
"enforcement.  Its deformed body is encased in a protective Kevlar harness."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/monsters/zed-animal.json
msgid "rot-weiler"
msgid_plural "rot-weilers"
msgstr[0] ""
msgstr[1] ""
msgstr[2] ""

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'rot-weiler'}
#: data/json/monsters/zed-animal.json
msgid ""
"Acrid smell accompanies this corpse of canine.  Its whole body is covered in"
" chains of pulsing cysts and slime-dribbling ulcers."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/monsters/zed-animal.json
msgid "grim howler"
msgid_plural "grim howlers"
msgstr[0] ""
msgstr[1] ""
msgstr[2] ""

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'grim howler'}
#: data/json/monsters/zed-animal.json
msgid ""
"A zombified wolf.  Its mouth oozes with a black substance, coating the "
"vicious-looking white fangs."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/monsters/zed-animal.json
msgid "zombear"
msgid_plural "zombears"
msgstr[0] ""
msgstr[1] ""
msgstr[2] ""

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'zombear'}
#: data/json/monsters/zed-animal.json
msgid ""
"This black bear's eyes ooze with dark, oily fluid, and its flesh is torn and"
" scarred.  It shuffles as it walks."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/monsters/zed-animal.json
msgid "festering boar"
msgid_plural "festering boars"
msgstr[0] ""
msgstr[1] ""
msgstr[2] ""

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'festering boar'}
#: data/json/monsters/zed-animal.json
msgid ""
"A zombified omnivore descended from the wild boar.  Now it's got black goo "
"all over it, instead of mud."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/monsters/zed-animal.json
msgid "zombeaver"
msgid_plural "zombeavers"
msgstr[0] ""
msgstr[1] ""
msgstr[2] ""

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'zombeaver'}
#: data/json/monsters/zed-animal.json
msgid ""
"This wall-eyed beast has a large wound on its side, and ribs with some flesh"
" on them are seen through it.  The most prominent feature of this "
"abomination is large incisors in its ominously open mouth, strange black goo"
" is oozing out of it.  Seems like it isn't interested in trees anymore and "
"is looking for some warm flesh to feed."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/monsters/zed-animal.json
msgid "antlered horror"
msgid_plural "antlered horrors"
msgstr[0] ""
msgstr[1] ""
msgstr[2] ""

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'antlered horror'}
#: data/json/monsters/zed-animal.json
msgid ""
"This formerly-majestic moose has succumbed to the infection which is killing"
" the world.  Shiny green blowflies swarm the vast suppurated patches of "
"purulent flesh where its skin has sloughed away, and its remaining fur is "
"black and matted with necrotic discharge."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/monsters/zed-animal.json
msgid "decayed pouncer"
msgid_plural "decayed pouncers"
msgstr[0] ""
msgstr[1] ""
msgstr[2] ""

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'decayed pouncer'}
#: data/json/monsters/zed-animal.json
msgid ""
"An otherwise normal-looking cougar, except that its hind legs are swollen, "
"and its eyes bulge with black goo."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/monsters/zed-animal.json
msgid "zombie cow"
msgid_plural "zombie cows"
msgstr[0] ""
msgstr[1] ""
msgstr[2] ""

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'zombie cow'}
#: data/json/monsters/zed-animal.json
msgid ""
"Once a placid cow, this leathery horror stumbles and shudders, its pulsing "
"black eyes scanning for prey beneath wicked horns.  It is big and heavy and "
"murderous."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/monsters/zed-animal.json
msgid "woodland wight"
msgid_plural "woodland wights"
msgstr[0] ""
msgstr[1] ""
msgstr[2] ""

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'woodland wight'}
#: data/json/monsters/zed-animal.json
msgid ""
"Pale, stumbling white-tailed deer with blackened eyes and drooling slime "
"down its neck.  Its legs twist and bend in strange, haphazard directions, "
"but with unnatural strength and speed.  Preys on coyotes, wolves, and giant "
"spider mutants."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/monsters/zed-classic.json
msgid "scarred zombie"
msgid_plural "scarred zombies"
msgstr[0] ""
msgstr[1] ""
msgstr[2] ""

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'scarred zombie'}
#: data/json/monsters/zed-classic.json
msgid ""
"A deformed human body, its skin transformed into one thick, calloused "
"envelope of scar tissue."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'zombie'}
#: data/json/monsters/zed-classic.json
msgid ""
"A human body, swaying as it moves, an unstoppable rage visible in its oily "
"black eyes."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/monsters/zed-classic.json
msgid "zombie cop"
msgid_plural "zombie cops"
msgstr[0] ""
msgstr[1] ""
msgstr[2] ""

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'zombie cop'}
#: data/json/monsters/zed-classic.json
msgid ""
"A human body covered by a weather-beaten and badly damaged set of riot gear."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/monsters/zed-classic.json
msgid "crawling zombie"
msgid_plural "crawling zombies"
msgstr[0] ""
msgstr[1] ""
msgstr[2] ""

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'crawling zombie'}
#: data/json/monsters/zed-classic.json
msgid ""
"This human corpse drags itself along slowly with its arms.  Its legs are "
"damaged beyond repair."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/monsters/zed-classic.json
msgid "zombie dancer"
msgid_plural "zombie dancers"
msgstr[0] ""
msgstr[1] ""
msgstr[2] ""

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'zombie dancer'}
#: data/json/monsters/zed-classic.json
msgid ""
"The foulest stench is in the air,\n"
"The funk of forty thousand years,\n"
"And grisly ghouls from every tomb,\n"
"Are closing in to seal your doom!\n"
"\n"
"The dancer doesn't even notice you, it seems like something nearby is controlling it."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/monsters/zed-classic.json
msgid "fat zombie"
msgid_plural "fat zombies"
msgstr[0] ""
msgstr[1] ""
msgstr[2] ""

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'fat zombie'}
#: data/json/monsters/zed-classic.json
msgid ""
"Stumbling as it moves, this corpse of an overweight human regards its "
"surroundings with an empty black gaze."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/monsters/zed-classic.json
msgid "firefighter zombie"
msgid_plural "firefighter zombies"
msgstr[0] ""
msgstr[1] ""
msgstr[2] ""

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'firefighter zombie'}
#: data/json/monsters/zed-classic.json
msgid ""
"A decaying human body clad in tattered firefighting gear.  It staggers "
"aimlessly, reeking of smoke and decay."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/monsters/zed-classic.json
msgid "hazmat zombie"
msgid_plural "hazmat zombies"
msgstr[0] ""
msgstr[1] ""
msgstr[2] ""

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'hazmat zombie'}
#: data/json/monsters/zed-classic.json
msgid ""
"This zombie's face and body is completely covered by a protective suit.  It "
"wanders around, unsteadily."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/monsters/zed-classic.json
msgid "decayed zombie"
msgid_plural "decayed zombies"
msgstr[0] ""
msgstr[1] ""
msgstr[2] ""

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'decayed zombie'}
#: data/json/monsters/zed-classic.json
msgid ""
"A once-dead human corpse.  Its discolored swollen flesh is riddled with "
"festering wounds and open sores."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/monsters/zed-classic.json
msgid "SWAT zombie"
msgid_plural "SWAT zombies"
msgstr[0] ""
msgstr[1] ""
msgstr[2] ""

#. ~ Description for SWAT zombie
#: data/json/monsters/zed-classic.json
msgid ""
"This zombie was part of a specialized unit of law enforcement.  It still "
"wears a battered armor with the SWAT logo emblazoned on the front."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/monsters/zed-classic.json
msgid "tough zombie"
msgid_plural "tough zombies"
msgstr[0] ""
msgstr[1] ""
msgstr[2] ""

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'tough zombie'}
#: data/json/monsters/zed-classic.json
msgid ""
"Once an athletic human, now a brutal monster.  Its facial features are "
"twisted into an expression of pure rage."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/monsters/zed-classic.json
msgid "sleek zombie"
msgid_plural "sleek zombies"
msgstr[0] ""
msgstr[1] ""
msgstr[2] ""

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'sleek zombie'}
#: data/json/monsters/zed-classic.json
msgid "This zombie is rather sleek and barely clothed."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/monsters/zed-classic.json
msgid "bouncer zombie"
msgid_plural "bouncer zombies"
msgstr[0] ""
msgstr[1] ""
msgstr[2] ""

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'bouncer zombie'}
#: data/json/monsters/zed-classic.json
msgid ""
"This zombie looks beefed and is dressed in the tattered remnants of a "
"security uniform."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/monsters/zed-pupating.json
msgid "pupating zombie crawler"
msgid_plural "pupating zombie crawlers"
msgstr[0] ""
msgstr[1] ""
msgstr[2] ""

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'pupating zombie crawler'}
#: data/json/monsters/zed-pupating.json
msgid ""
"This half of a human corpse is wrapped in sticky black fibers that cover "
"everything neck down.  Beneath the wrapping there is strange rhythmic "
"movement grotesque to behold."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/monsters/zed-pupating.json
msgid "pupating zombie"
msgid_plural "pupating zombies"
msgstr[0] ""
msgstr[1] ""
msgstr[2] ""

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'pupating zombie'}
#: data/json/monsters/zed-pupating.json
msgid ""
"This human corpse is wrapped in sticky black fibers that cover everything "
"neck down.  Beneath the wrapping there is strange rhythmic movement "
"grotesque to behold."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/monsters/zed-pupating.json
msgid "shady pupating zombie"
msgid_plural "shady pupating zombies"
msgstr[0] ""
msgstr[1] ""
msgstr[2] ""

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'shady pupating zombie'}
#: data/json/monsters/zed-pupating.json
msgid ""
"An uncanny shadow envelops this creature.  You can make out the outline of "
"what once may have been a human being, but its edges bulge rhythmically in "
"places that are not anatomically possible for humans."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/monsters/zed-winged.json
msgid "batwing zombie"
msgid_plural "batwing zombies"
msgstr[0] ""
msgstr[1] ""
msgstr[2] ""

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'batwing zombie'}
#: data/json/monsters/zed-winged.json
msgid ""
"This zombie's arms have stretched far beyond human limits, the skin "
"lengthened into a gruesome fleshy membrane.  The mutation does not suit it "
"well: it moves clumsily, even compared to other zombies."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/monsters/zed-winged.json
msgid "garghoul"
msgid_plural "garghouls"
msgstr[0] ""
msgstr[1] ""
msgstr[2] ""

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'garghoul'}
#: data/json/monsters/zed-winged.json
msgid ""
"This zombie's arms have stretched far beyond human limits, the skin "
"lengthened into a gruesome fleshy membrane.  The rest has become emaciated, "
"thin rope-like muscles ripping through taut flesh.  While it doesn't appear "
"to be able to truly fly, it uses its mutated arms to make shockingly fast "
"leaps through the air."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/monsters/zed-winged.json
msgid "flesh-raptor"
msgid_plural "flesh-raptors"
msgstr[0] ""
msgstr[1] ""
msgstr[2] ""

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'flesh-raptor'}
#: data/json/monsters/zed-winged.json
msgid ""
"This small winged predator darts through the air on three thinly haired "
"wings that look like stretched human hands.  Where the wings meet juts a "
"sheer jagged spike.  It looks like nothing you've seen on Earth, and yet "
"strangely like it was made of human parts."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/monsters/zed-winged.json
msgid "shadow raptor"
msgid_plural "shadow raptors"
msgstr[0] ""
msgstr[1] ""
msgstr[2] ""

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'shadow raptor'}
#: data/json/monsters/zed-winged.json
msgid ""
"An uncanny shadow envelops this creature.  You can make out the outline of "
"three flapping wings connected to a jagged pointed object."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/monsters/zed-winged.json
msgid "unstable flesh-raptor"
msgid_plural "unstable flesh-raptor"
msgstr[0] ""
msgstr[1] ""
msgstr[2] ""

#. ~ Description for {'str_sp': 'unstable flesh-raptor'}
#: data/json/monsters/zed-winged.json
msgid ""
"This small winged predator darts through the air on three thinly haired "
"wings that look like stretched human hands.  Where the wings meet juts a "
"jagged spike and a bloated fleshy belly."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/monsters/zed-winged.json
msgid "zaptor"
msgid_plural "zaptors"
msgstr[0] ""
msgstr[1] ""
msgstr[2] ""

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'zaptor'}
#: data/json/monsters/zed-winged.json
msgid ""
"This small winged predator darts through the air on three thinly haired "
"wings that look like stretched human hands.  Where the wings meet juts a "
"jagged spike with a pulsing electrical glow."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/monsters/zed_acid.json
msgid "acidic zombie"
msgid_plural "acidic zombies"
msgstr[0] ""
msgstr[1] ""
msgstr[2] ""

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'acidic zombie'}
#: data/json/monsters/zed_acid.json
msgid ""
"A sickly-looking dead one.  Its skin looks especially thin, with a sticky, "
"yellow fluid flowing through the clearly visible veins."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/monsters/zed_acid.json
msgid "corrosive zombie"
msgid_plural "corrosive zombies"
msgstr[0] ""
msgstr[1] ""
msgstr[2] ""

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'corrosive zombie'}
#: data/json/monsters/zed_acid.json
msgid ""
"This body has swollen to immense proportions, but still manages to hold "
"itself together with semi-congealed acid all over its bloated body.  It "
"clumsily moves around, but attacks with a large reserve of acid."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/monsters/zed_acid.json
msgid "The corrosive zombie spits a glob of acid!"
msgstr ""

#: data/json/monsters/zed_acid.json
msgid "spitter zombie"
msgid_plural "spitter zombies"
msgstr[0] ""
msgstr[1] ""
msgstr[2] ""

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'spitter zombie'}
#: data/json/monsters/zed_acid.json
msgid ""
"A hunched human body with its eyes pushed up into its forehead and drooping "
"cheeks, most of its face is occupied by a puckered mouth.  Its stomach is "
"swollen and nearly translucent, with a sickly yellow tint."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/monsters/zed_acid.json
msgid "wretched puker"
msgid_plural "wretched pukers"
msgstr[0] ""
msgstr[1] ""
msgstr[2] ""

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'wretched puker'}
#: data/json/monsters/zed_acid.json
msgid ""
"A degenerate corpse, shambling as it walks.  Several junks and waste "
"materials have unified into its skin and wounds around it reeks in black "
"goo."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/monsters/zed_acid.json
msgid "acid mortar zombie"
msgid_plural "acid mortar zombies"
msgstr[0] ""
msgstr[1] ""
msgstr[2] ""

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'acid mortar zombie'}
#: data/json/monsters/zed_acid.json
msgid ""
"This zombie's original face is gone, and in its place is a grotesque "
"amalgamation of bio-mortar.  Bone and flesh extending from a swollen, "
"cracked skull form a rounded muzzle, inside of which a constantly bubbling "
"mass of acidic fluid boils."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/monsters/zed_acid.json
msgid "acid spawner zombie"
msgid_plural "acid spawner zombies"
msgstr[0] ""
msgstr[1] ""
msgstr[2] ""

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'acid spawner zombie'}
#: data/json/monsters/zed_acid.json
msgid ""
"This zombie's head has been horribly melted and fused, its skull horribly "
"twisted and pushed to the side by a giant, swollen, acidic egg sac.  The egg"
" sac pulses incessantly, spewing out self-destructive acid maggots."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/monsters/zed_acid.json
msgid "unstable acid grub"
msgid_plural "unstable acid grubs"
msgstr[0] ""
msgstr[1] ""
msgstr[2] ""

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'unstable acid grub'}
#: data/json/monsters/zed_acid.json
msgid ""
"This unstable small creature was born from the body of an acid spawn zombie."
" With a horribly twisted body, the maggot is covered in sticky acid and "
"filled with a destructive force that bubbles inside."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/monsters/zed_acid.json
msgid "ichor brute"
msgid_plural "ichor brutes"
msgstr[0] ""
msgstr[1] ""
msgstr[2] ""

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'ichor brute'}
#: data/json/monsters/zed_acid.json
msgid ""
"A brute zombie with muscles swollen by acidic fluid and covered in festering"
" wounds.  It oozes a sticky slime from its melting flesh, clinging to any "
"surface it touches."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/monsters/zed_acid.json
msgid "ichor beast"
msgid_plural "ichor beasts"
msgstr[0] ""
msgstr[1] ""
msgstr[2] ""

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'ichor beast'}
#: data/json/monsters/zed_acid.json
msgid ""
"A large, bloated zombie dog covered in acidic slime.  Its teeth have grown "
"longer, and its broad back is covered in gnarled muscles and pus-filled "
"wounds.  Its body oozes slime, notably dripping from its jaws like some "
"nightmarish imitation of a rabid dog."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/monsters/zed_acid.json
msgid "ichor stalker"
msgid_plural "ichor stalkers"
msgstr[0] ""
msgstr[1] ""
msgstr[2] ""

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'ichor stalker'}
#: data/json/monsters/zed_acid.json
msgid ""
"This monster barely maintains its human form, with its joints bent at "
"strange angles.  Bright green liquid constantly oozes from the gaps between "
"its muscles, and it moves with surprising agility.  Its teeth and claws have"
" transformed into sharp blades, dripping with viscous slime."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/monsters/zed_burned.json
msgid "zombie kinderling"
msgid_plural "zombie kinderlings"
msgstr[0] ""
msgstr[1] ""
msgstr[2] ""

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'zombie kinderling'}
#: data/json/monsters/zed_burned.json
msgid ""
"A tiny charred body, jumping and kicked and flailing around in a mockery of "
"playground exercise.  It does not need a face for you to feel bad about "
"killing it."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/monsters/zed_burned.json
msgid "fiend"
msgid_plural "fiends"
msgstr[0] ""
msgstr[1] ""
msgstr[2] ""

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'fiend'}
#: data/json/monsters/zed_burned.json
msgid ""
"Charred zombie with bony plates, spikes and protrusions.  Moves stiffly, but"
" swiftly."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/monsters/zed_burned.json
msgid "scorched zombie"
msgid_plural "scorched zombies"
msgstr[0] ""
msgstr[1] ""
msgstr[2] ""

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'scorched zombie'}
#: data/json/monsters/zed_burned.json
msgid ""
"Heavily burned zombie that still reeks of charred flesh.  Its flesh has "
"mended into a leathery shell."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/monsters/zed_children.json
msgid "anklebiter"
msgid_plural "anklebiters"
msgstr[0] ""
msgstr[1] ""
msgstr[2] ""

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'anklebiter'}
#: data/json/monsters/zed_children.json
msgid ""
"This horrifying little mutated wretch looks to have once been a child, but "
"its massive gaping jaws are now far more suggestive of a predatory beast."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/monsters/zed_children.json
msgid "zombie child"
msgid_plural "zombie children"
msgstr[0] ""
msgstr[1] ""
msgstr[2] ""

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'zombie child', 'str_pl': 'zombie children'}
#: data/json/monsters/zed_children.json
msgid ""
"It was only a child, and little is different about it now aside from the "
"hungry look in its eyes.  You'd be hard pressed to not feel like you were "
"killing an actual child by putting it down."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/monsters/zed_children.json
msgid "creepy crawler"
msgid_plural "creepy crawlers"
msgstr[0] ""
msgstr[1] ""
msgstr[2] ""

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'creepy crawler'}
#: data/json/monsters/zed_children.json
msgid ""
"What was once a child is now a mutant beast with blackened skin and massive "
"eyes.  This abomination's vile form makes mockery of its human origin."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/monsters/zed_children.json
msgid "shriekling"
msgid_plural "shrieklings"
msgstr[0] ""
msgstr[1] ""
msgstr[2] ""

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'shriekling'}
#: data/json/monsters/zed_children.json
msgid ""
"This heavily mutated child zombie twitches and flails its limbs in painful "
"looking spasms as it runs about."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/monsters/zed_children.json
msgid "snotgobbler"
msgid_plural "snotgobblers"
msgstr[0] ""
msgstr[1] ""
msgstr[2] ""

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'snotgobbler'}
#: data/json/monsters/zed_children.json
msgid ""
"This swollen, gooey looking mutant child looks bad, even for a zombie.  "
"Maybe that's why it seems to want a hug so badly."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/monsters/zed_children.json
msgid "sproglodyte"
msgid_plural "sproglodytes"
msgstr[0] ""
msgstr[1] ""
msgstr[2] ""

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'sproglodyte'}
#: data/json/monsters/zed_children.json
msgid ""
"This crouching child-mutant's face is dominated by a pair of huge black eyes"
" and its fingertips end in sharp claws."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/monsters/zed_children.json
msgid "howling waif"
msgid_plural "howling waifs"
msgstr[0] ""
msgstr[1] ""
msgstr[2] ""

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'howling waif'}
#: data/json/monsters/zed_children.json
msgid ""
"Undeath has not been kind to the children of the apocalypse.  This one is "
"little more than a reanimated membrane of skin stretched across tiny brittle"
" bones."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/monsters/zed_command.json
msgid "zombie master"
msgid_plural "zombie masters"
msgstr[0] ""
msgstr[1] ""
msgstr[2] ""

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'zombie master'}
#: data/json/monsters/zed_command.json
msgid ""
"Once human, its features have tightened, its lips pulled back into an "
"unnatural grin, revealing rows of blackened teeth beneath its large, "
"piercing eyes.  It stands tall and its movements are fluid and tightly "
"controlled.  A feeling of danger permeates the air around it, and the light "
"that falls on it seems somehow harsher and more glaring."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/monsters/zed_command.json
msgid "zombie necromancer"
msgid_plural "zombie necromancers"
msgstr[0] ""
msgstr[1] ""
msgstr[2] ""

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'zombie necromancer'}
#: data/json/monsters/zed_command.json
msgid ""
"A twisted mockery of the human form, emaciated, with jet black skin and "
"glowing red eyes.  It is somehow painful to look at, awakening fears deep "
"within your psyche, and even the air around it seems more sinister, somehow "
"darker and more dangerous."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/monsters/zed_command.json
msgid "skeletal master"
msgid_plural "skeletal masters"
msgstr[0] ""
msgstr[1] ""
msgstr[2] ""

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'skeletal master'}
#: data/json/monsters/zed_command.json
msgid ""
"A strange zombie covered in bone plates from face to toe.  Despite the added"
" weight on its body its movements are coordinated, almost as if capable of "
"analyzing your movements."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/monsters/zed_command.json
msgid "skeletal lich"
msgid_plural "skeletal liches"
msgstr[0] ""
msgstr[1] ""
msgstr[2] ""

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'skeletal lich', 'str_pl': 'skeletal liches'}
#: data/json/monsters/zed_command.json
msgid ""
"A twisted visage of the human body decked in bone from head to toe.  Its "
"vague shape reminiscent of some tabletop monster, it walks and watches your "
"actions with a cold and calculating demeanor."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/monsters/zed_electric.json
msgid "shocker brute"
msgid_plural "shocker brutes"
msgstr[0] ""
msgstr[1] ""
msgstr[2] ""

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'shocker brute'}
#: data/json/monsters/zed_electric.json
msgid ""
"A huge beast covered in visible scarring from what you can only guess was "
"'research'.  Being near it, you can hear a slight humming, like that of an "
"electrical transformer."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/monsters/zed_electric.json
#: data/mods/CrazyCataclysm/crazy_monsters.json
msgid "shocker zombie"
msgid_plural "shocker zombies"
msgstr[0] ""
msgstr[1] ""
msgstr[2] ""

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'shocker zombie'}
#: data/json/monsters/zed_electric.json
msgid "A human body with pale blue flesh, crackling with electrical energy."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/monsters/zed_electric.json
msgid "incandescent husk"
msgid_plural "incandescent husks"
msgstr[0] ""
msgstr[1] ""
msgstr[2] ""

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'incandescent husk'}
#: data/json/monsters/zed_electric.json
msgid ""
"This once-human is visible only as a glowing white silhouette that you have "
"to squint to see, cloaked in a crackling field of lightning that pulses like"
" a beating heart.  It walks slowly and deliberately, the thunderstorm "
"surrounding it eagerly jumping to anything conductive within its grasp."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/monsters/zed_electric.json
msgid "zapper zombie"
msgid_plural "zapper zombies"
msgstr[0] ""
msgstr[1] ""
msgstr[2] ""

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'zapper zombie'}
#: data/json/monsters/zed_electric.json
msgid ""
"A very pale dead body with the worst case of static hair you have ever seen."
"  Sometimes, you can see sparks of electricity around it."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/monsters/zed_electric.json
msgid "stormbringer"
msgid_plural "stormbringers"
msgstr[0] ""
msgstr[1] ""
msgstr[2] ""

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'stormbringer'}
#: data/json/monsters/zed_electric.json
msgid ""
"Spewing blue lightning from its body, this bizarre zombie stares at its "
"surroundings with a maniacal blue glow.  There is a murderous aura around "
"it, and a cloud of condensed electrons hovers in the air."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Attack message of monster "{'str': 'stormbringer'}"'s spell "None"
#: data/json/monsters/zed_electric.json
msgid "Stormbringer beckons, and the charged cloud condenses!"
msgstr ""

#: data/json/monsters/zed_electric.json
msgid "shock vortex"
msgid_plural "shock vortexes"
msgstr[0] ""
msgstr[1] ""
msgstr[2] ""

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'shock vortex', 'str_pl': 'shock vortexes'}
#: data/json/monsters/zed_electric.json
msgid ""
"These swirls of electrified clouds are dangerous spheres made of condensed "
"lightning that float slowly over the ground, seeking victims to engulf in "
"their electrical storms."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/monsters/zed_explosive.json
msgid "boomer"
msgid_plural "boomers"
msgstr[0] ""
msgstr[1] ""
msgstr[2] ""

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'boomer'}
#: data/json/monsters/zed_explosive.json
msgid ""
"A rotund human body, bloated beyond belief and layered in rolls of fat.  It "
"emits a horrible odor, and a putrid pink sludge dribbles from its mouth."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/monsters/zed_explosive.json
msgid "huge boomer"
msgid_plural "huge boomers"
msgstr[0] ""
msgstr[1] ""
msgstr[2] ""

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'huge boomer'}
#: data/json/monsters/zed_explosive.json
msgid ""
"This boomer, normally swollen and ready to burst, has strengthened and "
"solidified.  The bile dribbling from its mouth also appears to have changed…"
msgstr ""

#: data/json/monsters/zed_explosive.json
msgid "gasoline zombie"
msgid_plural "gasoline zombies"
msgstr[0] ""
msgstr[1] ""
msgstr[2] ""

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'gasoline zombie'}
#: data/json/monsters/zed_explosive.json
msgid ""
"A huge bloated zombie that appears to have fed upon gasoline; fumes and "
"flames escape from its mouth and fuel leaks from its waddling form."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/monsters/zed_explosive.json
msgid "bloated zombie"
msgid_plural "bloated zombies"
msgstr[0] ""
msgstr[1] ""
msgstr[2] ""

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'bloated zombie'}
#: data/json/monsters/zed_explosive.json
msgid ""
"With its gray skin swollen to near rupture with putrid gas, this cyst "
"covered zombie looks like it could violently burst under the slightest of "
"disturbances."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/monsters/zed_explosive.json
msgid "zombie grenadier"
msgid_plural "zombie grenadiers"
msgstr[0] ""
msgstr[1] ""
msgstr[2] ""

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'zombie grenadier'}
#: data/json/monsters/zed_explosive.json
msgid ""
"Once a soldier, it is dressed head to toe in combat gear.  Its hands "
"constantly fumble at its many pouches."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/monsters/zed_explosive.json
msgid "zombie elite grenadier"
msgid_plural "zombie elite grenadiers"
msgstr[0] ""
msgstr[1] ""
msgstr[2] ""

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'zombie elite grenadier'}
#: data/json/monsters/zed_explosive.json
msgid ""
"Once a soldier, it is dressed head to toe in combat gear and wearing a MOLLE"
" pack.  Its hands quickly open and close its many pouches."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/monsters/zed_fusion.json
msgid "crawler"
msgid_plural "crawlers"
msgstr[0] ""
msgstr[1] ""
msgstr[2] ""

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'crawler'}
#: data/json/monsters/zed_fusion.json
msgid ""
"A conglomeration of human parts fused together in a horrible mishmash of "
"function, slowly dragging its eldritch body across the ground."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/monsters/zed_fusion.json
msgid "dissoluted devourer"
msgid_plural "dissoluted devourers"
msgstr[0] ""
msgstr[1] ""
msgstr[2] ""

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'dissoluted devourer'}
#: data/json/monsters/zed_fusion.json
msgid ""
"Human bodies fused together into a colossus with heads and limbs sticking "
"out of its bloated body.  You may have trouble estimating its healthiness "
"and its capabilities might change."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/monsters/zed_fusion.json
msgid "trapped tendril"
msgid_plural "trapped tendrils"
msgstr[0] ""
msgstr[1] ""
msgstr[2] ""

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'trapped tendril'}
#: data/json/monsters/zed_fusion.json
msgid ""
"A great tendril of mutated flesh and sharpened bone.  Emergent from a "
"crevice in the ruined floor, hundreds of human limbs seek freedom and writhe"
" incessantly from underneath its grotesque carapace.  As enormous as it may "
"already be, you feel certain that this is just part of a creature much "
"bigger, for when it moves, you can feel this whole ruin tremble, as if an "
"unseen giant struggled against the weight of its concrete tomb."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/monsters/zed_fusion.json
msgid "gangrenous flesh"
msgid_plural "gangrenous flesh"
msgstr[0] ""
msgstr[1] ""
msgstr[2] ""

#. ~ Description for {'str_sp': 'gangrenous flesh'}
#: data/json/monsters/zed_fusion.json
msgid ""
"Immobile from grievous wounds, its gray skin has bloated to near rupture "
"with putrid gas.  Between lumps of unrecognizable gore, a human head lamely "
"follows your walking with empty, black eyes."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/monsters/zed_fusion.json
msgid "gangrenous crawler"
msgid_plural "gangrenous crawlers"
msgstr[0] ""
msgstr[1] ""
msgstr[2] ""

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'gangrenous crawler'}
#: data/json/monsters/zed_fusion.json
msgid ""
"A nightmarish spidery abomination, born from human gore.  It deftly crawls "
"between walls and ceiling with limbs grown from its own disjointed ribs."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/monsters/zed_fusion.json
msgid "gangrenous impaler"
msgid_plural "gangrenous impalers"
msgstr[0] ""
msgstr[1] ""
msgstr[2] ""

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'gangrenous impaler'}
#: data/json/monsters/zed_fusion.json
msgid ""
"A corpse hideously twisted into an insect-like form.  A hollow tendril "
"reaches out from its open thorax."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/monsters/zed_fusion.json
msgid "The impaler launches a barb!"
msgstr ""

#: data/json/monsters/zed_fusion.json
msgid "flesh wall"
msgid_plural "flesh walls"
msgstr[0] ""
msgstr[1] ""
msgstr[2] ""

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'flesh wall'}
#: data/json/monsters/zed_fusion.json
msgid ""
"A great lump of mutated flesh.  It resembles the innards of some gigantic "
"creature and is covered in a grid of diminutive veins."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/monsters/zed_lab.json
msgid "zombie scientist"
msgid_plural "zombie scientists"
msgstr[0] ""
msgstr[1] ""
msgstr[2] ""

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'zombie scientist'}
#: data/json/monsters/zed_lab.json
msgid ""
"Apart from the jet-black eyes, this zombie looks less decomposed and inhuman"
" than most.  Clad in a tattered lab coat, it seems to have a glimmer of "
"awareness - not a human awareness, but something more sinister.  As you "
"watch it, its movements look almost marionette-like."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/monsters/zed_lab.json
msgid "elite zombie scientist"
msgid_plural "elite zombie scientists"
msgstr[0] ""
msgstr[1] ""
msgstr[2] ""

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'elite zombie scientist'}
#: data/json/monsters/zed_lab.json
msgid ""
"What used to be the shambling corpse of some former scientist now glowers "
"with an eerie intelligence in its eyes.  Though more steady on its feet, its"
" hands fumble awkwardly for hidden devices within various pockets, and the "
"faint hum of manhack motors follow in its wake."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/monsters/zed_lab.json
msgid "zombie cybernetics researcher"
msgid_plural "zombie cybernetics researchers"
msgstr[0] ""
msgstr[1] ""
msgstr[2] ""

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'zombie cybernetics researcher'}
#: data/json/monsters/zed_lab.json
msgid ""
"Decaying flesh and torn laboratory safety gear reveal hints of embedded "
"alloy plating and various bionics components.  Cutting-edge cybernetics seem"
" to be the only thing keeping its rotting corpse intact, and one arm crackle"
" with electromagnetic discharges as it reaches for its prey."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/monsters/zed_lab.json
msgid "The cybernetic zombie discharges an integrated EMP projector!"
msgstr ""

#: data/json/monsters/zed_lab.json
msgid "zombie xenotech"
msgid_plural "zombie xenotechs"
msgstr[0] ""
msgstr[1] ""
msgstr[2] ""

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'zombie xenotech'}
#: data/json/monsters/zed_lab.json
msgid ""
"Shadows envelop this creature, but you can faintly make out what used to be "
"a lab coat.  Marked by whatever perversions of science it practiced in life,"
" the movements of its silhouette seem more lively than expected, but far "
"from human."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/monsters/zed_lab.json
msgid "zombie security guard"
msgid_plural "zombie security guards"
msgstr[0] ""
msgstr[1] ""
msgstr[2] ""

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'zombie security guard'}
#: data/json/monsters/zed_lab.json
msgid ""
"A shambling human corpse wearing a gray uniform and bulletproof vest with "
"\"SECURITY\" emblazoned across the front.  It looks like the guard was quite"
" physically fit before its death; it moves quickly and powerfully, albeit "
"clumsily."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/monsters/zed_medical.json
msgid "nurse"
msgid_plural "nurses"
msgstr[0] ""
msgstr[1] ""
msgstr[2] ""

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'nurse'}
#: data/json/monsters/zed_medical.json
msgid ""
"Instead of one of its forearms, this zombie has a muscular tube ending in a "
"stinger that is moist with stringy slime.  It is single-mindedly focused on "
"using just that one limb to fight."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/monsters/zed_medical.json
msgid "surgeon"
msgid_plural "surgeons"
msgstr[0] ""
msgstr[1] ""
msgstr[2] ""

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'surgeon'}
#: data/json/monsters/zed_medical.json
msgid ""
"A dripping stinger where one hand would be, a set of razor-like claws in "
"place of the other one.  This zombie's cold, focused eyes look down at you "
"from above a \"mask\" of melded flesh."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/monsters/zed_medical.json
msgid "vivisector"
msgid_plural "vivisectors"
msgstr[0] ""
msgstr[1] ""
msgstr[2] ""

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'vivisector'}
#: data/json/monsters/zed_medical.json
msgid ""
"This humanoid has a long bone \"syringe\" in place of one forearm, a large "
"saw as the opposing hand, and a pair of digitigrade legs ending in raptor-"
"like feet.  Its head is featureless, except for its \"human\" eyes, which "
"smile with inhuman malice and scorn."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/monsters/zed_medical.json
msgid "cadaver assembler"
msgid_plural "cadaver assemblers"
msgstr[0] ""
msgstr[1] ""
msgstr[2] ""

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'cadaver assembler'}
#: data/json/monsters/zed_medical.json
msgid ""
"With a grotesquely twisted body and four arms fused with surgical tools, "
"this zombie obsessively regenerates nearby undead at an abnormal speed.  A "
"dark aura flows over its pale skin, eerily healing damaged allies and "
"spreading a distorted will to live."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Attack message of monster "{'str': 'cadaver assembler'}"'s spell "None"
#: data/json/monsters/zed_medical.json
msgid "<color_yellow>Nearby zombies regenerate abnormally quickly.</color>"
msgstr ""

#: data/json/monsters/zed_misc.json
msgid "slavering biter"
msgid_plural "slavering biters"
msgstr[0] ""
msgstr[1] ""
msgstr[2] ""

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'slavering biter'}
#: data/json/monsters/zed_misc.json
msgid ""
"A distorted and swollen human body.  Its jaws have elongated into a "
"crocodile like snout, dripping with foul smelling saliva."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/monsters/zed_misc.json
msgid "brainless zombie"
msgid_plural "brainless zombies"
msgstr[0] ""
msgstr[1] ""
msgstr[2] ""

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'brainless zombie'}
#: data/json/monsters/zed_misc.json
msgid ""
"A zombie like any other, except that its features and skull have been "
"devastated.  It's unclear what caused the damage, but between the scraps of "
"flesh you can see that its face and brain are gone, though its ears are "
"intact."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/monsters/zed_misc.json
msgid "zombie brute"
msgid_plural "zombie brutes"
msgstr[0] ""
msgstr[1] ""
msgstr[2] ""

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'zombie brute'}
#: data/json/monsters/zed_misc.json
msgid ""
"Its entire body bulges with distended muscles and swollen, festering wounds."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/monsters/zed_misc.json
msgid "zombie wrestler"
msgid_plural "zombie wrestlers"
msgstr[0] ""
msgstr[1] ""
msgstr[2] ""

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'zombie wrestler'}
#: data/json/monsters/zed_misc.json
msgid ""
"A slab of festering muscle the size of a well-toned bodybuilder.  Seems "
"eager to strangle the life from you."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/monsters/zed_misc.json
msgid "zombie nightstalker"
msgid_plural "zombie nightstalkers"
msgstr[0] ""
msgstr[1] ""
msgstr[2] ""

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'zombie nightstalker'}
#: data/json/monsters/zed_misc.json
msgid ""
"Somehow this brute hides in the dark like some kind of boogeyman.  Very "
"agile for such a large zombie."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/monsters/zed_misc.json
msgid "listener zombie"
msgid_plural "listener zombies"
msgstr[0] ""
msgstr[1] ""
msgstr[2] ""

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'listener zombie'}
#: data/json/monsters/zed_misc.json
msgid ""
"The head of this zombie was once obviously destroyed, the gaps in its scraps"
" of face now filling with a peculiar gray goo.  Human ears hang from the "
"sides, enormous and unsettling.  Thin slits at the front suggest it may be "
"able to see."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/monsters/zed_misc.json
msgid "grabber zombie"
msgid_plural "grabber zombies"
msgstr[0] ""
msgstr[1] ""
msgstr[2] ""

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'grabber zombie'}
#: data/json/monsters/zed_misc.json
msgid ""
"A deformed human body, once living.  Its arms dangle from its sides like the"
" limbs of some skinless ape, mindlessly groping at their surroundings."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/monsters/zed_misc.json
msgid "grappler zombie"
msgid_plural "grappler zombies"
msgstr[0] ""
msgstr[1] ""
msgstr[2] ""

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'grappler zombie'}
#: data/json/monsters/zed_misc.json
msgid ""
"An undead humanoid, its elongated arms drag along the ground as it moves.  "
"It looks to almost have a hunch from the swollen back and shoulder muscles "
"tearing though its skin."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/monsters/zed_misc.json
msgid "zombie hollow"
msgid_plural "zombie hollows"
msgstr[0] ""
msgstr[1] ""
msgstr[2] ""

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'zombie hollow'}
#: data/json/monsters/zed_misc.json
msgid ""
"Black hollow eyes survey the surroundings as the zombie stretches and bends "
"in ways that whoever the original body belonged to never could.  The only "
"thing that seems solid, on this flexible black-veined body, is the rows of "
"sharp black teeth.  You get the feeling that the only human thing remaining "
"is the skin, worn as one would wear clothes."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/monsters/zed_misc.json
msgid "zombie hulk"
msgid_plural "zombie hulks"
msgstr[0] ""
msgstr[1] ""
msgstr[2] ""

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'zombie hulk'}
#: data/json/monsters/zed_misc.json
msgid ""
"A human body now swollen to the size of six men, with arms as wide as a "
"trash can."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/monsters/zed_misc.json
msgid "relentless hulk"
msgid_plural "relentless hulks"
msgstr[0] ""
msgstr[1] ""
msgstr[2] ""

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'relentless hulk'}
#: data/json/monsters/zed_misc.json
msgid ""
"A hulking zombie swollen to the size of six men.  Its inky black eyes are "
"locked on you.  No matter how far you run, it always seems to find you."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/monsters/zed_misc.json
msgid "zombie hunter"
msgid_plural "zombie hunters"
msgstr[0] ""
msgstr[1] ""
msgstr[2] ""

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'zombie hunter'}
#: data/json/monsters/zed_misc.json
msgid ""
"This once-human body is barely recognizable, scrambling about on all fours, "
"its nails and teeth both sharpened into dangerous looking spikes."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/monsters/zed_misc.json
msgid "Thriller"
msgid_plural "Thrillers"
msgstr[0] ""
msgstr[1] ""
msgstr[2] ""

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'Thriller'}
#: data/json/monsters/zed_misc.json
msgid ""
"And though you fight to stay alive,\n"
"Your body starts to shiver.\n"
"For no mere mortal can resist,\n"
"The evil of the thriller."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/monsters/zed_misc.json
msgid "zombie snapper"
msgid_plural "zombie snappers"
msgstr[0] ""
msgstr[1] ""
msgstr[2] ""

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'zombie snapper'}
#: data/json/monsters/zed_misc.json
msgid ""
"With a crocodile-like snout and rows of protruding teeth, this swimwear-clad"
" zombie lurks in the water."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/monsters/zed_misc.json
msgid "zombie runner"
msgid_plural "zombie runners"
msgstr[0] ""
msgstr[1] ""
msgstr[2] ""

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'zombie runner'}
#: data/json/monsters/zed_misc.json
msgid ""
"This recently-risen body moves quickly, darting its head back and forth and "
"gnawing at its hands."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/monsters/zed_misc.json
msgid "zombie predator"
msgid_plural "zombie predators"
msgstr[0] ""
msgstr[1] ""
msgstr[2] ""

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'zombie predator'}
#: data/json/monsters/zed_misc.json
msgid ""
"With its joints in odd places and angles, this humanoid creature prowls "
"across the landscape with surprising speed.  Its teeth and arms are "
"sharpened into fine points, and black ooze seeps out from cuts between its "
"muscles."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/monsters/zed_misc.json
msgid "screecher zombie"
msgid_plural "screecher zombies"
msgstr[0] ""
msgstr[1] ""
msgstr[2] ""

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'screecher zombie'}
#: data/json/monsters/zed_misc.json
msgid ""
"A thin corpse, its chest is swollen in what appears to be preparation.  A "
"thick black ooze drips from its open mouth."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/monsters/zed_misc.json
msgid "shady zombie"
msgid_plural "shady zombies"
msgstr[0] ""
msgstr[1] ""
msgstr[2] ""

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'shady zombie'}
#: data/json/monsters/zed_misc.json
msgid ""
"An uncanny shadow envelops this creature, as if light itself were too "
"repulsed to touch it.  All you can make out is its shambling, human shaped "
"outline."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/monsters/zed_misc.json data/json/overmap/map_extras.json
msgid "Shia LaBeouf"
msgid_plural "Shia LaBeouf"
msgstr[0] ""
msgstr[1] ""
msgstr[2] ""

#. ~ Description for {'str_sp': 'Shia LaBeouf'}
#: data/json/monsters/zed_misc.json
msgid ""
"Living in the woods,\n"
"killing for sport,\n"
"eating all the bodies,\n"
"actual cannibal Shia LaBeouf."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/monsters/zed_misc.json
msgid "shrieker zombie"
msgid_plural "shrieker zombies"
msgstr[0] ""
msgstr[1] ""
msgstr[2] ""

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'shrieker zombie'}
#: data/json/monsters/zed_misc.json
msgid ""
"An elongated human body with a swollen chest and a gaping hole where its jaw"
" used to be."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/monsters/zed_misc.json
msgid "skull zombie"
msgid_plural "skull zombies"
msgstr[0] ""
msgstr[1] ""
msgstr[2] ""

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'skull zombie'}
#: data/json/monsters/zed_misc.json
msgid ""
"This creature's head is a hideous gray skull, formed of human bone fragments"
" and some sort of goo.  Jagged teeth are visible as the thing works its jaw "
"and disturbingly human, lidless eyes stare at you from their sockets.  The "
"thing's fleshy ears are four sizes too large and droop under their own "
"weight."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/monsters/zed_misc.json
msgid "smoker zombie"
msgid_plural "smoker zombies"
msgstr[0] ""
msgstr[1] ""
msgstr[2] ""

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'smoker zombie'}
#: data/json/monsters/zed_misc.json
msgid ""
"A blackened and twisted naked human body, strips of flesh hang from its "
"body, and it emits a constant haze of thick black smoke."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/monsters/zed_misc.json
msgid "grappling smoker zombie"
msgid_plural "grappling smoker zombies"
msgstr[0] ""
msgstr[1] ""
msgstr[2] ""

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'grappling smoker zombie'}
#: data/json/monsters/zed_misc.json
msgid ""
"A pale, gaunt corpse with smoke billowing from its torn flesh.  Its skin "
"hangs in dry, tatter strips, but the exposed muscle underneath seems raw and"
" pulsing with unlife, forming a nest of writhing worm-life tendrils."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/monsters/zed_misc.json
msgid "fuming husk"
msgid_plural "fuming husks"
msgstr[0] ""
msgstr[1] ""
msgstr[2] ""

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'fuming husk'}
#: data/json/monsters/zed_misc.json
msgid ""
"A rotting, near-skeletal corpse with a putrid smell to it.  Its torn flesh "
"weeps clouds of acrid, toxic gas."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/monsters/zed_misc.json
msgid "swimmer zombie"
msgid_plural "swimmer zombies"
msgstr[0] ""
msgstr[1] ""
msgstr[2] ""

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'swimmer zombie'}
#: data/json/monsters/zed_misc.json
msgid ""
"A slick and glistening human body.  Its hands and feet are webbed, and it is"
" clad in swimwear."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/monsters/zed_misc.json
msgid "zombie squidman"
msgid_plural "zombie squidmen"
msgstr[0] ""
msgstr[1] ""
msgstr[2] ""

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'zombie squidman', 'str_pl': 'zombie squidmen'}
#: data/json/monsters/zed_misc.json
msgid ""
"This rotting, squid-faced thing somehow used to be human, judging by its "
"tattered swimwear.  Its limbs have split apart and mutated into a mess of "
"slimy tendrils, vomiting up bile when threatened in a twisted imitation of "
"cephalopod ink."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/monsters/zed_misc.json
msgid "zombie swamp-thing"
msgid_plural "zombie swamp-things"
msgstr[0] ""
msgstr[1] ""
msgstr[2] ""

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'zombie swamp-thing'}
#: data/json/monsters/zed_misc.json
msgid ""
"A vaguely human-shaped mound of decaying plant matter and other detritus, "
"this zombie has been dragged through the muck and then some.  Sharp, "
"venomous thorns can be seen under all the debris clinging to it."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/monsters/zed_misc.json
msgid "swamp husk"
msgid_plural "swamp husks"
msgstr[0] ""
msgstr[1] ""
msgstr[2] ""

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'swamp husk'}
#: data/json/monsters/zed_misc.json
msgid ""
"This bulky tangle of dead plants and other trash obscures the form of a now "
"heavily-mutated zombie.  It reeks of dead plant, wisps of noixous fumes "
"drifting from it as it shambles after its prey."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/monsters/zed_misc.json
msgid "zombie technician"
msgid_plural "zombie technicians"
msgstr[0] ""
msgstr[1] ""
msgstr[2] ""

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'zombie technician'}
#: data/json/monsters/zed_misc.json
msgid ""
"Still wearing its work clothes and hardhat, this zombie likely used to work "
"on power lines or other electrical equipment."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/monsters/zed_misc.json
msgid "electromagnetic zombie"
msgid_plural "electromagnetic zombies"
msgstr[0] ""
msgstr[1] ""
msgstr[2] ""

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'electromagnetic zombie'}
#: data/json/monsters/zed_misc.json
msgid ""
"Looking like a walking power line accident, charred work clothes and safety "
"gear are melted to this thing's body, which crackles with lightning."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/monsters/zed_misc.json
msgid "scrapyard zombie"
msgid_plural "scrapyard zombies"
msgstr[0] ""
msgstr[1] ""
msgstr[2] ""

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'scrapyard zombie'}
#: data/json/monsters/zed_misc.json
msgid ""
"At first glance, you could almost mistake this for a pile of prime scrap "
"metal.  The hum of bionics and scraping of its movements confirms it to "
"actually be a zombie entirely covered in magnetically-attracted debris."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/monsters/zed_misc.json
msgid "ironclad brute"
msgid_plural "ironclad brutes"
msgstr[0] ""
msgstr[1] ""
msgstr[2] ""

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'ironclad brute'}
#: data/json/monsters/zed_misc.json
msgid ""
"This walking junkyard is either heavily mutated or just absolutely buried in"
" debris stuck to it, its large form bristling with sharp scrap metal it can "
"launch in magnetic pulses as it lumbers along."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/monsters/zed_misc.json
msgid "The ironclad zombie discharges a hail of scraps from its body!"
msgstr ""

#: data/json/monsters/zed_misc.json
msgid "zombie miner"
msgid_plural "zombie miners"
msgstr[0] ""
msgstr[1] ""
msgstr[2] ""

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'zombie miner'}
#: data/json/monsters/zed_misc.json
msgid ""
"This zombie's face, hands, work clothes, and miner's helmet are fully "
"covered with stains of coal dust."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/monsters/zed_misc.json
msgid "zombie tunneler"
msgid_plural "zombie tunnelers"
msgstr[0] ""
msgstr[1] ""
msgstr[2] ""

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'zombie tunneler'}
#: data/json/monsters/zed_misc.json
msgid ""
"Long claws extend from the club-like hands of a pale zombie, its figure "
"hunched over and pallid.  Horrid noises emit from it as it tunnels through "
"obstacles and gnashes its deformed jaws."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/monsters/zed_misc.json
msgid "subterranean haunt"
msgid_plural "subterranean haunts"
msgstr[0] ""
msgstr[1] ""
msgstr[2] ""

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'subterranean haunt'}
#: data/json/monsters/zed_misc.json
msgid ""
"Red eyes glower out from a shroud of living shadow, the dust-covered form of"
" some abandoned workman seemingly carries the darkness of its underground "
"resting place with it."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/monsters/zed_misc.json
msgid "thorny shambler"
msgid_plural "thorny shamblers"
msgstr[0] ""
msgstr[1] ""
msgstr[2] ""

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'thorny shambler'}
#: data/json/monsters/zed_misc.json
msgid ""
"A shambling undead humanoid, body overgrown with a tangled mass of "
"otherworldly vegetation.  Hunched over and dragging its feet as it moves, "
"the bramble utterly enveloping its upper half twitches and moves with a life"
" of its own, tendrils tipped with a paralytic sting."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/monsters/zed_misc.json
msgid "shroud weaver"
msgid_plural "shroud weavers"
msgstr[0] ""
msgstr[1] ""
msgstr[2] ""

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'shroud weaver'}
#: data/json/monsters/zed_misc.json
msgid ""
"Once human, this corpse has assimilated with the darkness of the "
"netherworld.  A faint black fog rises from the corpse, and the closer you "
"get to the horrific being, the more the light around you seems to be sucked "
"away."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/monsters/zed_misc.json
msgid "banshee"
msgid_plural "banshees"
msgstr[0] ""
msgstr[1] ""
msgstr[2] ""

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'banshee'}
#: data/json/monsters/zed_misc.json
msgid ""
"From its gaunt, twisted form, the banshee unleashes a piercing scream that "
"tears through the air and disorients all who hear it.  This sonic assault is"
" a crippling wave of pure fear that causes extreme mental and physical "
"anguish."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Attack message of monster "{'str': 'banshee'}"'s spell "None"
#: data/json/monsters/zed_misc.json
msgid "You heard a soul-chilling shriek!"
msgstr ""

#: data/json/monsters/zed_prisoner.json
msgid "prisoner zombie"
msgid_plural "prisoner zombies"
msgstr[0] ""
msgstr[1] ""
msgstr[2] ""

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'prisoner zombie'}
#: data/json/monsters/zed_prisoner.json
msgid ""
"Apparently this zombie was doing time when the Cataclysm struck.  It wears "
"black and white striped prisoner clothes, and tattoos can be seen on his "
"decaying skin."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/monsters/zed_radiation.json
msgid "charred nightmare"
msgid_plural "charred nightmares"
msgstr[0] ""
msgstr[1] ""
msgstr[2] ""

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'charred nightmare'}
#: data/json/monsters/zed_radiation.json
msgid ""
"Intense radiation has spurred a unique form of necrosis and regeneration, it"
" is impossible to tell if this creature was ever human."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/monsters/zed_radiation.json
msgid "irradiated wanderer"
msgid_plural "irradiated wanderers"
msgstr[0] ""
msgstr[1] ""
msgstr[2] ""

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'irradiated wanderer'}
#: data/json/monsters/zed_radiation.json
msgid ""
"This rotting corpse seeps a glowing ooze from its lesions.  A strange "
"tattered jumpsuit marks it as an oddity across the wasteland."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'skeleton'}
#: data/json/monsters/zed_skeletal.json
msgid ""
"A monstrous overgrowth of ossified tissue has replaced this zombie's rotting"
" skin with an organic armor of dense bone.  Large clumps of black goo seep "
"from its joints as it shambles aimlessly, with sickening crackling sounds "
"filling the air around it."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/monsters/zed_skeletal.json
msgid "skeletal brute"
msgid_plural "skeletal brutes"
msgstr[0] ""
msgstr[1] ""
msgstr[2] ""

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'skeletal brute'}
#: data/json/monsters/zed_skeletal.json
msgid ""
"Distorted outgrowths of calcified bone plates cover this zombie's rotten "
"skin.  Joints and cracks around its body ooze with black goo."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/monsters/zed_skeletal.json
msgid "skeletal shocker"
msgid_plural "skeletal shockers"
msgstr[0] ""
msgstr[1] ""
msgstr[2] ""

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'skeletal shocker'}
#: data/json/monsters/zed_skeletal.json
msgid ""
"Heavy, jagged bone plates have grown out of the surface of this zombie.  "
"Underneath, its flesh glows and crackles with the occasional jolt of "
"electricity."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/monsters/zed_skeletal.json
msgid "skeletal juggernaut"
msgid_plural "skeletal juggernauts"
msgstr[0] ""
msgstr[1] ""
msgstr[2] ""

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'skeletal juggernaut'}
#: data/json/monsters/zed_skeletal.json
msgid ""
"This hideous golem of plated bones and misshapen flesh drags its heavy, "
"pointed limbs behind it like an unwanted burden.  Formerly soft and "
"vulnerable, bones grew around its form to protect it - only, they kept "
"growing.  And growing.  And growing."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/monsters/zed_soldiers.json
msgid "zombie soldier"
msgid_plural "zombie soldiers"
msgstr[0] ""
msgstr[1] ""
msgstr[2] ""

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'zombie soldier'}
#: data/json/monsters/zed_soldiers.json
msgid ""
"Once a soldier, it is dressed head to toe in combat gear and carries itself "
"rather steadily for a zombie."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/monsters/zed_soldiers.json
msgid "black-ops zombie"
msgid_plural "black-ops zombies"
msgstr[0] ""
msgstr[1] ""
msgstr[2] ""

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'black-ops zombie'}
#: data/json/monsters/zed_soldiers.json
msgid ""
"This soldier zombie's skin radiates a sort of shadowy smoke that obscures "
"its outline, making its camouflage even harder to see against the "
"background.  In the darkness it would be nigh invisible."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/monsters/zed_soldiers.json
msgid "hunter-killer zombie"
msgid_plural "hunter-killer zombies"
msgstr[0] ""
msgstr[1] ""
msgstr[2] ""

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'hunter-killer zombie'}
#: data/json/monsters/zed_soldiers.json
msgid ""
"Fragments of visible uniform hint that this monstrosity was once a soldier."
"  Anything human is invisible, hidden inside a sheath of living shadow.  It "
"moves with preternatural fluidity and grace."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/monsters/zed_soldiers.json
msgid "acid-sniper zombie"
msgid_plural "acid-sniper zombies"
msgstr[0] ""
msgstr[1] ""
msgstr[2] ""

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'acid-sniper zombie'}
#: data/json/monsters/zed_soldiers.json
msgid ""
"This staggering soldier wears a burnt gasmask, now fused to its face.  "
"Through the melted, bile-encrusted ruination of the mask comes some sort of "
"hardened fleshy proboscis, with steaming corrosive fluid leaking from the "
"end."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/monsters/zed_soldiers.json
msgid "acid-support zombie"
msgid_plural "acid-support zombies"
msgstr[0] ""
msgstr[1] ""
msgstr[2] ""

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'acid-support zombie'}
#: data/json/monsters/zed_soldiers.json
msgid ""
"This zombie wears what appears to have once been a soldier's uniform and "
"armor, now a series of cracked and melted plates that have fused to its skin"
" and thickened hide.  Its face and arms blister with strange mutated tubes "
"that pulse and drip with acid."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/monsters/zed_soldiers.json
msgid "acid-juggernaut zombie"
msgid_plural "acid-juggernaut zombies"
msgstr[0] ""
msgstr[1] ""
msgstr[2] ""

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'acid-juggernaut zombie'}
#: data/json/monsters/zed_soldiers.json
msgid ""
"Destroyed hazard gear covers this zombie's grotesquely bloated body, which "
"has been mutated by acidic compounds.  Its arms bear massive acid cannons "
"that unleash a furious barrage of corrosive fluid, instantly melting "
"anything that approaches.  Wherever this hulking monster treads, it leaves "
"behind a trail of decayed, reeking residue, a testament to its overwhelming "
"power."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/monsters/zed_soldiers.json
msgid "Kevlar zombie"
msgid_plural "Kevlar zombies"
msgstr[0] ""
msgstr[1] ""
msgstr[2] ""

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'Kevlar zombie'}
#: data/json/monsters/zed_soldiers.json
msgid ""
"This zombie was once wearing some kind of uniform with heavy, bulletproof "
"materials sewn in.  At this point it's impossible to tell what kind of "
"uniform it was: the monster's skin has grown over the fabric, splitting and "
"tearing it to shreds, turning the remaining Kevlar and other bits of armor "
"material into part of its hide.  Its hands, similarly, have fused into large"
" leathery cudgels."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/monsters/zed_soldiers.json
msgid "Kevlar hulk"
msgid_plural "Kevlar hulks"
msgstr[0] ""
msgstr[1] ""
msgstr[2] ""

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'Kevlar hulk'}
#: data/json/monsters/zed_soldiers.json
msgid ""
"This zombie was once wearing some kind of now long-shredded uniform with "
"heavy, bulletproof materials sewn in.  It has grown into a hulking, "
"leatherbacked beast, its mutated skin taking on a strange texture similar to"
" the Kevlar bits embedded in it.  Its arms have twisted into enormous clubs "
"of misshapen bone that it drags on the ground behind it."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/monsters/zed_soldiers.json
msgid "zombie military pilot"
msgid_plural "zombie military pilots"
msgstr[0] ""
msgstr[1] ""
msgstr[2] ""

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'zombie military pilot'}
#: data/json/monsters/zed_soldiers.json
msgid ""
"Once a pilot, it is dressed in basic military fatigues, aviator sunglasses, "
"and a sturdy looking helmet."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/monsters/zed_soldiers.json
msgid "zombie burner"
msgid_plural "zombie burners"
msgstr[0] ""
msgstr[1] ""
msgstr[2] ""

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'zombie burner'}
#: data/json/monsters/zed_soldiers.json
msgid ""
"When bullets weren't enough to stop the end of the world, the military tried"
" fire instead.  Their failure is made manifest in this gas-masked husk, its "
"black suit torn and ripped.  Its flamethrower, dangling limply at its side, "
"is attached to a tank of napalm strapped onto its back, which trickles its "
"contents onto the ground."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/monsters/zed_soldiers.json
msgid "armored zombie"
msgid_plural "armored zombies"
msgstr[0] ""
msgstr[1] ""
msgstr[2] ""

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'armored zombie'}
#: data/json/monsters/zed_soldiers.json
msgid ""
"Despite being encased in a what was once a nigh-impenetrable suit of power "
"armor, something still managed to kill this soldier."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/monsters/zed_soldiers.json
msgid "zombie bio-operator"
msgid_plural "zombie bio-operators"
msgstr[0] ""
msgstr[1] ""
msgstr[2] ""

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'zombie bio-operator'}
#: data/json/monsters/zed_soldiers.json
msgid ""
"This armored and augmented soldier's bionics crackle with energy.  Worse, it"
" appears to remember its training."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/monsters/zed_soldiers.json
msgid "elite zombie bio-operator"
msgid_plural "elite zombie bio-operators"
msgstr[0] ""
msgstr[1] ""
msgstr[2] ""

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'elite zombie bio-operator'}
#: data/json/monsters/zed_soldiers.json
msgid ""
"Once a highly trained soldier, various bionics cover this zombie's broken "
"body.  Strangely, it maintains a vague martial arts stance."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/monsters/zed_soldiers.json
msgid "zombie sergeant"
msgid_plural "zombie sergeants"
msgstr[0] ""
msgstr[1] ""
msgstr[2] ""

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'zombie sergeant'}
#: data/json/monsters/zed_soldiers.json
msgid ""
"This zombie's tattered uniform indicates it might have once been an NCO.  A "
"bizarre entity still clinging to past obsessions and a sense of authority, "
"as if it was still leading the charge against the enemy it fell against.  It"
" summons echos of fallen soldiers, with a hoarse voice that perpetually "
"sounds like grumbling."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Attack message of monster "{'str': 'zombie sergeant'}"'s spell "None"
#: data/json/monsters/zed_soldiers.json
msgid ""
"The zombie sergeant gargles with rage, and spectral troops begin to gather "
"around!"
msgstr ""

#: data/json/monsters/zed_soldiers.json
msgid ""
"These are the pathetic beings reluctantly dragged into action under the "
"coercive command of their commanding officer.  They still wear expressions "
"of profound displeasure and exhibit a visibly annoyed demeanor, moving "
"listlessly to commands that are a confused echo of their past lives.  "
"Forcibly deployed, they shamble towards you, but their every movement "
"clearly conveys, \"Why do I have to do this?\""
msgstr ""

#: data/json/monsters/zed_soldiers.json
msgid "zombie shieldbearer"
msgid_plural "zombie shieldbearers"
msgstr[0] ""
msgstr[1] ""
msgstr[2] ""

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'zombie shieldbearer'}
#: data/json/monsters/zed_soldiers.json
msgid ""
"Wearing a military uniform, this zombie walks slowly as it hides its body "
"behind a hefty shield. Appearing no different from any other fallen soldier "
"aside from its defenses, a good solid hit should either wreck its precious "
"shield or knock it out of its grasp."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/monsters/zed_survivor.json
msgid "survivor zombie"
msgid_plural "survivor zombies"
msgstr[0] ""
msgstr[1] ""
msgstr[2] ""

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'survivor zombie'}
#: data/json/monsters/zed_survivor.json
msgid ""
"Still wearing the tattered remnants of improvised armor and weaponry, it is "
"plain to see that this zombie was once a survivor like you."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/monsters/zed_survivor.json
msgid "veteran survivor zombie"
msgid_plural "veteran survivor zombies"
msgstr[0] ""
msgstr[1] ""
msgstr[2] ""

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'veteran survivor zombie'}
#: data/json/monsters/zed_survivor.json
msgid ""
"This zombie once was a survivor like you, and a pretty good one at that.  "
"Unfortunately they didn't make it, despite the custom-made, heavy armor "
"pieces they wear and the gear that they are still lugging around."
msgstr ""

