#: data/json/npcs/expertise_traits.json
msgid "Psychology Expert"
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'Psychology Expert'}
#: data/json/npcs/expertise_traits.json
msgid ""
"This survivor has extensive experience in psychology, a PhD or equivalent."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/expertise_traits.json
msgid "Sanitation Training"
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'Sanitation Training'}
#: data/json/npcs/expertise_traits.json
msgid ""
"This survivor has some formal training in sanitation, but not much "
"experience."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/expertise_traits.json
msgid "Sanitation Expert"
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'Sanitation Expert'}
#: data/json/npcs/expertise_traits.json
msgid "This survivor has extensive experience in sanitation."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/expertise_traits.json
msgid "Teaching Training"
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'Teaching Training'}
#: data/json/npcs/expertise_traits.json
msgid ""
"This survivor has some formal training in teaching, but not much experience."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/expertise_traits.json
msgid "Teaching Expert"
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'Teaching Expert'}
#: data/json/npcs/expertise_traits.json
msgid ""
"This survivor has extensive experience in teaching, a PhD or equivalent."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/expertise_traits.json
msgid "Veterinary Training"
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'Veterinary Training'}
#: data/json/npcs/expertise_traits.json
msgid ""
"This survivor has some formal training in veterinary medicine, but not much "
"experience."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/expertise_traits.json
msgid "Veterinary Expert"
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'Veterinary Expert'}
#: data/json/npcs/expertise_traits.json
msgid ""
"This survivor has extensive experience in veterinary medicine, a DVM or "
"equivalent."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/factions.json
msgid "Your Followers"
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description for Your Followers
#: data/json/npcs/factions.json
msgid ""
"The survivors who have entrusted you with their well-being.  If morale "
"drops, poor performance and mutiny may become issues."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/factions.json
msgid "AMF"
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description for AMF
#: data/json/npcs/factions.json
msgid ""
"The survivors who formerly entrusted you with their well-being, but have now"
" mutinied because of your abuse and incompetence.  They will kill you if "
"they can."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description for Hub 01
#: data/json/npcs/factions.json
msgid ""
"The surviving staff of Hub 01, a pre-Cataclysm research lab.  They rarely "
"leave their lab, if at all, and rely on their robots and advanced technology"
" to survive."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/factions.json
msgid "Hub 01 Ancillia"
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description for Hub 01 Ancillia
#: data/json/npcs/factions.json
msgid ""
"A loose association of skilled wastelanders, traders, mercenaries and "
"scouts.  All working on behalf of Hub 01, for their own reasons."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/factions.json
msgid "The Old Guard"
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description for The Old Guard
#: data/json/npcs/factions.json
msgid ""
"The remains of the federal government.  The extent of their strength is "
"unknown but squads of patrolling soldiers have been seen under their banner."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/factions.json
msgid "Rabbit Enthusiasts"
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description for Rabbit Enthusiasts
#: data/json/npcs/factions.json
msgid "Mr. Lapin and any acolytes he may have gathered in the apocalypse."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/factions.json
msgid "The Free Merchants"
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description for The Free Merchants
#: data/json/npcs/factions.json
msgid ""
"A conglomeration of entrepreneurs and businessmen that stand together to "
"hammer-out an existence through trade and industry."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/factions.json
msgid "The Beggars in the Lobby"
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description for The Beggars in the Lobby
#: data/json/npcs/factions.json
msgid ""
"A collection of mentally and physically disadvantaged survivors who beg for "
"food in the Evac Center lobby."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/factions.json
msgid "The Tacoma Commune"
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description for The Tacoma Commune
#: data/json/npcs/factions.json
msgid ""
"An outpost started by the Free Merchants to provide a source of food and raw"
" materials."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/factions.json
msgid "Marloss Evangelists"
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description for Marloss Evangelists
#: data/json/npcs/factions.json
msgid ""
"Diverse bands, congregations and organizations with the common goal of "
"preaching human survival through symbiosis with fungaloids."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/factions.json
msgid "No Faction"
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description for No Faction
#: data/json/npcs/factions.json
msgid "A lone wolf, not aligned with any faction."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/factions.json
msgid "The Wasteland Scavengers"
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description for The Wasteland Scavengers
#: data/json/npcs/factions.json
msgid ""
"Autonomous bands or individuals who make their living raiding the ruins of "
"the old-world for gear and provisions."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/factions.json
msgid "Hell's Raiders"
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description for Hell's Raiders
#: data/json/npcs/factions.json
msgid ""
"The largest gang of hooligans and bandits that preys upon other survivors.  "
"Even if you have no gear, there is always a need for slaves and fresh meat."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/factions.json
msgid "Mutants Bees"
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description for Mutants Bees
#: data/json/npcs/factions.json
msgid "Mutant bees who hate everyone."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/factions.json
msgid "Isherwood family"
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description for Isherwood family
#: data/json/npcs/factions.json
msgid "A small family surviving on their generational land."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/factions.json
msgid "New England Church Community"
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description for New England Church Community
#: data/json/npcs/factions.json
msgid ""
"A small group of churchgoers that formed a community in the woods.  They "
"welcome anyone in their faction, but hate the unnatural."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/hints.json
msgid ""
"Squirrels are pretty yummy, but if you shoot them with a high-powered gun "
"you'll probably be left with no meat!  Use a BB gun or maybe a .22 rifle."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/hints.json
msgid ""
"Squirrels really ain't such a bad snack if you don't blast them all to hell."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/hints.json
msgid ""
"Ever run into those big worm things?  If you see trails of churned-up dirt, "
"you can be sure they're around."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/hints.json
msgid ""
"Try to stay on the roads as much as you can.  Giant worms can't cross them!"
msgstr ""
"Cerca di rimanere sulla strada finchè puoi. I vermi giganti non possono "
"attraversarla!"

#: data/json/npcs/hints.json
msgid ""
"Don't relax after killing a giant worm.  Little bits of them can break off "
"and still attack!"
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/hints.json
msgid ""
"If you see a big mob of zombies coming, RUN!  Trying to fight them all is "
"impossible unless you have a big tactical advantage."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/hints.json
msgid ""
"If you see a big mob of zombies coming, you better run.  Trying to fight "
"them all is suicide!"
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/hints.json
msgid "When you see a swarm of zombies coming it's time to run!"
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/hints.json
msgid ""
"If you're getting chased by a hoard of zombies, try ducking into the subways"
" and traveling a block or two, then coming back up."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/hints.json
msgid ""
"Watch out for those zombies that shriek; they'll let other zombies know "
"where you are, and will attract them from all over."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/hints.json
msgid ""
"Those acid-spitting zombies are pretty nasty, but if you're smart, you can "
"get other zombies to wade through the acid."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/hints.json
msgid ""
"If there's a pool of acid blocking your way, trying tossing a junk item into"
" it.  Eating up items will help neutralize the acid faster."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/hints.json
msgid ""
"Rubber boots aren't as tough as combat boots and you don't run very fast in "
"them.  But I've seen zombies vomiting puddles of acid, and I'd hate to have "
"my feet melt off, so I'd consider having a pair of those."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/hints.json
msgid ""
"There's this type of zombie that can shoot bolts of lightning!  Stay away "
"from walls and stuff when they do… the electricity can travel along solid "
"surfaces."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/hints.json
msgid ""
"Zombie hulks are NASTY, but they're easy to outsmart.  If there's other "
"monsters between you and them, they'll kill the monster for you!"
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/hints.json
msgid ""
"If you run into a zombie hulk, it's probably a good idea to run.  They're "
"fast as hell, but pretty dumb; they'll try to smash through obstacles rather"
" than going around, and that slows them down a lot."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/hints.json
msgid ""
"Zombie brutes and hulks have really tough hide, but skeletal juggernauts "
"with their bone plates are the worst.  Don't bother shooting at them with "
"lower-caliber guns, the bullet will bounce right off!"
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/hints.json
msgid ""
"Try not to kill a boomer if it's standing right next to you.  They tend to "
"explode when they die, and that pink goop will get all over you."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/hints.json
msgid ""
"Skeletons are a tough target for a gun.  They're so skinny and full of holes"
" that it's hard to make a good hit.  And those big ones are hard as nails "
"too."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/hints.json
msgid ""
"Small skeletons are too delicate to smash through doors or windows.  Big "
"ones can walk in through a wall.  At least they can't smell you, unlike "
"zombies, so if you turn your light off at night you can sneak right past."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/hints.json
msgid ""
"Don't try to take on a skeleton with a bladed weapon… you'll just leave "
"scratch marks.  You've got to shatter those bones with a hammer or "
"something."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/hints.json
msgid ""
"It's a good idea to butcher corpses if you have the time.  I've seen these "
"weird zombies bring their friends back from the dead!"
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/hints.json
msgid ""
"I have a buddy who was sleeping in this cabin way out in the woods, when he "
"suddenly woke up to trees and vines growing right up through the floor and "
"walls!  He said it was some kind of huge tree beast…"
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/hints.json
msgid ""
"Oh man, have you gone down into the old subway systems?  I'd be careful… "
"there's these things down there that are like zombies, but tougher."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/hints.json
msgid ""
"There's snakes down in most of the old sewer systems.  They're slow on land,"
" but boy, those suckers can swim fast!"
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/hints.json
msgid ""
"If you're planning on wandering around the sewers--not that you'd have a "
"reason too--watch out for those fish.  Those suckers are fast, and vicious "
"too!"
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/hints.json
msgid ""
"Have you seen those eyebots flying around?  It's hard to say, but some "
"faction's controlling them--maybe the military.  All I know is, I don't want"
" them taking my picture…"
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/hints.json
msgid ""
"Ever go toe-to-toe with a manhack?  Tiny little helicopters covered in "
"knives.  Best be packing a shotgun!"
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/hints.json
msgid ""
"They're rare, but molebots are nasty things.  They bore through the ground, "
"then pop up to stab ya.  Still, you're safe from them if you stay on "
"pavement…"
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/hints.json
msgid ""
"Don't fire your gun if you can help it - the noise attracts monsters.  If "
"you could get a silencer, or make one, it would give you some advantage."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/hints.json
msgid ""
"Standing behind a window is a good tactic.  It takes zombies a long time to "
"crawl through, giving you lots of opportunities to hit them."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/hints.json
msgid ""
"Zombies are pretty dumb… heck, most monsters are!  If you can get a fire "
"going between you and them, they'll just run straight through it."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/hints.json
msgid ""
"I know it's tempting to just go full-auto and unload as many bullets as "
"possible, but don't except as a last resort.  It's inaccurate and wastes "
"ammo."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/hints.json
msgid ""
"If there's a bunch of zombies in a straight line, try unloading a burst from"
" your gun.  Be sure to aim at the zombie furthest away; you'll hit more of "
"them that way."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/hints.json
msgid ""
"If you shoot a zombie, but don't quite kill it, try to finish it off with a "
"punch or something instead of wasting a bullet."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/hints.json
msgid ""
"If you're in a corridor or something, and there's a bunch of zombies chasing"
" you down it, try to wound the guy in front badly.  He'll start moving slow "
"and cause a serious traffic jam!"
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/hints.json
msgid ""
"Here's a trick for taking care of a huge swarm of zombies chasing you: head "
"into a liquor store, shoot out as many bottles as you can, then light the "
"alcohol on fire.  Then duck out the back door, and watch the zombies run "
"into a burning building!"
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/hints.json
msgid ""
"Sledge hammers may seem like a great weapon, but swinging them is really "
"slow, and you won't do much damage unless you're really strong."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/hints.json
msgid ""
"For a good melee weapon, you can't beat a machete.  I've seen a guy take "
"down a zombie brute with one!  Of course, if you can find a katana, that "
"might be even better…"
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/hints.json
msgid ""
"A knife spear makes a good weapon in a pinch, but a spike strapped to a "
"stick isn't the sturdiest construction.  At least you can strap the spike "
"back on when it comes off."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/hints.json
msgid ""
"You know, a glass bottle can make a good weapon in a pinch.  If you break it"
" over someone's head, the shattering glass will hurt them extra.  Of course,"
" it might hurt your hands, too…"
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/hints.json
msgid ""
"You know what makes a nice weapon?  Take a two by four, or a baseball bat or"
" something, and stick a bunch of nails through the end!"
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/hints.json
msgid ""
"BB guns may seem like a joke, but they've got their uses.  They're good for "
"hunting small game, or getting to know the basics of rifles."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/hints.json
msgid ""
"Crossbows are a great weapon for long term use.  Most of the time, you can "
"retrieve the bolt after shooting it, so running out of ammo is less of a "
"concern."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/hints.json
msgid ""
"Consider going Robin Hood, if you have the strength to pull the string of a "
"bow.  Those larger ones need significant muscle power, but they hit hard, "
"and are silent."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/hints.json
msgid ""
"I hid in a dumpster once or twice.  I may smell bad, but I'm not dead, as "
"they say."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/hints.json
msgid ""
"It's good to keep a pistol handy, in case your main gun runs out of ammo or "
"something.  They're also better than most guns at short range."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/hints.json
msgid ""
"Shotguns are nice; you can take out lots of baddies with a single shot.  "
"Just remember that they're noisy as hell, and you might end up attracting "
"more than you kill."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/hints.json
msgid ""
"A good submachine gun can't be beat.  Most of them use common ammo, they're "
"good at short and long range, and you can burst-fire if you need to!"
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/hints.json
msgid ""
"Hunting rifles are great at long range, but suck close up.  Plus, most of "
"them don't carry many rounds.  Keep a pistol as a sidearm if you use a "
"rifle."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/hints.json
msgid ""
"You know, you don't have to go full auto with an assault rifle.  Firing "
"single shots is more accurate and efficient!"
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/hints.json
msgid ""
"I've seen a couple guys running around with laser pistols.  They seem like "
"the perfect weapon: quiet, accurate, and deadly.  But I've never found one, "
"and I bet ammo is wicked scarce…"
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/hints.json
msgid ""
"When it comes to footwear, you've got two basic choices as far as I see it; "
"sneakers, for running extra fast, or boots for durability.  Depends on your "
"style, I guess."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/hints.json
msgid ""
"You don't really need to wear gloves most of the time, but once in a while "
"they'll really come in handy."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/hints.json
msgid ""
"I wish I could still use those rollerblades.  I would be so fast.  But I "
"took an arrow to the knee, and all that."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/hints.json
msgid ""
"It's good to keep a filter mask or gas mask handy.  You never know when "
"you'll have to go into a smoke-filled room or something."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/hints.json
msgid ""
"There's basically no reason not to wear safety glasses… nothing is worse "
"than taking a hit to the eyes and getting blinded for a few seconds."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/hints.json
msgid ""
"Ski goggles are a great choice if you're worried about getting stuff in your"
" eyes.  Perfect for dealing with boomers!"
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/hints.json
msgid ""
"If you get a pair of night vision goggles, hold on to them!  A flashlight "
"will give you away, but with goggles you can be sneaky.  Beware that some "
"types of zombies are camouflaged against it, and require proper light to be "
"visible."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/hints.json
msgid ""
"I know they look dumb, but wearing a fanny pack gives you that extra bit of "
"storage without encumbering you."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/hints.json
msgid ""
"Backpacks let you carry lots of stuff, but they limit your movement a lot.  "
"If you have to fight a zombie at close range, don't wear one, or at least "
"drop it on the ground before the fight."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/hints.json
msgid ""
"Don't underestimate a good book.  Not only will it keep you company on "
"lonely nights, but you can learn a hell of a lot from some of them."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/hints.json
msgid ""
"It's a good idea to carry around a couple of empty bottles.  You can fill "
"them up with water, gasoline, or whatever!"
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/hints.json
msgid ""
"First aid 101 for you.  Always bandage your wounds, they will heal faster "
"that way.  Bandages are plenty and you can make makeshift ones easily, so "
"there is no reason not to."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/hints.json
msgid ""
"I can bandage you if you are wounded, so give me some spare bandages, if you"
" have any."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/hints.json
msgid ""
"If you have extra antiseptic, use it to disinfect your wounds, even if they "
"aren't infected.  They will recover faster that way."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/hints.json
msgid ""
"Treat your infected wounds as soon as possible.  If the infection spreads "
"only antibiotics may help you, but it will take time, and you may still die "
"from it if it's too serious."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/hints.json
msgid ""
"If you need a bunch of rags for making Molotov cocktails, take a pair of "
"scissors to an old t-shirt or something."
msgstr ""
"Se hai bisogno di un gruppo di stracci per fare le Molotov, prendi un paio "
"di forbici e taglia una vecchia t-shirt o qualcos'altro."

#: data/json/npcs/hints.json
msgid ""
"Carrying a lighter is something all veterans do.  It takes up almost no "
"space, and can easily save your life."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/hints.json
msgid ""
"If you can spare the space, you might want to carry a fire extinguisher "
"along.  Nothing is worse than being trapped in a burning building!"
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/hints.json
msgid ""
"Crowbars not only make a pretty good weapon, they're also useful for opening"
" locked doors and lifting manhole covers."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/hints.json
msgid ""
"If you're spending the night in a dangerous area, grab a shovel and dig pits"
" all around your camp.  If it's more than one night, you might want to put "
"broken glass or sticks inside the pits for better effect."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/hints.json
msgid ""
"A chainsaw may seem like a great weapon, but remember that they're slow, "
"unwieldy, and very noisy."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/hints.json
msgid ""
"Bubblewrap is pretty harmless, but setting it up around you before going to "
"sleep will keep you from waking up to a zombie punching you."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/hints.json
msgid ""
"Bear traps are a nice way to cover an escape.  If you place one in a "
"doorway, the first zombie through will get stuck, and the rest won't be able"
" to get past!"
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/hints.json
msgid ""
"Smoke grenades aren't really offensive weapons, but they'll cover up your "
"scent and hide you from view--perfect for making a quick escape."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/hints.json
msgid "Don't use Molotovs indoors.  Especially in a liquor store."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/hints.json
msgid ""
"If you're going to be playing with Molotov cocktails around a gas station, "
"just make sure you're a long way from those pumps."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/hints.json
msgid ""
"I once knew a guy who figured he'd survive a night in the subway by setting "
"fires blocking off the tunnel in both directions and sleeping between them."
"  He wound up asphyxiating on the smoke."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/hints.json
msgid ""
"Don't light a Molotov until you're ready to throw it.  Not only can they go "
"out, but if you accidentally drop it or something, you're in trouble."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/hints.json
msgid ""
"If you're weak or clumsy, it might be a good idea not to mess with Molotovs "
"or grenades.  Accidentally dropping them when you meant to throw them could "
"be deadly."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/hints.json
msgid ""
"If you're not particularly agile it might be good not to mess with Molotovs "
"or grenades.  Accidents involving these sort of items tend to be grievous."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/hints.json
msgid ""
"If you're wandering in the wilderness, or following a road, keep an eye out "
"for wild strawberries, blueberries and other gifts of nature."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/hints.json
msgid ""
"Be careful eating wild mushrooms.  Some are poisonous, and others can make "
"you hallucinate."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/hints.json
msgid ""
"Try to go around swamps, if you can.  Some of them have sinkholes that can "
"pull you right underground."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/hints.json
msgid ""
"I heard about this group that raided a bee hive a while ago.  Everyone got "
"massacred but one, and he came home with this weird, magic honey stuff."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/hints.json
msgid ""
"If you need to, you can swim across a river to escape; some monsters can't "
"swim.  Just make sure you drop as much stuff as possible first, and maybe "
"strip naked, or you'll sink like a rock."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/hints.json
msgid ""
"Houses can be a surprisingly good resource for all kinds of stuff; clothing,"
" medication, food, books, and more.  People kept all the odd things around, "
"especially in basements."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/hints.json
msgid ""
"While there's not much to loot, gas stations are a good source for gasoline,"
" to power tools or to make Molotov cocktails."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/hints.json
msgid ""
"It's not like in the movies; shooting a gas pump won't make it explode.  But"
" it WILL make it leak all over the place, which is a definite fire hazard."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/hints.json
msgid ""
"I know grocery stores and stuff are full of fruit, but be careful, it's "
"probably rotten."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/hints.json
msgid ""
"Next time you visit a grocery store, load up on canned goods.  They never go"
" bad!"
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/hints.json
msgid ""
"Load up on canned goods if you ever find a grocery store.  Cans never go "
"bad!"
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/hints.json
msgid ""
"I've found more good weapons in hardware stores than anywhere else.  Except "
"gun stores, of course."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/hints.json
msgid ""
"Liquor stores are a great place to pick up non-alcoholic beverages, too.  "
"Not that I mind alcohol!"
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/hints.json
msgid ""
"Most gun stores follow pretty similar layouts.  The restricted stuff - SMGs,"
" assault rifles, and most importantly ammo - are always behind the counter."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/hints.json
msgid ""
"I've spent many nights in the changing rooms at the back of clothing stores."
"  Walls on four sides, far from the store's entrance, a corridor for easy "
"defense… it's perfect!"
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/hints.json
msgid ""
"Have you seen those weird science labs out in the middle of nowhere?  I "
"think you need some kind of special ID card to get in."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/hints.json
msgid ""
"I have a dream of raiding a military bunker, but zombies and armor are a "
"scary mix.  And the sheer thought of being sprayed with bullets by a turret "
"is giving me the shivers."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/hints.json
msgid ""
"I've thought about raiding an ant hill before, but I realized it wasn't "
"worth the risk.  I doubt they have any loot beyond some scraps of food, you "
"know?"
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/hints.json
msgid ""
"This guy I know was walking through the subway when he came across a giant "
"rift in the earth, with lava far below.  Weird, huh?"
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/hints.json
msgid ""
"In a lot of places, there's little hallways connecting the subways with the "
"sewers, with heavy metal doors on both ends.  It's a perfect place to sleep!"
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/hints.json
msgid ""
"Be careful of drinking water from rivers and stuff, it's a good way to get "
"sick.  But if you have a water purifier, it'll make it safe."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/hints.json
msgid ""
"Autodocs are probably your best bet to install bionics - if you can find "
"one!  However, I heard they won't work if you don't bring anesthetics to put"
" you in a sleep."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/hints.json
msgid ""
"Be wary of anything deeper than your average basement.  Some folks heard "
"scary screams from the ventilation shafts of mines and labs.  Very "
"unsettling screams."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/hints.json
msgid "A screwdriver a day keeps the scurvy away!"
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/hints.json
msgid ""
"Hungrier than usual?  Natural oils can help.  Not tasty at all, but who "
"cares when eating your leg is the second option?"
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/hints.json
msgid ""
"Terrain can turn the tide of a battle.  Make sure you use it against your "
"enemies, lest it be used against you."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/hints.json
msgid ""
"Folks that passed by the mine said something about foul smell.  If you plan "
"a visit there consider taking a gas mask with you."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/hints.json
msgid "Knowledge is power.  Seriously, just pick up a book."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/hints.json
msgid "Knowledge is power.  And books are power you can read."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/hints.json
msgid ""
"Knowledge is power.  But not every book you find contains true knowledge."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/hints.json
msgid ""
"Some days are full of sadness.  Reading can help, if you have the right "
"book."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/hints.json
msgid ""
"Nothing can kill you if everything is already dead.  Well, except cold, "
"hunger, and… never mind."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/hints.json
msgid ""
"I met a girl that insisted that she saw a land shark boring through rock, "
"walls, and dirt alike.  I'd consider it a fable, but I've seen things, and "
"can't just say it's a lie."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/hints.json
msgid ""
"Boil first, then drink.  Ten men caravan once drank from a spring, and they "
"are now known as a three man caravan."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/hints.json
msgid ""
"I've once seen a full duffel bag pass hands five times in a week.  Having a "
"lot of stuff is a moot point if you can't run from zombies."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/hints.json
msgid ""
"Tim says you can drive a car through a horde of zombies.  Tim is now a "
"zombie.  Any questions?"
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/hints.json
msgid ""
"They said: go solar, save the environment and yourself.  Well… there is no "
"environment to save now, but one can still save thyself I guess."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/hints.json
msgid ""
"If you can't find a knife try smashing potted plants.  It just might give "
"you everything you need to make one."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/hints.json
msgid ""
"What's the difference between a good and a bad choke point?  The good one "
"has another back door behind you."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/hints.json
msgid ""
"So, methinks: if you could convince the cop-bots that you are their "
"superior…"
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/hints.json
msgid ""
"You'd be surprised how many items can be disassembled into their components."
"  A guy around here, McSomething whatever his name is, is a master at this."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/hints.json
msgid ""
"A soldering iron can be an aspiring mechanic's best friend.  You can also "
"cauterize a wound with it, but as many people died as lived from that "
"treatment, so I guess it's a last resort."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/hints.json
msgid ""
"I've seen some folks running with freshly installed CBMs.  That means there "
"is a way to get them from places other than ransacked shops.  Maybe that "
"explains those cut-up bodies I've seen around."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/hints.json
msgid ""
"I'm fed up with smoked meat, but it lasts so long.  Well… if I had more "
"heart for learning cooking I guess I'd be able to diversify my food without "
"sacrificing its shelf life."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/hints.json
msgid ""
"Tricky Joe was hanged for his inventive ways of killing zombies.  Yeah, "
"burning down a building to smoke few hordes is ok, but burning a whole town "
"with all the loot certainly is not."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/hints.json
msgid ""
"Mr Tombstone always said: take nothing with you for the raids, save the "
"space for loot.  He was known as Joe then and he rightfully earned his "
"nickname as the first tombstone 'owner' around this place."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/hints.json data/raw/tips.json
msgid ""
"When the whole town is one big supermarket a shopping cart becomes your best"
" friend."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/hints.json
msgid ""
"A friend is a second mouth to fill, but when it comes to work four hands are"
" always better than two."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/hints.json
msgid ""
"I was against drugs until I was almost killed by a zombie.  I was hauling my"
" sorry ass away from the horde, with nothing more but some white powder I "
"got from that zombie.  Saved me that time."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/hints.json
msgid ""
"Not sure if Mike is sane any more.  He was unfortunate enough to be driven "
"in to a school one time.  This experience broke more than his ribs then."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/hints.json
msgid ""
"A thought about explosives.  If you can still run and it did not went boom "
"yet, run some more.  There is no such thing as excess space between you and "
"a stick of dynamite."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/hints.json
msgid "Avoid using launchers in narrow hallways, you might miss."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/hints.json
msgid ""
"Met a mad chemist once.  She made a battery from a potato… or was it lemon?"
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/hints.json
msgid ""
"Met a mad chemist once.  She made a battery from a potato, and then nobody "
"was willing to eat the potato."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/hints.json
msgid ""
"Police brutality lives on it seems.  It's just more mechanical now, with all"
" the cops dead and cop robots roaming free on the loose.  If you'll get "
"arrested who will give you justice?  A zombie judge?  Will they put you in a"
" zombie prison?  No thanks, I'll pass."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/hints.json
msgid ""
"Is it dead yet?  How can you tell if it was dead before and it's dead now?  "
"I prefer asking: are?  *smash*  you?  *smash*  dead?  *smash*  yet?  *smash "
"smash smash*"
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/hints.json
msgid ""
"I hear there's strange big berries around, but why don't I hear first hand "
"if they are filling for their size or not?"
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/hints.json
msgid ""
"I've heard of a gang called The Doctors.  You know, bank robbers wearing "
"stethoscopes.  What are they trying to achieve?  I use paper money to start "
"fires now."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/hints.json
msgid ""
"You can hole up on a roof if you need to.  Yeah, the rain will fall on your "
"head, but it's harder for the dead to get you there.  Get a tent, a rollmat,"
" a sleeping bag and you're set."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/hints.json
msgid ""
"I thought about putting a bag on my dog to carry some of my stuff.  It "
"didn't work, because it was a chihuahua, and it was eaten by a rottweiler.  "
"Should have put some Kevlar on it like those Z9.  Oh well…"
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/hints.json
msgid ""
"Civilization has made a step back in time, so let's learn from the past.  No"
" fridges?  Build a root cellar or keep food cool in the basement.  No guns?"
"  Make a pointy stick or a cudgel, and work from there.  The end of the "
"world is not the end, it seems."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/hints.json
msgid ""
"Hey, if you happen to find a set of two two-way radios, give one to me and "
"we will be able to talk while being away from each other."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/hints.json
msgid ""
"If I had the skill to do it, I'd build a boat and sail down the river.  "
"Maybe even towards the ocean.  Or make an amphibious vehicle that could "
"drive on land too.  That would be useful."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/hints.json
msgid ""
"I sink like a rock in water, but I once used a scuba tank to cross a river "
"that had no bridge nearby."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/hints.json
msgid ""
"Can you imagine?  I've heard of people digging graves for loot.  Whole "
"cities lay dead for the taking and they dig graves!  Madness!"
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/hints.json
msgid ""
"When I broke a leg few years ago they had this great machine at the hospital"
" that set the bones in place.  I'd hate to break a limb in this apocalypse, "
"but it's something to remember.  You never know."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/hints.json
msgid ""
"You, me, and another pair of hands and we might even think of settling down."
"  Making a base of our own.  A bastion of hope in the apocalypse.  Think of "
"it."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/hints.json
msgid ""
"Hey if you are leading, just tell me what to do.  You want me to shoot, go "
"melee, use grenades?  I can adjust to your style of fighting."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/hints.json
msgid ""
"Everything seems to mutate nowadays.  Even survivors.  I wonder if I would "
"look good with bunny ears?  Would I hear better?"
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/hints.json
msgid ""
"Everything seems to mutate nowadays.  Even survivors.  Do you think I'd "
"still look good if I had piranha teeth?"
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/hints.json
msgid ""
"Everything seems to mutate nowadays.  Even survivors.  You think I'd look "
"good with thorns growing from my face?"
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/hints.json
msgid ""
"Everything seems to mutate nowadays.  Even survivors.  If my eyeballs began "
"shooting lasers do you think I would still be able see?"
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/hints.json
msgid ""
"Everything seems to mutate nowadays.  Even survivors.  I wonder how I would "
"look with antlers?  Hats would be out of the question…"
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/hints.json
msgid ""
"Winter is a harsh lady.  You need fire to survive, to heat yourself and your"
" water and food.  Keep a cooking device to melt what is frozen, and a "
"thermos for the liquids."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/hints.json
msgid ""
"There is not much gas left for the vehicles.  If I'd plan for the long run, "
"I'd consider learning about steam engines, or maybe making biodiesel."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/hints.json
msgid ""
"Heard a rumor that few cities were evacuated to a place that's not on the "
"maps.  Tough luck finding them now.  But perhaps they don't want to be "
"found.  Or worse - perhaps you don't know that you don't want to find them "
"either, if you catch my drift."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/hints.json
msgid ""
"Heard a rumor about a lady on rollerblades with a fire extinguisher strapped"
" to her back.  Zipping around, hardly wearing no clothes, smashing cannibals"
" in the face with a baseball bat.  Don't that beat all?"
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/hints.json
msgid ""
"Ok, some weird shit now.  Before we met I saw a knight.  No, I'm fine under "
"the hood.  A guy in a full medieval armor was cornered by some zombies.  "
"Much to be said, but half an hour later, he was still alive.  Guess you can "
"take a punch being a walking tin can."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/hints.json
msgid ""
"If you're into electronics, you may try to make a noise emitter from a "
"talking doll, or something that has a speaker.  Why?  To distract the "
"zombies, of course."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/hints.json
msgid ""
"A friend of mine was a hunter and showed me once how to butcher properly.  "
"You need a flat clean surface to place the products, a rack to hang the "
"carcass in the air, and a good knife.  If you're in a forest you may use a "
"tree and a rope.  Big game might require a saw too."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/hints.json
msgid ""
"A friend of mine was a hunter and told me, that if you field dress a corpse,"
" it will stay fresh a bit longer."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/hints.json
msgid ""
"Look at the sky before you go for adventure.  You will know what weather to "
"expect.  It's nothing compared to the old meteorology and satellite "
"pictures, but at least you may know if you need the umbrella."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/hints.json
msgid ""
"Be extra careful on roads.  They are easy to travel on, but occasional "
"minefield or a road block can make you feel sorry in an instant.  I've even "
"seen a tank once.  I ran away like never before."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/hints.json
msgid ""
"I know it's not best of times, but try to sleep well.  You're not yourself "
"if you're sleep deprived.  Grab a pillow and a blanket.  If you can't, even "
"a teddy bear under your head and a pile of clothes to keep you warm can make"
" a difference.  And pick a spot well, even a chair or a bench is better than"
" a cold ground."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/hints.json
msgid ""
"There's no rule against wearing more than one set of pants.  Well, I mean, "
"there probably is, but nothing stopping you from breaking it!"
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/hints.json
msgid ""
"There are two ways of throwing grenades.  The smart one is throwing from "
"behind a corner.  The less smart one involves getting shot while throwing in"
" the open and being torn apart by the resulting explosion."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/hints.json
msgid ""
"Watch out for those turrets they set up at road blocks, they just fire on "
"whatever they see.  If you run into one, keep sandbags or other hard cover "
"between you and it.  Those wooden road barricades only discourage ramming "
"the checkpoint, bullets will just go right through them."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/hints.json
msgid ""
"Don't trust everyone you meet out there.  Some people tend to shoot first "
"and ask questions later.  Keep something solid between you and them and fire"
" over whatever cover you can get.  A good-sized boulder might crack if it "
"takes a rifle bullet, but it'll save your life."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/missiondef.json
msgid "Follow Sarcophagus Team"
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description for mission '{'str': 'Follow Sarcophagus Team'}'
#: data/json/npcs/missiondef.json
msgid ""
"Lead this person with you into a <color_pink>Hazardous Waste "
"Sarcophagus</color>, then talk to them once you've <color_light_red>entered "
"the lower level</color>."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/missiondef.json
msgid "You wouldn't believe what I found…"
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/missiondef.json
msgid ""
"Holy hell, the crash you recovered the black box from wasn't as old as I "
"thought.  Check this out, it was on its approach to pick up a team sent to "
"secure and destroy something called a 'Hazardous Waste Sarcophagus' in the "
"middle of nowhere.  If the bird never picked up the team then we may still "
"have a chance to meet up with them.  It includes an access code for the "
"elevator and an encoded message for the team leader, I guess.  If we want to"
" join up with what remains of the government then now may be our only "
"chance."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/missiondef.json
msgid "Fuck ya, America!"
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/missiondef.json
msgid ""
"Are you going to forfeit your duty when the country needs you the most?"
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/missiondef.json
msgid ""
"If there is a military team down there then we better go in prepared if we "
"want to impress them.  Carry as much ammo as you can and prepare to ditch "
"this place if they have a second bird coming to pick them up."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/missiondef.json
msgid "Having any trouble following the map?"
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/missiondef.json
msgid "We got this shit!"
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/missiondef.json
msgid "What?!  I out'ta whip your ass."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/missiondef.json
msgid "Damn, we were so close."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/missiondef.json
msgid "Find Inhaler"
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description for mission '{'str': 'Find Inhaler'}'
#: data/json/npcs/missiondef.json
msgid ""
"If you don't find an <color_light_blue>inhaler</color> for this person "
"within the time limit, they will <color_red>most likely die</color>."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/missiondef.json
msgid "I'm… short… of breath…"
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/missiondef.json
msgid "I'm asthmatic.  I need you to get an inhaler for me…"
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/missiondef.json
msgid ""
"Oh, thank god, thank you so much!  I won't last more than a couple of days, "
"so hurry…"
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/missiondef.json
msgid "What?!  Please, <ill_die> without your help!"
msgstr "Cosa?! Perfavore, <ill_die> senza il tuo aiuto!"

#: data/json/npcs/missiondef.json
msgid "There's a town nearby.  Check pharmacies; it'll be behind the counter."
msgstr ""
"C'è una città quà vicino. Controlla le farmacie; saranno dietro il banco."

#: data/json/npcs/missiondef.json
msgid "Find any inhaler yet?"
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/missiondef.json
msgid "Oh thank god!  I'll be right as rain in no time."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/missiondef.json
msgid "What?!  You're lying, I can tell!  Ugh, forget it!"
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/missiondef.json
msgid "How am I not dead already?!"
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/missiondef.json
msgid "Find Antibiotics"
msgstr "Trova degli antibiotici"

#. ~ Description for mission '{'str': 'Find Antibiotics'}'
#: data/json/npcs/missiondef.json
msgid ""
"If you don't find <color_light_blue>antibiotics</color> for this person "
"within the time limit, they will <color_red>most likely die</color>."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/missiondef.json
msgid "This infection is bad, <very> bad…"
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/missiondef.json
msgid "I'm infected.  Badly.  I need you to get some antibiotics for me…"
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/missiondef.json
msgid "Find any antibiotics yet?"
msgstr "Hai già trovato degli antibiotici?"

#: data/json/npcs/missiondef.json
msgid "Retrieve Military Black Box"
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description for mission '{'str': 'Retrieve Military Black Box'}'
#: data/json/npcs/missiondef.json
msgid ""
"Obtain a <color_light_blue>black box</color> from a military helicoper, "
"crashed or otherwise, and <color_light_red>extract it from the "
"vehicle</color>."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/missiondef.json
msgid "We've got the flag, now we need to locate US forces."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/missiondef.json
msgid ""
"We have the flag but now we need to locate US troops to see what we can do "
"to help.  I haven't seen any but I'm figure'n one of those choppers that "
"were fly'n round during th' outbreak would have a good idea.  If you can get"
" me a black box from one of the wrecks I'll look into where we might open'er"
" at."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/missiondef.json
msgid "Do you have any better ideas?"
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/missiondef.json
msgid ""
"Survivors were talking about them crashing but I don't know where.  If I "
"were a pilot I'd avoid crash landing in a city or forest though."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/missiondef.json
msgid "How 'bout that black box?"
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/missiondef.json
msgid "America, fuck ya!"
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/missiondef.json
msgid "What?!  I out'ta whip you're ass."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/missiondef.json
msgid "Damn, I'll have to find'er myself."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/missiondef.json
msgid "Retrieve Black Box Transcript"
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description for mission '{'str': 'Retrieve Black Box Transcript'}'
#: data/json/npcs/missiondef.json
msgid ""
"Bring the black box with you into a <color_light_blue>science lab</color>, "
"in order to find a working terminal that might allow you to "
"<color_light_red>access the data on the black box</color>."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/missiondef.json
msgid "With the black box in hand, we need to find a lab."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/missiondef.json
msgid ""
"Thanks to your searching we've got the black box but now we need to have a "
"look'n-side her.  Now, most buildings don't have power anymore but there are"
" a few that might be of use.  Have you ever seen one of those science labs "
"that have popped up in the middle of nowhere?  Them suckers have a glowing "
"terminal out front so I know they have power somewhere inside'em.  If you "
"can get inside and find a computer lab that still works you ought to be able"
" to find out what's in the black box."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/missiondef.json
msgid ""
"When I was play'n with the terminal for the one I ran into it kept asking "
"for an ID card.  Finding one would be the first order of business."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/missiondef.json
msgid ""
"America, fuck ya!  I was in the guard a few years back so I'm confident I "
"can make heads-or-tails of these transmissions."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/missiondef.json
msgid "Damn, I maybe we can find an egg-head to crack the terminal."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/missiondef.json
msgid "Find Deputy Badge"
msgstr "Trova il Distintivo"

#: data/json/npcs/missiondef.json
msgid "Those twisted snakes…"
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/missiondef.json
msgid ""
"I hope you will find use from what you got out of the deposit box but I also"
" have another job for you that might lead you to an opportunity to deal out "
"justice for those who cannot.  First things first, we can't just look like "
"ruffians.  Find us a deputy badge, easy enough?"
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/missiondef.json
msgid "I'd check the police station."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/missiondef.json
msgid ""
"We're also official… just hang in there and I'll show you what we can really"
" do."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/missiondef.json
msgid "They shouldn't be that hard to find… should they?"
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/missiondef.json
msgid "Any luck?"
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/missiondef.json
msgid "Great work, Deputy.  We're in business."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/missiondef.json
#: data/json/npcs/cabin_chemist/chemist_missions.json
#: data/json/npcs/godco/cook.json data/json/npcs/holdouts/Mr_Lapin.json
#: data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/cyrus_whately.json
#: data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/milly_whately_dialogue.json
#: data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/prepnet_dialogue.json
#: data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/whately_dialogue.json
msgid "Thanks for trying…  I guess."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/missiondef.json
msgid "The day of reckoning will come for the criminals if it hasn't already."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/missiondef.json
msgid "Find Flag"
msgstr "Trova la bandiera"

#: data/json/npcs/missiondef.json
msgid "Does our flag still yet wave?"
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/missiondef.json
msgid ""
"Does our flag still yet wave?  We're battered but not yet out of the fight, "
"we need the old colors!"
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/missiondef.json
msgid "Hell ya!  Find me one of those big ol' American flags."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/missiondef.json
msgid "Seriously?  God damned commie…"
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/missiondef.json
msgid "Find a large federal building or school, they must have one."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/missiondef.json
msgid "Rescued the standard yet?"
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/missiondef.json
msgid "What?!  You liar!"
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/missiondef.json
msgid ""
"You give up?  This country fell apart because no one could find a good man "
"to rely on… might as well give up, I guess."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/missiondef.json
msgid "Find Corporate Accounts"
msgstr "Trova i Conti Aziendali"

#: data/json/npcs/missiondef.json
msgid ""
"Our world fell apart because our leaders were as crooked as the con-men that"
" paid for their elections.  Just find me one of those corporate accounting "
"books and I'll show you and the rest of the world just who is at fault."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/missiondef.json
msgid "You'll see, I know I'm right."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/missiondef.json
msgid ""
"I know it isn't pressing but the big corporations didn't get a chance to "
"destroy the evidence yet."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/missiondef.json
msgid ""
"Try a big corporate building of some sort, they're bound to have an "
"accounting department."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/missiondef.json
msgid ""
"Great, let's see… uh… hmmm…  Fine, I didn't even do my own taxes but I'm "
"sure this will prove their guilt if we get an expert to examine it."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/missiondef.json
msgid ""
"The day of reckoning will come for the corporations if it hasn't already."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/missiondef.json
msgid "Find Patient Records"
msgstr "Trova il registro dei pazienti"

#: data/json/npcs/missiondef.json
msgid "I hope I don't see many names I know…"
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/missiondef.json
msgid ""
"I've lost so many friends… please find me a patient list from the regional "
"hospital or doctor's office.  I just want to know who might still be out "
"there."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/missiondef.json
msgid ""
"Thank you, I suppose it won't change what has already happened but it will "
"bring me closure."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/missiondef.json
msgid "Please, I just want to know what happened to everyone."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/missiondef.json
msgid ""
"I bet you'll run into a lot of those things in the hospital, please be "
"careful."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/missiondef.json
msgid "Oh dear, I thought Timmy would have made it…"
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/missiondef.json
msgid "I bet some of them are still out there…"
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/missiondef.json
msgid "Find Weather Log"
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/missiondef.json
msgid "I wonder if a retreat might exist…"
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/missiondef.json
msgid ""
"Everyone who dies gets back up, right?  Which means that whatever is causing"
" this it must be airborne to have infected everyone.  I believe that if that"
" is the case then there should be regions that were not downwind from where-"
"ever the disease was released.  We need to find a record of all the weather "
"patterns leading up to the outbreak."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/missiondef.json
msgid "Thanks so much, you may save both of us yet."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/missiondef.json
msgid "Ya, it was a long shot I admit."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/missiondef.json
msgid "I'm not sure, maybe a news station would have what we are looking for?"
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/missiondef.json
msgid "These look more complicated than I thought, just give me some time."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/missiondef.json
msgid "This isn't what we need."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/missiondef.json
msgid "If only we could find a great valley or something."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/missiondef.json
msgid "Find Relic"
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/missiondef.json
msgid "St. Michael the archangel defend me in battle…"
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/missiondef.json
msgid ""
"As the world seems to abandon the reality that we once knew, it becomes "
"plausible that the old superstitions that were cast aside may have had some "
"truth to them.  Please go and find me a religious relic…  I doubt it will be"
" of much use but I've got to hope in something."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/missiondef.json
msgid ""
"I wish you the best of luck, may whatever god you please guide your path."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/missiondef.json
msgid "Ya, I guess the stress may just be getting to me…"
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/missiondef.json
msgid "I suppose a large church or cathedral may have something."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/missiondef.json
msgid "Any luck?  Please find me a small relic.  Any relic will do."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/missiondef.json
msgid "Thank you, I need some time alone now…"
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/missiondef.json
#: data/json/npcs/isherwood_farm/NPC_Carlos_Isherwood.json
#: data/json/npcs/isherwood_farm/NPC_Claire_Isherwood.json
#: data/json/npcs/isherwood_farm/NPC_Eddie_Isherwood.json
#: data/json/npcs/isherwood_farm/NPC_Jack_Isherwood.json
#: data/json/npcs/necropolis/NPC_Old_Guard_Captain.json
#: data/json/npcs/necropolis/NPC_Old_Guard_Commo.json
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_refugees/NPC_Uyen_Tran.json
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_staff/NPC_free_merchant_broker.json
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_staff/NPC_free_merchant_shopkeep.json
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_staff/NPC_old_guard_doctor.json
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_visitors/NPC_old_guard_representative.json
#: data/json/npcs/robofac/NPC_ROBOFAC_INTERCOM.json
#: data/json/npcs/tacoma_ranch/NPC_ranch_bartender.json
#: data/json/npcs/tacoma_ranch/NPC_ranch_foreman.json
#: data/json/npcs/tacoma_ranch/NPC_ranch_nurse.json
#: data/json/npcs/tacoma_ranch/NPC_ranch_scavenger.json
#: data/json/obsoletion/missions.json
#: data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/milly_whately_dialogue.json
#: data/mods/DinoMod/NPC/NC_Red.json
msgid "What good does this do us?"
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/missiondef.json
#: data/json/npcs/isherwood_farm/NPC_Carlos_Isherwood.json
#: data/json/npcs/isherwood_farm/NPC_Chris_Isherwood.json
#: data/json/npcs/isherwood_farm/NPC_Eddie_Isherwood.json
#: data/json/npcs/isherwood_farm/NPC_Jesse_Isherwood.json
#: data/json/npcs/necropolis/NPC_Old_Guard_Captain.json
#: data/json/npcs/necropolis/NPC_Old_Guard_Commo.json
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_refugees/NPC_Uyen_Tran.json
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_staff/NPC_free_merchant_shopkeep.json
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_staff/NPC_old_guard_doctor.json
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_visitors/NPC_old_guard_representative.json
#: data/json/npcs/tacoma_ranch/NPC_ranch_bartender.json
#: data/json/npcs/tacoma_ranch/NPC_ranch_foreman.json
#: data/json/npcs/tacoma_ranch/NPC_ranch_nurse.json
#: data/json/npcs/tacoma_ranch/NPC_ranch_scavenger.json
#: data/json/obsoletion/missions.json data/mods/DinoMod/NPC/NC_Red.json
msgid "It was a lost cause anyways…"
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/missiondef.json
msgid "Retrieve Deposit Box"
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/missiondef.json
msgid ""
"Now I don't mean to upset you but I'm not sure what I can do with the "
"accounting ledger at the moment.  We do have a new lead though, the ledger "
"has a safe deposit box under the regional manager's name.  Guess what, dumb "
"sucker wrote down his combination.  Come with me to retrieve the box and you"
" can keep any of the goodies in it that I can't use to press charges against"
" these bastards."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/missiondef.json
msgid "You may make a tidy profit from this."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/missiondef.json
msgid ""
"I know it isn't pressing but the world is going to be just as corrupt when "
"we start rebuilding unless we take measure to stop those who seek to rule "
"over us."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/missiondef.json
msgid "This shouldn't be hard unless we run into a horde."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/missiondef.json
msgid ""
"Great, anything I can't use to prosecute the bastards is yours, as promised."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/missiondef.json
msgid "Retrieve Software"
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description for mission '{'str': 'Retrieve Software'}'
#: data/json/npcs/missiondef.json
msgid ""
"Visit the location this person requested you to visit and "
"<color_light_red>access the terminal their software is stored on</color>.  "
"You'll need to bring an <color_light_blue>empty USB drive</color> with you."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/missiondef.json
msgid "Oh man, I can't believe I forgot to download it…"
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/missiondef.json
msgid "There's some important software on my computer that I need on USB."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/missiondef.json
msgid "Thanks!  Just pull the data onto this USB drive and bring it to me."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/missiondef.json
msgid "Seriously?  It's an easy job…"
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/missiondef.json
msgid "Take this USB drive.  Use the console, and download the software."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/missiondef.json
msgid "So, do you have my software yet?"
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/missiondef.json
msgid "Excellent, thank you!"
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/missiondef.json
msgid "Wow, you failed?  All that work, down the drain…"
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/missiondef.json
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_staff/NPC_old_guard_doctor.json
msgid "Analyze Zombie Blood"
msgstr "Analizza il sangue di uno zombie"

#. ~ Description for mission '{'str': 'Analyze Zombie Blood'}'
#: data/json/npcs/missiondef.json
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_staff/NPC_old_guard_doctor.json
msgid ""
"Use a <color_light_blue>blood draw kit</color> to extract <color_red>tainted"
" blood</color> from a zombie, then bring the blood sample to a "
"<color_red>hospital</color> and locate a centrifuge to analyze the blood "
"with."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/missiondef.json
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_staff/NPC_old_guard_doctor.json
msgid "It could be very informative to perform an analysis of zombie blood…"
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/missiondef.json
msgid ""
"I need someone to get a sample of zombie blood, take it to a hospital, and "
"perform a centrifuge analysis of it."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/missiondef.json
msgid ""
"Excellent.  Take this blood draw kit; once you've produced a zombie corpse, "
"use it to extract blood from the body, then take it to a hospital for "
"analysis."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/missiondef.json
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_staff/NPC_old_guard_doctor.json
msgid ""
"Are you sure?  The scientific value of that blood data could be priceless…"
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/missiondef.json
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_staff/NPC_old_guard_doctor.json
msgid ""
"The centrifuge is a bit technical; you might want to study up on the usage "
"of computers before completing that part."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/missiondef.json
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_staff/NPC_old_guard_doctor.json
msgid "Well, do you have the data yet?"
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/missiondef.json
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_staff/NPC_old_guard_doctor.json
msgid "Excellent!  This may be the key to removing the infection."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/missiondef.json
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_staff/NPC_old_guard_doctor.json
msgid "Wait, you couldn't possibly have the data!  Liar!"
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/missiondef.json
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_staff/NPC_old_guard_doctor.json
msgid "What a shame, that data could have proved invaluable…"
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/missiondef.json
msgid "Investigate Cult"
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/missiondef.json
msgid ""
"You have no idea how interesting this diary is.  I have two very promising "
"leads…  First things first, the Catholic Church has been performing its own "
"investigations into global cult phenomenon and it appears to have become "
"very interested in a local cult as of recently.  Could you investigate a "
"location for me?  I'm not sure what was going on here but the priest seemed "
"fairly worried about it."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/missiondef.json
msgid ""
"I wish you the best of luck, may whatever god you please guide your path…  "
"You may need it this time more than the past excursions you have gone on.  "
"There is a note about potential human sacrifice in the days immediately "
"before and after the outbreak.  The name of the cult is believed to be the "
"Church of Starry Wisdom but it is noted that accounts differ."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/missiondef.json
msgid ""
"I doubt the site is still occupied but I'd carry a firearm at least…  I'm "
"not sure what you might be looking for but I'm positive you'll find "
"something out of the ordinary if you look long enough."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/missiondef.json
msgid "I'm positive there is something there… there has to be, any luck?"
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/missiondef.json
msgid ""
"Thank you, your account of these… demonic creations proves the fears the "
"churches had were well founded.  Our priority should be routing out any "
"survivors of this cult…  I don't known if they are responsible for the "
"outbreak but they certainly know more about it than I do."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/missiondef.json
msgid "Prison Visionary"
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/missiondef.json
msgid ""
"I have another task if you are feeling up to it.  There is a prisoner that "
"the priest made special mention of.  I was wondering if you could see what "
"may have happened to him or if he left anything in his cell.  The priest "
"admits the individual is rather unstable, to put it lightly, but the priest "
"personally believed the man was some kind of repentant visionary.  I'm not "
"in a position to cast out the account just yet… it seems the man has "
"prophesied events accurately before concerning the Church of Starry Wisdom."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/missiondef.json
msgid ""
"I wish you the best of luck, may whatever god you please guide your path…  I"
" can only imagine that the prison will be a little slice of hell.  I'm not "
"sure what they would have decided to do with the inmates when they knew "
"death was almost certain.  "
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/missiondef.json
msgid ""
"The worst case scenario will probably be that the prisoners have escaped "
"their cells and turned the building into their own little fortress.  Best "
"case, the building went into lock-down and secured the prisoners in their "
"cells.  Either way, navigating the building will pose its own difficulties."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/missiondef.json
msgid ""
"Things were even worse than I feared, weren't they?  Thank you, I'm not sure"
" what to make of this but I'll ponder your account.  It may have been too "
"late to save him, but his writings may still prove useful in time."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/missiondef.json
msgid "Well damn, you must be the guys here to pick me up…"
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/missiondef.json
msgid ""
"I got the brief so I know what I'm getting into.  Let me be upfront, treat "
"me like shit and I'm going to cover my own hide.  However, you treat me well"
" and give me something to believe in, even if it's just a shiny bit of "
"metal, and I'll do you right.  Without a strong band a man doesn't stand a "
"chance in this world.  You ready to take charge boss?  This world could use "
"a Sheriff just about now."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/missiondef.json
msgid ""
"Before we get into a major fight just make sure we have the gear we need, "
"boss."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/missiondef.json
msgid ""
"I don't think you're going to find many other survivors who haven't taken up"
" a faction yet."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/missiondef.json
msgid "I'm a pretty good shot with a rifle or pistol."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/missiondef.json
msgid "Any problems boss?"
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/missiondef.json
msgid "Wait… are you really making me a deputy?"
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/missiondef.json
msgid "I don't think so…"
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/missiondef.json
msgid "Quitting already?"
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/missiondef.json
msgid "Kill 100 Zombies"
msgstr "Uccidi 100 Zombie"

#: data/json/npcs/missiondef.json
msgid "You seem to know this new world better than most…"
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/missiondef.json
msgid ""
"You're kitted out better than most… would you be interested in making this "
"world a little better for the rest of us?  The towns have enough supplies "
"for us survivors to start securing a foothold but we don't have anyone with "
"the skills and equipment to thin the masses of undead.  I'll lend you a hand"
" to the best of my ability but you really showed promise taking out that "
"other beast.  You, I, and a 100 zombies laid to rest, what do you say?"
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/missiondef.json
msgid ""
"Hell ya, we may get ourselves killed but we'll be among the first legends of"
" the apocalypse."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/missiondef.json
msgid ""
"Hey, I know I wouldn't volunteer for it either… but then I remember that "
"most of us survivors won't make it unless someone decides to take the "
"initiative."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/missiondef.json
msgid "I'd secure an ammo cache and try to sweep a town in multiple passes."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/missiondef.json
msgid "Got this knocked out?"
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/missiondef.json
msgid ""
"Man… you're a goddamn machine.  It was a pleasure working with you.  You "
"know, you may just change our little neck of the world if you keep this up."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/missiondef.json
msgid "I don't think that was quite a hundred dead zeds."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/missiondef.json
msgid "Kill Horde Master"
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/missiondef.json
msgid "I've heard some bad rumors so I hope you are up for another challenge…"
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/missiondef.json
msgid ""
"Apparently one of the other survivors picked up on an unusually dense horde "
"of undead moving into the area.  At the center of this throng there was a "
"'leader' of some sort.  The short of it is, kill the son of a bitch.  We "
"don't know what it is capable of or why it is surrounded by other zombies "
"but this thing reeks of trouble.  Do whatever it takes but we can't risk it "
"getting away."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/missiondef.json
msgid ""
"I'll lend you a hand but I'd try and recruit another gunslinger if you can."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/missiondef.json
msgid "What's the use of walking away, they'll track you down eventually."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/missiondef.json
msgid ""
"Don't risk torching the building it may be hiding in if it has a basement.  "
"The sucker may still be alive under the rubble and ash."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/missiondef.json
msgid "May that bastard never get up again."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/missiondef.json
msgid "I don't think we got it yet."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/missiondef.json
msgid "Kill Your Pursuer"
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description for mission '{'str': 'Kill Your Pursuer'}'
#: data/json/npcs/missiondef.json
msgid ""
"Since the start of the Cataclysm, something has been hunting you "
"relentlessly.  You can outrun it but never truly escape it.  It won't end "
"until one of you dies."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/missiondef.json
msgid "Kill Jabberwock"
msgstr "Uccidi il Jabberwock"

#: data/json/npcs/missiondef.json
msgid ""
"The eater of the dead… something was ripping zombies to shreds and only "
"leaving a few scattered limbs…"
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/missiondef.json
msgid ""
"A few days ago another survivor and I were trying to avoid the cities by "
"staying in the woods during the day and foraging for gear at night.  It "
"worked well against the normal zed's but one night something caught onto our"
" trail and chased us for ten minutes or so until we decided to split up and "
"meet-up back here.  My buddy never showed up and I don't have the means to "
"kill whatever it was.  Can you lend a hand?"
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/missiondef.json
msgid "Thanks, make sure you're ready for whatever the beast is."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/missiondef.json
msgid "Hey, I know I wouldn't volunteer for it either."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/missiondef.json
msgid "I'd carry a shotgun at least, it sounded pretty big."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/missiondef.json
msgid ""
"You look a little shaken up, I can't tell you how glad I am that you killed "
"it though."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/missiondef.json
msgid ""
"Something in the shadows still seems to stare at me when I look at the "
"woods."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/missiondef.json
msgid ""
"I'm glad you came back alive…  I wasn't sure if I had sent you to your "
"death."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/missiondef.json
msgid "Kill Zombie Mom"
msgstr "Uccidi la madre zombificata"

#: data/json/npcs/missiondef.json
msgid "Oh god, I can't believe it happened…"
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/missiondef.json
msgid ""
"My mom… she's… she was killed, but then she just got back up… she's one of "
"those things now.  Can you put her out of her misery for me?"
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/missiondef.json
msgid "Thank you… she would've wanted it this way."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/missiondef.json
msgid "Please reconsider, I know she's suffering…"
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/missiondef.json
msgid "Find a gun if you can, make it quick…"
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/missiondef.json
msgid "Well…?  Did you… finish things for my mom?"
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/missiondef.json
msgid "Thank you.  I couldn't rest until I knew that was finished."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/missiondef.json
msgid "Really… that's too bad."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/missiondef.json
msgid "Null mission"
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/missiondef.json
msgid "Reach Farm House"
msgstr "Raggiungi la Fattoria"

#. ~ Description for mission '{'str': 'Reach Farm House'}'
#: data/json/npcs/missiondef.json
msgid ""
"Lead this person with you into a <color_brown>Farm</color>, then talk to "
"them once you've <color_light_red>reached the farm house</color>."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/missiondef.json
msgid "I just need a place to start over…"
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/missiondef.json
msgid ""
"I've accepted that everyone I used to know is dead… one way or another.  I "
"really wish I could have done something to save my brother but he was one of"
" the first to go.  I'd like to start over, just rebuild at one of the farms "
"in the countryside.  Can you help me secure one?"
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/missiondef.json
msgid ""
"Thank you, let's find a remote one so we don't have to worry about many "
"zombies."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/missiondef.json
msgid "Please, I just don't know what to do otherwise."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/missiondef.json
msgid "Traveling the backroads would be a good way to search for one."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/missiondef.json
msgid "Shall we keep looking for a farm house?"
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/missiondef.json
msgid ""
"Well, my adventuring days are over.  I can't thank you enough.  Trying to "
"make this place self sustaining will take some work but the future is "
"looking brighter.  At least it ought to be safe for now.  You'll always be "
"welcome here."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/missiondef.json
msgid "I guess it was just a pipe dream."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/missiondef.json
msgid "Reach FEMA Camp"
msgstr "Raggiungi il Campo FEMA"

#. ~ Description for mission '{'str': 'Reach FEMA Camp'}'
#: data/json/npcs/missiondef.json
msgid ""
"Lead this person with you into a <color_blue>FEMA Camp</color>, then talk to"
" them once you've <color_light_red>reached the main entrance</color>."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/missiondef.json
msgid "Maybe they escaped to one of the camps…"
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/missiondef.json
msgid ""
"I can't thank you enough for bringing me the patient records but I do have "
"another request.  You seem to know your way around… could you take me to one"
" of the FEMA camps?  I know some were overrun but I don't want to believe "
"all of them could have fallen."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/missiondef.json
msgid "Thank you, just bring me to the camp…  I just want to see."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/missiondef.json
msgid "Please, I don't know what else to do."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/missiondef.json
msgid ""
"We should go at night, if it is overrun then we can quickly make our escape."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/missiondef.json
msgid "Any leads on where a camp might be?"
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/missiondef.json
msgid "I guess this wasn't as bright an idea as I thought."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/missiondef.json
msgid "Refuel your aircraft."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description for mission '{'str': 'Refuel your aircraft.'}'
#: data/json/npcs/missiondef.json
msgid ""
"You were flying towards a nearby private airport before your forced landing."
"  You could still reach it by ground, and scavenge it for fuel."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/missiondef.json
msgid "Reach Safety"
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/missiondef.json
msgid "Finish The Delivery"
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description for mission '{'str': 'Finish The Delivery'}'
#: data/json/npcs/missiondef.json
msgid "Reach the mansion and finish this delivery."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/missiondef.json
msgid "Recover Priest's Diary"
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/missiondef.json
msgid ""
"From what I understand, the creatures you encountered surrounding this relic"
" were unlike anything I've heard of.  It is laughable that I now consider "
"the living dead to be part of our ordinary reality.  Never-the-less, the "
"church must have some explanation for these events.  I have located the "
"residence of a local clergy man, could you go to this address and recover "
"any items that may reveal what the church's stance is on these events?"
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/missiondef.json
msgid ""
"If the information is confidential the priest must have it hidden within his"
" own home."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/missiondef.json
msgid "Thank you, a diary is exactly what I was looking for."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/missiondef.json
msgid "Recruit Tracker"
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/missiondef.json
msgid ""
"We've got another problem to deal with but I don't think we can handle it on"
" our own.  So, I sent word out and found us a volunteer… of sorts.  He's "
"vain as hell but has a little skill with firearms.  He was supposed to "
"collect whatever he had of value and is going to meet us at a cabin in the "
"woods.  Wasn't sure how long we were going to be so I told him to just camp "
"there until we picked him up."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/missiondef.json
msgid ""
"Rodger, if he's a no-show then any other gunslinger will do… but I doubt "
"he'll quit before we even begin."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/missiondef.json
msgid ""
"I hope the bastard is packing heat… else we'll need to grab him a gun before"
" we hit our next target."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/missiondef.json
msgid "Found a gunslinger?"
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/missiondef.json
msgid ""
"Great, just let me know when you are ready to wade knee-deep in an ocean of "
"blood."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/missiondef.json
msgid "Find Lost Dog"
msgstr "Trova il cane perduto"

#: data/json/npcs/missiondef.json
msgid "Oh, my poor puppy…"
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/missiondef.json
msgid ""
"I left my poor dog in a house, not far from here.  Can you retrieve it?"
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/missiondef.json
msgid "Thank you!  Please hurry back!"
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/missiondef.json
msgid "Please, think of my poor little puppy!"
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/missiondef.json
msgid ""
"Take my dog whistle; if the dog starts running off, blow it and he'll return"
" to your side."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/missiondef.json
msgid "Have you found my dog yet?"
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/missiondef.json
msgid "Thank you so much for finding him!"
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/missiondef.json
msgid "Oh no!  My poor puppy…"
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/missiondef.json
msgid "Retrieve Family Photo"
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description for mission '{'str': 'Retrieve Family Photo'}'
#: data/json/npcs/missiondef.json
msgid "Break into armory to retrieve family photo."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/missiondef.json
msgid "I need you to get my family photo from the armory safe."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/missiondef.json
msgid ""
"I left the only photo I have from my family in the armory.  I don't have the"
" code, can you get in?"
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/missiondef.json
msgid "Thanks, it's great to see someone willing to help a out."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/missiondef.json
msgid ""
"Well, I'll find someone else to do it for me, real shame with all those guns"
" locked up too…"
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/missiondef.json
msgid "You look like a resourceful sort, maybe you can hack it or something."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/missiondef.json
msgid "Got the photo?  Should've been in my gun safe."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/missiondef.json
msgid "Thanks!  I'll be sure to put in a good word for you around town."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/missiondef.json
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_staff/NPC_free_merchant_guard1.json
msgid "OK, then hand it over."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/missiondef.json
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_staff/NPC_free_merchant_guard1.json
msgid "Shit happens."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/missiondef.json
msgid "Find Antibiotics Before You Die!"
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/missiondef.json
msgid "Prove your worth to Foodperson"
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/missiondef.json
msgid "Prove your dedication to Foodplace."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/missiondef.json
msgid ""
"Show me the proof of your loyalty to the great Foodplace, and I'll consider "
"you worthy of my friendship.  Ten loyalty cards should be enough, I'm sure "
"you already have much more than that waiting for you at home, right?"
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/missiondef.json
msgid "That's the spirit!  Good luck kid."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/missiondef.json
msgid "That's alright not everyone is cutout for this."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/missiondef.json
msgid ""
"Those are very precious, people would probably keep them on their person or "
"in bank vaults.  And definitely not throw them in the trash!"
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/missiondef.json
msgid "How is it going?  Do you have them?"
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/missiondef.json
msgid ""
"YES!  I knew you could do it!  You proved your worth and I'm proud to call "
"you a friend."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/missiondef.json
msgid "Well…  where are they?"
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/missiondef.json
msgid "I'm so disappointed in you kid…"
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/missiondef.json
msgid "Prove You're A Survivor"
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description for mission '{'str': "Prove You're A Survivor"}'
#: data/json/npcs/missiondef.json
msgid ""
"Prove you're a survivor by surviving for 7 days after the Cataclysm, and "
"then returning to the person who gave you this mission."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/missiondef.json
msgid "It's hard to tell who actually has the skills to survive these days…"
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/missiondef.json
msgid ""
"It's hard surviving out here on our own, and we'd probably have a better "
"chance working together.  Problem is, I don't really know you and what "
"you're capable of.  You might have what it takes, or you might not.  Either "
"way, I'm going to need some proof.  Come back in a week and I'll gladly "
"follow you.  It's basically a win-win for me: either you come back and I'll "
"know you've got what it takes, or you don't and I'll know that I was right "
"not to follow you."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/missiondef.json
msgid ""
"I'll see you then…or I won't, and then I'll know I made the right decision."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/missiondef.json
msgid ""
"Don't die.  If you're asking me for advice, that doesn't bode well for you."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/missiondef.json
msgid "Don't think it's been a week, but at least you're not dead…yet."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/missiondef.json
msgid ""
"I'll be honest, I wasn't really expecting to see you again.  A promise is a "
"promise, I'll follow you now!"
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/missiondef.json
msgid "I know time is relative and all that."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/missiondef.json
msgid "I'm not quite sure how you failed to survive AND are talking to me."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/missiondef.json
msgid "Gather Cattail Stalks"
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description for mission '{'str': 'Gather Cattail Stalks'}'
#: data/json/npcs/missiondef.json
msgid ""
"Gather <color_light_blue>20 cattail stalks</color> from the swamp and bring "
"them back to <color_light_red>learn how to craft cattail jelly</color>.  "
"Raise your <color_light_blue>survival skill to at least 1</color> by "
"harvesting cattail stalks or other plants.  <color_light_blue>Bring back the"
" provided bag</color> as well."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/missiondef.json
msgid ""
"Medical services are a little sparse following <the_cataclysm>, but people "
"have been surviving using their wits and the bounty of Mother Nature for a "
"long time.  Care to learn a little?"
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/missiondef.json
msgid ""
"Did you know that cattails are a source of a jelly that works as an "
"antiseptic and analgesic?  Something like that is likely to be mighty "
"helpful out here.  I want you to take this bag, head to the nearest swamp, "
"collect 20 cattail stalks, and bring them back here.  In exchange, I'll show"
" you how to harvest the jelly."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/missiondef.json
msgid ""
"Great!  This bag should be big enough to hold all of the stalks we'll need."
"  Don't forget to bring it back."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/missiondef.json
msgid "Your loss."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/missiondef.json
msgid "The cattails grow in the fresh water in swamps.  You can't miss them."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/missiondef.json
msgid ""
"Got those cattail stalks yet?  Don't forget to bring back my bag and improve"
" your survival skill to at least 1 as well."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/missiondef.json
msgid "Great!  Hand them over and I'll show you how this works."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/missiondef.json
msgid "OK, then hand them over."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/missiondef.json
msgid "Well, that's a shame."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/missiondef.json
msgid "One Last Assassination"
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description for mission '{'str': 'One Last Assassination'}'
#: data/json/npcs/missiondef.json
msgid ""
"Your mission required you to eliminate a certain high-ranking individual in "
"hiding.  Your mark seems to have turned feral while escaping and the world "
"appears to be ending, but not even that can stop you from finishing your "
"mission."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/missiondef.json
msgid "Protect Your Canine Friends!"
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description for mission '{'str': 'Protect Your Canine Friends!'}'
#: data/json/npcs/missiondef.json
msgid ""
"Search any nearby pet stores for armor for your pups. You think you remember"
" the location of one..."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/missiondef.json
msgid "The Final Heist"
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description for mission '{'str': 'The Final Heist'}'
#: data/json/npcs/missiondef.json
msgid ""
"You and your crew swore the last job was the last job - until the dead "
"started getting involved. Now, with old friends, loaded guns, and one "
"impossible score, you’ve got one shot to pull this off before the grave "
"claims you too."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/missiondef.json
msgid "Rebuild the Neighborhood"
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description for mission '{'str': 'Rebuild the Neighborhood'}'
#: data/json/npcs/missiondef.json
msgid ""
"The old neighborhood may never be the same - but we can rebuild a new one "
"from the ground up, starting at the hardware store."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/missiondef.json
msgid "One Big Nest"
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description for mission '{'str': 'One Big Nest'}'
#: data/json/npcs/missiondef.json
msgid ""
"This isn’t just another infestation - it’s something new, something bigger "
"than anything you ever had to deal with before the Cataclysm. The nest is "
"massive, the pests inside meaner and tougher than the ones you used to spray"
" and squash. This is the ultimate extermination job: locate the nest, gear "
"up, and clear it out. If you survive, there won’t be anything left inside to"
" crawl back out."
msgstr ""

