#. ~ Description for {'str': 'leaf spring'}
#: data/json/obsoletion/items.json
msgid ""
"A large, heavy-duty leaf spring.  Probably from some car or truck, and looks"
" an awful lot like a bow.  You can barely bend it…"
msgstr ""

#: data/json/obsoletion/items.json
msgid "makeshift grenade"
msgid_plural "makeshift grenades"
msgstr[0] ""
msgstr[1] ""
msgstr[2] ""

#. ~ Use action msg for {'str': 'makeshift grenade'}.
#: data/json/obsoletion/items.json
msgid "You pull the pin on the makeshift grenade."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'makeshift grenade'}
#: data/json/obsoletion/items.json
msgid ""
"An improvised explosive device cobbled together from parts.  Use this item "
"to pull the pin and light the fuse.  You will then have about 5 seconds "
"before it explodes; throwing it would be a good idea."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/obsoletion/items.json
msgid "active makeshift grenade"
msgid_plural "active makeshift grenades"
msgstr[0] ""
msgstr[1] ""
msgstr[2] ""

#: data/json/obsoletion/items.json
msgid "barrel extension"
msgid_plural "barrel extensions"
msgstr[0] ""
msgstr[1] ""
msgstr[2] ""

#: data/json/obsoletion/items.json
msgid ""
"A longer barrel increases the muzzle velocity of a firearm, contributing to "
"both accuracy and damage but reduces portability and slows aiming."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/obsoletion/items.json
msgid "rifled barrel"
msgid_plural "rifled barrels"
msgstr[0] ""
msgstr[1] ""
msgstr[2] ""

#: data/json/obsoletion/items.json
msgid ""
"Rifling a shotgun barrel is mainly done in order to improve its accuracy "
"when firing slugs.  The rifling makes the gun less suitable for shot, "
"however."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/obsoletion/items.json
msgid "rapid blowback"
msgid_plural "rapid blowbacks"
msgstr[0] ""
msgstr[1] ""
msgstr[2] ""

#: data/json/obsoletion/items.json
msgid ""
"An improved blowback mechanism makes your firearm's automatic fire faster, "
"at the cost of reduced accuracy and increased noise."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/obsoletion/items.json
msgid ".22 caliber conversion kit"
msgid_plural ".22 caliber conversion kits"
msgstr[0] ""
msgstr[1] ""
msgstr[2] ""

#: data/json/obsoletion/items.json
msgid ""
"Replacing several key parts of a 9x19mm, .38, .40, 5.7mm, 4.6mm, 7.62x39mm "
"or .223 firearm converts it to a .22 firearm.  The conversion results in a "
"slight reduction to accuracy."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/obsoletion/items.json
msgid "7.62x51mm caliber conversion kit"
msgid_plural "7.62x51mm caliber conversion kits"
msgstr[0] ""
msgstr[1] ""
msgstr[2] ""

#: data/json/obsoletion/items.json
msgid ""
"This kit is used to convert a shotgun or 7.62x39mm, .223 or .30-06 rifle to "
"the popular and powerful 7.62x51mm caliber.  The conversion results in "
"reduced ammo capacity and a slight reduction to accuracy."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/obsoletion/items.json
msgid ".45 caliber conversion kit"
msgid_plural ".45 caliber conversion kits"
msgstr[0] ""
msgstr[1] ""
msgstr[2] ""

#: data/json/obsoletion/items.json
msgid ""
"Replacing several key parts of a 9x19mm, .38, .40 or .44 firearm converts it"
" to a .45 firearm.  The conversion results in a slight reduction to "
"accuracy."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/obsoletion/items.json
msgid "9x19mm caliber conversion kit"
msgid_plural "9x19mm caliber conversion kits"
msgstr[0] ""
msgstr[1] ""
msgstr[2] ""

#: data/json/obsoletion/items.json
msgid ""
"Replacing several key parts of a 9x18mm, .38, .40, .44 or .45 firearm "
"converts it to a 9x19mm firearm.  The conversion results in a slight "
"reduction to accuracy."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/obsoletion/items.json data/json/obsoletion/uncategorized.json
msgid "Magnesium Supplements"
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of effect 'Magnesium Supplements'.
#: data/json/obsoletion/items.json data/json/obsoletion/uncategorized.json
msgid ""
"You took some magnesium supplements.  These will help with sleep "
"deprivation."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/obsoletion/items.json
msgid "Internal Furnace CBM"
msgid_plural "Internal Furnace CBMs"
msgstr[0] "CBM Fornace Interna"
msgstr[1] "CBM Fornaci Interne"
msgstr[2] "CBM Fornaci Interne"

#: data/json/obsoletion/items.json
msgid "Internal Storage CBM"
msgid_plural "Internal Storage CBMs"
msgstr[0] ""
msgstr[1] ""
msgstr[2] ""

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'Internal Storage CBM'}
#: data/json/obsoletion/items.json
msgid ""
"Space inside your chest cavity has been converted into a storage area.  You "
"may carry an extra 2 liters of volume."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/obsoletion/items.json
msgid "homemade laser pistol"
msgid_plural "homemade laser pistols"
msgstr[0] ""
msgstr[1] ""
msgstr[2] ""

#: data/json/obsoletion/items.json
msgid ""
"This laser pistol was based on the V29 laser pistol designed in the mid-21st"
" century.  While little more than duct tape and electronics, it runs on a "
"standard UPS."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/obsoletion/items.json
msgid "bone body armor"
msgid_plural "bone body armors"
msgstr[0] "armatura d'osso"
msgstr[1] "armature d'osso"
msgstr[2] "armature d'osso"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'bone body armor'}
#: data/json/obsoletion/items.json
msgid ""
"Body armor consisting of a leather suit with strategically-placed bone "
"reinforcement.  Light and strong."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/obsoletion/items.json
msgid "pair of bone armor gauntlets"
msgid_plural "pairs of bone armor gauntlets"
msgstr[0] "paio di guanti d'ossa corazzati"
msgstr[1] "paia di guanti d'ossa corazzati"
msgstr[2] "paia di guanti d'ossa corazzati"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'pair of bone armor gauntlets', 'str_pl': 'pairs
#. of bone armor gauntlets'}
#: data/json/obsoletion/items.json
msgid ""
"Leather gauntlets with bone armor reinforcement.  Very light and strong."
msgstr ""
"Guanti di pelle rinforzati con armatura d'ossa. Molto leggeri e resistenti."

#: data/json/obsoletion/items.json
msgid "match head bomb"
msgid_plural "match head bombs"
msgstr[0] ""
msgstr[1] ""
msgstr[2] ""

#. ~ Use action msg for {'str': 'match head bomb'}.
#: data/json/obsoletion/items.json
msgid "You light the match head bomb."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'match head bomb'}
#: data/json/obsoletion/items.json
msgid ""
"This is a homemade bomb consisting of a bottle filled with match heads and "
"equipped with a fuse.  Use this item to light the fuse; you will, of course,"
" need a lighter in your inventory to do this."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/obsoletion/items.json
msgid "match head bomb (lit)"
msgid_plural "match head bombs (lit)"
msgstr[0] ""
msgstr[1] ""
msgstr[2] ""

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'match head bomb (lit)', 'str_pl': 'match head
#. bombs (lit)'}
#: data/json/obsoletion/items.json
msgid ""
"This is a bottle filled with match heads and equipped with a fuse.  This one"
" has been lit, and its fuse is rapidly burning down.  You may not want to "
"hold onto it much longer."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/obsoletion/items.json
msgid "active black gunpowder bomb"
msgid_plural "active black gunpowder bombs"
msgstr[0] ""
msgstr[1] ""
msgstr[2] ""

#. ~ Use action no_deactivate_msg for {'str': 'active black gunpowder bomb'}.
#: data/json/obsoletion/items.json
msgid "You've already lit the fuse - throw it!"
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'active black gunpowder bomb'}
#: data/json/obsoletion/items.json
msgid ""
"This is a tin can filled to the brim with black gunpowder and with a lit "
"fuse stuck inside of it."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/obsoletion/items.json
msgid "hydrangea"
msgid_plural "hydrangeas"
msgstr[0] ""
msgstr[1] ""
msgstr[2] ""

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'hydrangea'}
#: data/json/obsoletion/items.json
