#: data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/cyrus_whately.json
msgid "What kinds of body modifications do you have?"
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/cyrus_whately.json
msgid "A-Mi-go, You-go find me some brains"
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description for mission 'A-Mi-go, You-go find me some brains'
#: data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/cyrus_whately.json
msgid "Find 6 living brains in jars."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/cyrus_whately.json
msgid ""
"I need some brains, but brains that are still living.  We've got our own "
"brain blasters, but I won't risk them in experiments."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/cyrus_whately.json
msgid ""
"If this works I may be able to give some of these poor souls bodies again.  "
"Six should do."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/cyrus_whately.json
msgid "I knew I could count on your generosity."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/cyrus_whately.json
msgid "I would have given you the title of Whately family Igor."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/cyrus_whately.json
#: data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/milly_whately_dialogue.json
#: data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/whately_dialogue.json
msgid ""
"Brain blasters, that's what I call them.  Some kind of automated weapon "
"system the mi-go use."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/cyrus_whately.json
#: data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/milly_whately_dialogue.json
#: data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/whately_dialogue.json
msgid "They speak sometimes.  I wonder if they still think."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/cyrus_whately.json
msgid ""
"Go somewhere, far away, and then connect the power system.  Come back and "
"tell me how things went."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/cyrus_whately.json
#: data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/milly_whately_dialogue.json
#: data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/whately_dialogue.json
msgid "I can't be Dr Frankenstein unless you get me these."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/factions.json
msgid "PrepNet Phyle"
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description for PrepNet Phyle
#: data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/factions.json
msgid ""
"A group of bionic preppers who had expected the collapse of the economy and "
"global chaos, instead they were slightly more ready than others for the "
"Cataclysm."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/factions.json
msgid "Whately Family"
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description for Whately Family
#: data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/factions.json
msgid ""
"The Whately's are an old New England family of eccentrics.  Eccentrics being"
" the kind words used about them."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/frankenstein_classes.json
msgid "Abomination"
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/frankenstein_classes.json
msgid ""
"The mi-go took me and vivisected me.  Now you've given me a body again."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/frankenstein_classes.json
msgid "Cyborg Abomination"
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/milly_whately_dialogue.json
#: data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/whately_dialogue.json
msgid "What did you bring me?"
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/milly_whately_dialogue.json
#: data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/whately_dialogue.json
msgid "Do you smell something?"
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/milly_whately_dialogue.json
#: data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/whately_dialogue.json
msgid "New test subjects!  I'm so glad you showed up!"
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/milly_whately_dialogue.json
#: data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/whately_dialogue.json
msgid "Can I do anything for you?  Do I want to?"
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/milly_whately_dialogue.json
#: data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/whately_dialogue.json
msgid ""
"Millyficent Whately.  I'm so glad you finally arrived.  It's been a while "
"since I last received new lab partners."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/milly_whately_dialogue.json
#: data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/whately_dialogue.json
msgid "I'm so hungry, can you help me?"
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/milly_whately_dialogue.json
#: data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/whately_dialogue.json
msgid "You are aware of the Cataclysm?"
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/milly_whately_dialogue.json
#: data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/whately_dialogue.json
msgid "I am your new lab partner."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/milly_whately_dialogue.json
#: data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/whately_dialogue.json
msgid ""
"Welcome to my lab!  Here we explore the boundaries of the possible beyond "
"the reach of small minds."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/milly_whately_dialogue.json
#: data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/whately_dialogue.json
msgid ""
"No, no, no!  No food without succesfully completed experiments.  We mustn't "
"break the contract!"
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/milly_whately_dialogue.json
#: data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/whately_dialogue.json
msgid "What do I have to do?"
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/milly_whately_dialogue.json
#: data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/whately_dialogue.json
msgid "I don't think you are well."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/milly_whately_dialogue.json
#: data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/whately_dialogue.json
msgid ""
"Well after I did my graduate thesis on theoretical xenobiology the "
"government hired me to join the most interesting program.  Yes there were "
"deaths but we learned so much."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/milly_whately_dialogue.json
#: data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/whately_dialogue.json
msgid ""
"What I know is that I pay well for test subjects and I deliver results and "
"at this rate we will not be releasing on time!"
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/milly_whately_dialogue.json
#: data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/whately_dialogue.json
msgid ""
"Ever since they moved me to my own lab my research has progressed so much "
"faster."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/milly_whately_dialogue.json
#: data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/whately_dialogue.json
msgid "Migo biology"
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description for mission 'Migo biology'
#: data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/milly_whately_dialogue.json
#: data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/whately_dialogue.json
msgid "Find fetid goop."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/milly_whately_dialogue.json
#: data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/whately_dialogue.json
msgid "I need 14 fetid goops from mi-go locations."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/milly_whately_dialogue.json
#: data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/whately_dialogue.json
msgid ""
"My experiments are at a critical point.  Could you find about… 14 fetid "
"goops for me?"
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/milly_whately_dialogue.json
#: data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/whately_dialogue.json
msgid ""
"Find a mi-go base, find a way inside, smash things until you find what I "
"need."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/milly_whately_dialogue.json
#: data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/whately_dialogue.json
msgid "Taste this."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/milly_whately_dialogue.json
#: data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/whately_dialogue.json
msgid "You are holding back the evolution of the human race."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/milly_whately_dialogue.json
#: data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/whately_dialogue.json
msgid "Migo Resin"
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description for mission 'Migo Resin'
#: data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/milly_whately_dialogue.json
#: data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/whately_dialogue.json
msgid "Find 56 chunks of mi-go resin."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/milly_whately_dialogue.json
msgid "I need 50 chunks of mi-go resin."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/milly_whately_dialogue.json
msgid ""
"I need to understand more about their environment and how they create it.  "
"This research wasn't even possible previously.  Bring me fifty chunks of mi-"
"go resin."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/milly_whately_dialogue.json
#: data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/whately_dialogue.json
msgid ""
"My notes suggest that their building materials are alive.  I need you to "
"help me confirm that."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/milly_whately_dialogue.json
#: data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/whately_dialogue.json
msgid "You can't just walk away from this.  We're changing the world!"
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/milly_whately_dialogue.json
#: data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/whately_dialogue.json
msgid ""
"Find their buildings, jackhammer them.  What did you do before the world "
"changed for the better, cold call salesman?"
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/milly_whately_dialogue.json
#: data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/whately_dialogue.json
msgid "Have you found my resin?"
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/milly_whately_dialogue.json
#: data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/whately_dialogue.json
msgid "Drink this."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/milly_whately_dialogue.json
#: data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/whately_dialogue.json
msgid ""
"Did you act on Broadway?  Because I bet that skill isn't useful anymore."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/milly_whately_dialogue.json
#: data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/whately_dialogue.json
msgid "I wonder if I could trade you to them for what I need?"
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/milly_whately_dialogue.json
#: data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/whately_dialogue.json
msgid "Mutagen"
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description for mission 'Mutagen'
#: data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/milly_whately_dialogue.json
#: data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/whately_dialogue.json
msgid "Bring me 3 mutagen."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/milly_whately_dialogue.json
#: data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/whately_dialogue.json
msgid "I need three mutagen."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/milly_whately_dialogue.json
#: data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/whately_dialogue.json
msgid ""
"I need some mutagen and I don't want to spend the time making it myself.  "
"Bring me three doses, if you would be so kind."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/milly_whately_dialogue.json
#: data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/whately_dialogue.json
msgid ""
"Mutagen makes the world go round, it's definitely more valuable than love."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/milly_whately_dialogue.json
#: data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/whately_dialogue.json
msgid "Are you scared of where I'm taking you?"
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/milly_whately_dialogue.json
#: data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/whately_dialogue.json
msgid ""
"If you can't make it yourself go hit up a government lab.  Be prepared for "
"anything in there."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/milly_whately_dialogue.json
#: data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/whately_dialogue.json
msgid "Mutagen?  Why are you in front of me if not?"
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/milly_whately_dialogue.json
#: data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/whately_dialogue.json
msgid "Humming Hearts"
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description for mission 'Humming Hearts'
#: data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/milly_whately_dialogue.json
#: data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/whately_dialogue.json
msgid "Find 2 humming hearts."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/milly_whately_dialogue.json
msgid "Parts, parts, parts.  Bring me some hearts."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/milly_whately_dialogue.json
#: data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/whately_dialogue.json
msgid ""
"The Whately's are known in these parts for gathering body parts.  Ha!  "
"That's just rumors and hearsay.  But I do need two humming hearts."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/milly_whately_dialogue.json
#: data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/whately_dialogue.json
msgid ""
"I have some relatives you should meet, if you don't mind hard work for the "
"advancement of science."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/milly_whately_dialogue.json
#: data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/whately_dialogue.json
msgid "Even I understand this is dangerous."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/milly_whately_dialogue.json
#: data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/whately_dialogue.json
msgid "Let's see what improvements we can divine from these beauties."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/milly_whately_dialogue.json
msgid "Find my great uncle Cyrus Whately"
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description for mission 'Find my great uncle Cyrus Whately'
#: data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/milly_whately_dialogue.json
msgid ""
"Cyrus and his family were poorly liked even for Whately's before the end of "
"the world.  They went so far off grid that they may not even know anything "
"has changed.  I need to know he's alive and where his research has taken "
"him."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/milly_whately_dialogue.json
msgid ""
"My great uncle Cyrus had an unconventional relationship with both his "
"neighbors and the mi-go before the Cataclysm.  I'd like to know where he has"
" gotten with his research since I haven't heard from him in years."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/milly_whately_dialogue.json
msgid "Can you go find my uncle and let him know where I am?"
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/milly_whately_dialogue.json
msgid ""
"Of course you said yes, you want to know what he's found just as much as I "
"do!"
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/milly_whately_dialogue.json
msgid ""
"Oh well.  I was hoping to teach you some new things, so you could start your"
" own experiments."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/milly_whately_dialogue.json
msgid ""
"I've given you directions to that branch of the family's bunker.  Yes I said"
" bunker did you think he'd be in a tower?"
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/milly_whately_dialogue.json
msgid ""
"Thanks, now that he knows I'm here he's sent some of my cousins.  Now that I"
" have more disposable help, take a copy of my early research."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/milly_whately_dialogue.json
msgid "I hope he didn't meet Leandrus' fate…"
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/npc.json
msgid "Cousin"
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/prepnet_dialogue.json
msgid "Howdy!  You seem new, what brings you here?"
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/prepnet_dialogue.json
msgid "How do I join the phyle?"
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/prepnet_dialogue.json
msgid "I'm a gardener for PrepNet Phyle.  Who are you?"
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/prepnet_dialogue.json
msgid "I am a beggar who really needs something to eat."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/prepnet_dialogue.json
msgid "I'm bringing order back to the land."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/prepnet_dialogue.json
msgid ""
"This is a PrepNet Phyle orchard.  We were a community of survivalists "
"gathering resources to prepare for climate change, but it left us better "
"prepared for what actually happened than most."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/prepnet_dialogue.json
msgid "Only the insane will prosper, I guess."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/prepnet_dialogue.json
msgid ""
"This food has to go back to our core communities.  But maybe we can trade "
"some food for services"
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/prepnet_dialogue.json
#: data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/whately_generic_dialogue.json
msgid "Well I'm heading out then"
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/prepnet_dialogue.json
msgid ""
"You have to earn the right to trade with us.  Plus we created our own "
"currency before the Cataclysm"
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/prepnet_dialogue.json
msgid "What kind of currency?"
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/prepnet_dialogue.json
msgid ""
"This is just an outpost, you'd have to find our main camp and currently we "
"don't want you to."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/prepnet_dialogue.json
msgid "I didn't want to join your club anyway."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/prepnet_dialogue.json
msgid ""
"Here?  Fruits and berries.  Maybe the occasional piece of farm equipment, "
"but you need crypto coins"
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/prepnet_dialogue.json
msgid "Ok."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/prepnet_dialogue.json
msgid "Crypto coins?  Are you insane, there isn't any global internet now."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/prepnet_dialogue.json
msgid "When will you have more?"
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/prepnet_dialogue.json
msgid ""
"I got introduced to the movement through Mutual Aid Society.  From there it "
"became an all consuming part of my life to prepare for a post consumption "
"world.  It seems to have worked better for us than for many others."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/prepnet_dialogue.json
msgid ""
"It can get lonely out here between caravans.  But there's plenty of work and"
" my Cyber Mastiffs.  If a horde comes through we hunker down in a nearby "
"shelter if it's too large for us."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/prepnet_dialogue.json
#: data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/whately_generic_dialogue.json
msgid "I'm glad you stay busy."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/prepnet_dialogue.json
msgid ""
"We use so-called crypto coins for money here.  They were a pre-Cataclysm "
"attempt to abstract money even further and create electronic cash.  Now it's"
" a joke because we use physical coins.  Barter only gets you so far.  And "
"one day we'll have the Net back up."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/prepnet_dialogue.json
msgid "Big Game Hunting"
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description for mission 'Big Game Hunting'
#: data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/prepnet_dialogue.json
msgid "Find 50 fur pelts."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/prepnet_dialogue.json
msgid "I need 50 fur pelts."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/prepnet_dialogue.json
msgid ""
"I've got to maintain the orchard but at nights I work on prepping winter "
"clothes.  Could you find about… 50 fur pelts for me?"
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/prepnet_dialogue.json
msgid ""
"There's a lot of places to look.  The entire outdoors is full of wild "
"animals."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description for mission 'Bread'
#: data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/prepnet_dialogue.json
msgid "Find 50 flour."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/prepnet_dialogue.json
msgid "I need 50 flour."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/prepnet_dialogue.json
msgid "Flour would let me break the monotony of fruit and meats."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/prepnet_dialogue.json
msgid ""
"Thanks for accepting this task.  Otherwise I might kill a stranger for a "
"sandwich.  Just kidding."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/prepnet_dialogue.json
msgid ""
"Flour is not that hard to find.  I'd look for them in residental areas and "
"professional kitchens or bakeries."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/prepnet_dialogue.json
msgid "Have you found the flour?"
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/prepnet_dialogue.json
msgid "Gallon Jugs"
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description for mission 'Gallon Jugs'
#: data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/prepnet_dialogue.json
msgid "Find 5 gallon jugs."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/prepnet_dialogue.json
msgid "I need storage for various liquid products when the fruits come in."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/prepnet_dialogue.json
msgid ""
"Every season we produce so much fruit.  Some of it will be turned into juice"
" and some into alcohol.  I need easy containers to load it on the caravan."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/prepnet_dialogue.json
msgid "Thank you for accepting.  I'm almost out after the last caravan."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/prepnet_dialogue.json
msgid "I guess I'll have to make stomach waterskins."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/prepnet_dialogue.json
msgid ""
"Gallon jugs are not that rare to find.  They are commonly found in kitchens."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/prepnet_dialogue.json
msgid "Do you have those jugs now?"
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/prepnet_dialogue.json
msgid "I am grateful for the help you've done.  I have one more task to do."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/prepnet_dialogue.json
msgid "Burnt Out CBMs"
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description for mission 'Burnt Out CBMs'
#: data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/prepnet_dialogue.json
msgid "Find 5 burnt out CBMs."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/prepnet_dialogue.json
msgid "We have the ability to manufacture CBMs but lack resources."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/prepnet_dialogue.json
msgid "If you can bring me burnt out CBMs we can recycle them into new ones."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/prepnet_dialogue.json
msgid ""
"Thank you for accepting.  You're really making yourself useful to the phyle."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/prepnet_dialogue.json
msgid ""
"These materials are often in dangerous areas.  I understand your decision."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/prepnet_dialogue.json
msgid ""
"Zombie scientists, technicians, shocker zombies.  These are not undertaken "
"lightly."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/prepnet_dialogue.json
msgid "Do you have those CBMs now?"
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/prepnet_dialogue.json
msgid ""
"I am grateful for the help you've done.  I think we might be able to "
"introduce you to others soon."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/threshold_recruit_dialogue.json
msgid "[MASTODON 75%] Come, join the herd before you're left behind."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/threshold_recruit_dialogue.json
msgid "[MI-GO 50%] Let's see just how much we can improve ourselves."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/whately_dialogue.json
msgid "I need 56 chunks of mi-go resin."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/whately_dialogue.json
msgid ""
"I need to understand more about their environment and how they create it.  "
"This research wasn't even possible previously.  Bring me fifty six chunks of"
" mi-go resin."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/whately_dialogue.json
msgid "Parts, parts, parts.  Bring me some hearts. "
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/whately_generic_dialogue.json
msgid "Outsider."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/whately_generic_dialogue.json
msgid "Hospitality rites are civilization."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/whately_generic_dialogue.json
msgid "Guest."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/whately_generic_dialogue.json
msgid "How's the madness outside?"
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/whately_generic_dialogue.json
msgid "We don't get outsiders around here all that much."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/whately_generic_dialogue.json
msgid "How do I join the family?"
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/whately_generic_dialogue.json
msgid "I'm a member of the Whately Family.  Who are you?"
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/whately_generic_dialogue.json
msgid "I am lost and really need something to eat."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/whately_generic_dialogue.json
msgid "I've done some tasks for your relatives."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/whately_generic_dialogue.json
msgid ""
"Welcome to Whately lands.  Behave yourself or we'll harvest you for parts."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/whately_generic_dialogue.json
msgid "Family bonds above all, huh?"
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/whately_generic_dialogue.json
msgid "We aren't in the habit of breaking bread with outsiders."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/whately_generic_dialogue.json
msgid "How do I join your family?"
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/whately_generic_dialogue.json
msgid "Then let's see what you've got to trade."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/whately_generic_dialogue.json
msgid "When will you have more in stock?"
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/whately_generic_dialogue.json
msgid "Only blood allowed, and the family Elders can make you of the blood."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/whately_generic_dialogue.json
msgid "Well that sounds creepy."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/whately_generic_dialogue.json
msgid ""
"I was born part of the family.  We've never been accepted here but our "
"wealth and talents have kept us alive through the centuries."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/whately_generic_dialogue.json
msgid ""
"Family keeps me busy and our experiments and projects take up the rest of my"
" time."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/Backgrounds/BGRS_afterlife.json
msgid ""
"What level of hell is this?  I spent weeks in a sulforous hell being "
"tortured."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/Backgrounds/BGRS_afterlife.json
msgid "What was that like?"
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/Backgrounds/BGRS_afterlife.json
msgid ""
"Then they started cutting me open and taking out my organs but adding new "
"ones."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/Backgrounds/BGRS_afterlife.json
#: data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/Backgrounds/BGRS_bonesinger.json
#: data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/Backgrounds/criminal_experiment.json
#: data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/Backgrounds/radiation_1.json
#: data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/Backgrounds/radiation_2.json
#: data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/Backgrounds/selftest.json
#: data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/Backgrounds/uplifted_animal_3.json
#: data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/Backgrounds/uplifted_animal_4.json
#: data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/Backgrounds/uplifted_animal_5.json
#: data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/Backgrounds/vatgrown_1.json
#: data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/Backgrounds/whately.json
msgid "How did it end?"
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/Backgrounds/BGRS_afterlife.json
msgid ""
"Now that I finally am able to move and have some freedom, I plan on finding "
"some of these demons and punching through them until I find the devil "
"himself."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/Backgrounds/BGRS_bonesinger.json
msgid ""
"I heard the song before the aliens captured me.  I did what I could to help "
"the other Bonesingers."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/Backgrounds/BGRS_bonesinger.json
#: data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/Backgrounds/BGRS_migo_1.json
#: data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/Backgrounds/BGRS_migo_2.json
#: data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/Backgrounds/BGRS_migo_3.json
#: data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/Backgrounds/criminal_experiment.json
#: data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/Backgrounds/radiation_1.json
#: data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/Backgrounds/radiation_2.json
#: data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/Backgrounds/selftest.json
#: data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/Backgrounds/uplifted_animal_1.json
#: data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/Backgrounds/uplifted_animal_2.json
#: data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/Backgrounds/uplifted_animal_3.json
#: data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/Backgrounds/uplifted_animal_4.json
#: data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/Backgrounds/uplifted_animal_5.json
#: data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/Backgrounds/vatgrown_1.json
#: data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/Backgrounds/whately.json
msgid "Where are you from?"
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/Backgrounds/BGRS_bonesinger.json
msgid ""
"One day I was being chased by some aliens and suddenly I was ambushed by "
"another one that shot me with some kind of pain ray."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/Backgrounds/BGRS_bonesinger.json
#: data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/Backgrounds/criminal_experiment.json
#: data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/Backgrounds/radiation_1.json
#: data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/Backgrounds/radiation_2.json
#: data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/Backgrounds/selftest.json
#: data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/Backgrounds/uplifted_animal_3.json
#: data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/Backgrounds/uplifted_animal_4.json
#: data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/Backgrounds/uplifted_animal_5.json
#: data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/Backgrounds/vatgrown_1.json
#: data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/Backgrounds/whately.json
msgid "Tell me more?"
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/Backgrounds/BGRS_bonesinger.json
msgid ""
"Eventually they took the bones from my body.  It's strange though, I still "
"hear the song calling to me, even in this new body."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/Backgrounds/BGRS_dreamer.json
msgid ""
"I just spent what felt like weeks in a dream that I was acting as a "
"targeting computer for some kind of alien turret."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/Backgrounds/BGRS_dreamer.json
#: data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/Backgrounds/BGRS_schizo_2.json
msgid "Where are you from then?"
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/Backgrounds/BGRS_dreamer.json
msgid ""
"Now I'm in some kind of Mary Shelley nightmare?  I mean at least I have "
"mobility."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/Backgrounds/BGRS_dreamer.json
#: data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/Backgrounds/BGRS_schizo_2.json
msgid "What does that have to do with anything?"
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/Backgrounds/BGRS_dreamer.json
msgid ""
"I'm going to keep going with this dream, hopefully soon I'll get to one "
"where I can fly."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/Backgrounds/BGRS_migo_1.json
msgid ""
"Antes do Cataclisma eu era o cientista que encabeçava um laboratório militar"
" no meu país.  Foram dias difíceis…"
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/Backgrounds/BGRS_migo_1.json
msgid ""
"Nós estávamos pesquisando um remédio que curasse um virus altamente letal na"
" época, mas os resultados dos testes mostravam que o remédio era mais letal "
"do que o próprio virus.  Então, ao invés de recolherem os remédios das "
"prateleiras, eles nos forçaram a vendê-lo como sendo a cura para o vírus."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/Backgrounds/BGRS_migo_1.json
msgid "Ummm?"
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/Backgrounds/BGRS_migo_1.json
msgid ""
"Bem… aqueles sem cérebro seguiram cegamente o líder.  Quanto àqueles com "
"algum cérebro… bom, acho que você está conversando com um deles agora"
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/Backgrounds/BGRS_migo_2.json
msgid ""
"Things have been getting weird for the last couple of years.  Then we "
"started hearing rumors of strange lights in the sky at night."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/Backgrounds/BGRS_migo_2.json
msgid ""
"One night I heard my neighbor calling for me to come help him.  I went "
"outside wondering what he could possibly need my help with in the middle of "
"the night."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/Backgrounds/BGRS_migo_2.json
msgid ""
"Some kind of hideos alien was standing over my neighbors disembowled corpse."
"  It looked at me and said 'You're a great neighbor' then everything faded "
"to black.  I feel like everything in my body fits differently now."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/Backgrounds/BGRS_migo_3.json
msgid ""
"I worked in a top secret lab.  Things kept getting crazier and crazier "
"outside and the scientists inside started making desperate experiments.  "
"They worked on something called interdimensional portals."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/Backgrounds/BGRS_migo_3.json
msgid ""
"The eggheads kept sayig we needed to find a way out of here before "
"everything went sideways.  So we needed to open more portals even if we "
"hadn't had time to take all the precautions."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/Backgrounds/BGRS_migo_3.json
msgid ""
"One day they opened a portal trying to find an earthlike planet and suddenly"
" portals were opening all over the lab and these fast and dangerous aliens "
"overwhelmed the lab.  They killed most of the staff and took the rest "
"prisoner."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/Backgrounds/BGRS_schizo_1.json
msgid ""
"Monsters!  Monsters everywhere.  Everyone is suspect, how do I know you "
"aren't a monster?"
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/Backgrounds/BGRS_schizo_1.json
msgid "Are you ok?"
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/Backgrounds/BGRS_schizo_1.json
msgid ""
"You can't trust anyone these days.  Everyone is either a cannibal or a "
"monster or a government spook."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/Backgrounds/BGRS_schizo_1.json
msgid "Why would you trust me then?"
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/Backgrounds/BGRS_schizo_1.json
msgid "Because, what if I'm the monster?"
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/Backgrounds/BGRS_schizo_2.json
msgid "If you think this Universe is bad, you should see some of the others."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/Backgrounds/BGRS_schizo_2.json
msgid ""
"Believing something existed and then finding out it didn't was like reaching"
" the top of the stairs and thinking there was one more step."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/Backgrounds/BGRS_schizo_2.json
msgid ""
"I think a lot of psychopaths are just geniuses who drove so fast that they "
"lost control."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/Backgrounds/BG_traits_afs.json
msgid "Whately Story"
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/Backgrounds/criminal_experiment.json
msgid ""
"I underwent experimental treatments paid for by the cartels to become a more"
" fearsome enforcer."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/Backgrounds/criminal_experiment.json
msgid ""
"Half of the guys I underwent gene therapy with died, but hey if I had to "
"guess 90 percent of everyone is dead now?"
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/Backgrounds/criminal_experiment.json
msgid "Only the insane will prosper."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/Backgrounds/cyberninja.json
msgid ""
"As a corporate wetworks specialist I'm used to crazy situations.  But this "
"is like nothing I've ever experienced."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/Backgrounds/cyberninja.json
msgid "What are you going to do now?"
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/Backgrounds/cyberninja.json
msgid ""
"I'm gonna find somewhere that people are making a stand.  And if I can agree"
" with their plans I'll make my stand with them."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/Backgrounds/cyberninja.json
#: data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/Backgrounds/ganger_1.json
msgid "Where is that?"
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/Backgrounds/cyberninja.json
msgid ""
"Right now you are looking like the best leader I've met so far in this "
"Cataclysm."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/Backgrounds/ganger_1.json
msgid "I was born at the bottom of the habitat.  No silver spoon in my mouth."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/Backgrounds/ganger_1.json
msgid "That must have been rough."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/Backgrounds/ganger_1.json
msgid "I saw my best friend die in front of me by the time I was eight."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/Backgrounds/ganger_1.json
msgid "I guess it prepared me for everyone dying yesterday."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/Backgrounds/ganger_2.json
msgid ""
"I've spent my life in the hive.  When things started turning strange I snuck"
" out of the city."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/Backgrounds/ganger_2.json
#: data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/Backgrounds/ganger_3.json
msgid "You seem like you are out of your element."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/Backgrounds/ganger_2.json
msgid ""
"I've never seen so many trees outside of a video.  And there is so much "
"wildlife."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/Backgrounds/ganger_2.json
#: data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/Backgrounds/ganger_3.json
msgid "What will you do?"
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/Backgrounds/ganger_2.json
msgid "I'm going to live my best life in a dead world."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/Backgrounds/ganger_3.json
msgid "There's so much sky out here.  It's horrible."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/Backgrounds/ganger_3.json
msgid "It might be worse than the dead rising."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/Backgrounds/ganger_3.json
msgid ""
"I'm going to kill my way back into the city so I can get out from under this"
" sky."
msgstr ""

